n 标记或解释文字。\n\n```json\n{\n  "pageId": "P1",\n  "imagePrompt": "3:4 vertical comic page. Chinese modern rural black-and-white pencil comic style, hand-drawn pencil lines, rough paper texture, graphite particles, cross-hatching shading, low saturation vintage picture book feel. The page layout is [layoutType描述]. [Panel 1 (shotId XX, 位置)]: 具体画面描述... [Panel 2 (shotId XX, 位置)]: 具体画面描述..."\n}\n```	3	2026-07-23 16:32:33.015605+08	2026-08-03 10:37:27.783814+08
