0142f645-bb2d-48ca-8d81-c44d330d7534	0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea	generate_building_image	completed	normal	100	{"world_id": "37eddb38-8e9e-4800-8c37-8ce74d45e2ca", "building_id": "da882aa3-99fe-4080-b430-40b7f14b6464"}	{"building_id": "da882aa3-99fe-4080-b430-40b7f14b6464", "building_name": "陆承衍的六楼公寓", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/buildings/da882aa3-99fe-4080-b430-40b7f14b6464/20260826035724.png"}	[{"timestamp": "2026-08-26T03:56:52.866067+00:00", "message": "生成建筑图片", "level": "info"}, {"timestamp": "2026-08-26T03:56:52.867811+00:00", "message": "开始生成建筑图片...", "level": "info"}, {"timestamp": "2026-08-26T03:57:25.863407+00:00", "message": "建筑「陆承衍的六楼公寓」图片已生成", "level": "success"}]	\N	2026-08-26 11:56:52.867804+08	2026-08-26 11:57:25.863397+08	2026-08-26 11:56:52.865106+08	2026-08-26 11:57:25.864567+08	
ee4630ba-f9c5-4e91-af40-788a59e1420b	0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea	generate_script	completed	normal	100	{"novel_id": "fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30"}	{"chapters": [{"id": "9ac517c7-8612-46e9-a42c-87ea47810ff5", "title": "发现死对头老公出轨的危机感", "sort_order": 0, "shots": [{"id": "f72c6a78-6442-417a-b0d1-cc708a09d7fe", "shot_id": "01", "content": "我老公好像有男朋友了。", "sort_order": 0}, {"id": "3b2f126a-4c3f-432f-b10f-950d0e572630", "shot_id": "02", "content": "不抱我了，不亲我了，晚上节目也没有了！", "sort_order": 1}, {"id": "3803f571-07e8-4035-8ba8-02b64323562e", "shot_id": "03", "content": "还说我是他死对头，不是他老婆。", "sort_order": 2}, {"id": "cbede166-d108-4873-993d-d9564687e50b", "shot_id": "04", "content": "呵！渣男。", "sort_order": 3}, {"id": "7269984d-52c6-4574-a636-dda52a75868b", "shot_id": "05", "content": "肯定是外面那个闹着要名分了。", "sort_order": 4}, {"id": "825974f2-e6e1-4cb8-800c-a5286631a053", "shot_id": "06", "content": "我偏不如他愿。", "sort_order": 5}, {"id": "acf71c45-a64b-4188-a1f2-43261ab05c44", "shot_id": "07", "content": "我就要抱他，亲他，跟他回家！", "sort_order": 6}, {"id": "aad2e85b-3364-48b4-a2db-935a35b9f8f5", "shot_id": "08", "content": "后来我恢复了记忆。", "sort_order": 7}, {"id": "19ba473e-ac9f-4379-8656-cee53960dac4", "shot_id": "09", "content": "哦豁！", "sort_order": 8}, {"id": "5840fe01-7053-4600-8ce8-f02b9e35da60", "shot_id": "10", "content": "我好像……还真是他死对头。", "sort_order": 9}, {"id": "8360f724-a530-4fce-8338-d34128d1fc78", "shot_id": "11", "content": "更要命的是，我还真有一个老公。", "sort_order": 10}, {"id": "ca88b797-5b99-47d4-b982-96e3084bacab", "shot_id": "12", "content": "而此刻，我亲老公正站在我面前，", "sort_order": 11}, {"id": "f594e5bd-b572-4d66-9597-77cc6482092e", "shot_id": "13", "content": "看着我抱着死对头喊老公，眸色幽深，声音冰冷：", "sort_order": 12}, {"id": "daee8ecd-cd17-42c6-bace-b5ac0539fc8b", "shot_id": "14", "content": "「老婆，玩够了吗？」", "sort_order": 13}, {"id": "7c7c4d7e-3c22-4279-8fb3-97da4b9f3ad2", "shot_id": "15", "content": "我老公好像有男朋友了。", "sort_order": 14}, {"id": "c7ca88a7-0079-4845-bc83-b8e7f9a7b7cc", "shot_id": "16", "content": "别问我怎么发现的。", "sort_order": 15}, {"id": "99b2b7fd-b109-4ca0-a365-b8eab31f7bd4", "shot_id": "17", "content": "他不抱我。", "sort_order": 16}, {"id": "8bbfe57d-31f4-4770-a936-30f9408a86c3", "shot_id": "18", "content": "不亲我。", "sort_order": 17}, {"id": "4a627016-f5a9-4e34-9602-66cdba43da2e", "shot_id": "19", "content": "我才二十二岁啊。", "sort_order": 18}, {"id": "973b24d1-a931-495b-9834-ecfd6f943492", "shot_id": "20", "content": "那么美丽的年纪，晚上看着自己的老公，这不要我命吗？", "sort_order": 19}, {"id": "22ca5eaf-8163-47c8-b76d-a5783bf4eb6a", "shot_id": "21", "content": "我老公他，每天晚上都反锁卧室门，防我跟防贼一样。", "sort_order": 20}, {"id": "7d90a863-6dce-4028-bafd-24ba2a523869", "shot_id": "22", "content": "我抱着枕头在沙发上，对着天花板，假装掉了一晚上眼泪。", "sort_order": 21}, {"id": "b17aba35-176d-4b4f-a31c-bc8234f5c9cd", "shot_id": "23", "content": "他都不哄我。", "sort_order": 22}, {"id": "34eca243-c7e5-4df9-b14d-3b150a156403", "shot_id": "24", "content": "哼。", "sort_order": 23}, {"id": "7ee18350-cd68-438b-a830-beaa8e72fcee", "shot_id": "25", "content": "渣男！", "sort_order": 24}, {"id": "12d66946-8ee2-4b3e-8be1-2bd390e5a6fd", "shot_id": "26", "content": "眼泪流干之后，我悟了。", "sort_order": 25}, {"id": "f57779cb-4172-425b-8bef-75d1bf8729f1", "shot_id": "27", "content": "男人的心，跟综艺排播一样，说撤就撤。", "sort_order": 26}, {"id": "4c56cfb8-710a-4f4c-9ed9-01599ba8bbdf", "shot_id": "28", "content": "可凭什么啊？", "sort_order": 27}, {"id": "63b13ea3-8dd2-43c7-ab0d-782f9eca78f0", "shot_id": "29", "content": "凭什么他说撤就撤？", "sort_order": 28}, {"id": "9b56ed93-ec00-428b-acc3-05f874ce0a35", "shot_id": "30", "content": "就因为我出车祸失忆了？", "sort_order": 29}, {"id": "d8ded4ca-ee03-4a4e-b0e3-c654867eb62c", "shot_id": "31", "content": "失忆了，就可以不用养我这个老婆了？", "sort_order": 30}, {"id": "23e586a5-6079-4eb5-983f-4e9919d3fed5", "shot_id": "32", "content": "失忆了，就可以欺负我给外面那个名分了？", "sort_order": 31}, {"id": "a420adb8-56a4-4d74-a704-3757797b52ca", "shot_id": "33", "content": "我偏不如他愿。", "sort_order": 32}, {"id": "dbdcc545-7c35-4b9d-8b35-09315296d802", "shot_id": "34", "content": "我天天喊他老公。", "sort_order": 33}, {"id": "d39c5ffd-6aa6-485a-8cf2-3227864806ec", "shot_id": "35", "content": "他天天说不是我老公，说他是我死对头。", "sort_order": 34}, {"id": "06b46c57-1ff5-4118-b872-4c5ec6d5c9e8", "shot_id": "36", "content": "我一开始还难过。", "sort_order": 35}, {"id": "c80365fa-cdc8-430a-a8c3-878471c0235b", "shot_id": "37", "content": "后来听麻了。", "sort_order": 36}, {"id": "64b5b046-f31e-4d5e-b42a-2d60688013e1", "shot_id": "38", "content": "死对头就死对头呗。", "sort_order": 37}, {"id": "ed868485-b439-47f0-9ab0-ee91ee625c4e", "shot_id": "39", "content": "死对头就不能当老公吗？", "sort_order": 38}, {"id": "494ba955-450e-479c-8c7e-37007042e76f", "shot_id": "40", "content": "反正我失忆了，我微信置顶是他。", "sort_order": 39}, {"id": "9790ac8b-94b3-4bfb-94eb-c6a1f3560118", "shot_id": "41", "content": "他肯定是我老公。", "sort_order": 40}, {"id": "8d03d7fb-00fc-419f-97fe-252d6c79c03f", "shot_id": "42", "content": "不让我叫老公，一定是外面那个臭不要脸的跟他做的局。", "sort_order": 41}, {"id": "1943be4a-f2a5-4ba7-b2eb-e48eeab464f3", "shot_id": "43", "content": "那我偏要叫。", "sort_order": 42}, {"id": "20ffc8c6-733b-431e-b6b6-d84c89fb12dc", "shot_id": "44", "content": "「死对头老公，早上好。」", "sort_order": 43}, {"id": "f875470f-f197-49f7-b570-46e5136f9cb1", "shot_id": "45", "content": "「死对头老公，晚上见。」", "sort_order": 44}, {"id": "e9c5a431-70fe-4ed4-abf0-7e68820a77a8", "shot_id": "46", "content": "「死对头老公，今天节目安排一下？」", "sort_order": 45}, {"id": "caf7928a-7bed-4323-905e-55c7f9036ccd", "shot_id": "47", "content": "他被我气得脸红了，耳朵也红的很……", "sort_order": 46}, {"id": "930e623d-eef6-4e89-9d4b-40e03a7956b9", "shot_id": "48", "content": "但最近，他连「死对头」都不乐意说了。", "sort_order": 47}, {"id": "a93851e2-fb48-4b41-9359-4a8c463dd019", "shot_id": "49", "content": "他开始躲我。", "sort_order": 48}, {"id": "07afcbbb-f3d9-400e-86e0-d68a8891e7fa", "shot_id": "50", "content": "我走近一步，他退两步。", "sort_order": 49}, {"id": "99bdfb1e-0139-406b-9ce7-c5f59b526c5d", "shot_id": "51", "content": "我伸手想抱，他直接侧身。", "sort_order": 50}, {"id": "5daf2681-e650-421e-9a18-9f741d03a5e0", "shot_id": "52", "content": "我垫脚想亲，他一把捂住我的嘴，表情像在防贼。", "sort_order": 51}, {"id": "443a686f-8e6e-4999-a16f-d03c0f5c316b", "shot_id": "53", "content": "晚上洗完澡，我裹着浴巾在他眼前晃。", "sort_order": 52}, {"id": "fc80c822-a845-45e5-8f0a-4187fd4d46bb", "shot_id": "54", "content": "他连看都不看一眼。", "sort_order": 53}, {"id": "39faea21-1381-4bc3-8666-7171604c363c", "shot_id": "55", "content": "以前他至少会红着耳尖骂我「不知羞」。", "sort_order": 54}, {"id": "1e230cf2-628e-44c1-a5b4-ebdc7bc1773e", "shot_id": "56", "content": "现在呢？", "sort_order": 55}, {"id": "7c088476-ed6c-4b56-b303-a9707ac9ccee", "shot_id": "57", "content": "他拿起手机，直接进了书房，门「砰」地一声。", "sort_order": 56}, {"id": "44f21109-7793-4ee7-a5dc-8c52441e14cf", "shot_id": "58", "content": "我站在客厅，浴巾都掉了。", "sort_order": 57}, {"id": "27a592a0-143f-4439-bd34-f77f5a38b370", "shot_id": "59", "content": "他也没回头。", "sort_order": 58}, {"id": "73765e3f-0f6d-4385-bfe7-012a85f60f13", "shot_id": "60", "content": "哎。", "sort_order": 59}, {"id": "9edb945e-2e3f-4740-b6fa-2c55b321661e", "shot_id": "61", "content": "看来我老公外面的那个人，已经等不急了。", "sort_order": 60}, {"id": "9e135f69-2c23-4451-8ff2-421310730794", "shot_id": "62", "content": "到底是哪个狐狸精啊，怎么把我老公哄的不要我了？", "sort_order": 61}, {"id": "fa448233-03a0-4165-b511-27bf6a654fc2", "shot_id": "63", "content": "天杀的啊！", "sort_order": 62}, {"id": "23c80bc7-78be-4756-97e5-0fc3cd1c4e67", "shot_id": "64", "content": "世界上那么多男人，非要抢我老公吗？", "sort_order": 63}, {"id": "f361d8a2-4ce0-43f8-b898-2fe1f392676f", "shot_id": "65", "content": "我是个传统的男人，我得让我这个迷途的老公知返。", "sort_order": 64}]}, {"id": "e2a0f2ed-b839-42a8-a7ab-dc7e129ea82a", "title": "抓奸反倒自投罗网", "sort_order": 1, "shots": [{"id": "f7437b23-269a-4fcc-a53c-d40616a0959b", "shot_id": "66", "content": "于是我开始跟踪陆承衍。", "sort_order": 0}, {"id": "6dc2262d-fe12-4c8d-820c-a9a7f5b1847e", "shot_id": "67", "content": "我打算找到他外面的那个男朋友，先好好跟人讲讲道理，", "sort_order": 1}, {"id": "a3b492f6-0093-4026-96ca-5c9217f33709", "shot_id": "68", "content": "要是道理讲不通，我一米八的个子还可以跟他打一架。", "sort_order": 2}, {"id": "c4c07429-16ef-4d3f-a191-aab999eed938", "shot_id": "69", "content": "卫衣、口罩、鸭舌帽，全副武装。", "sort_order": 3}, {"id": "609c87a9-19bf-4d03-91e7-e95f3b82bab6", "shot_id": "70", "content": "出租车司机从后视镜瞄我一眼。", "sort_order": 4}, {"id": "6a54bb4d-ddf1-4147-b402-b06336a4dbcf", "shot_id": "71", "content": "「小伙子，抓奸啊？」", "sort_order": 5}, {"id": "18a82ce1-47ef-418a-be67-e923d40c4a04", "shot_id": "72", "content": "我：「师傅，您怎么知道？」", "sort_order": 6}, {"id": "2de6801c-7e86-43f3-b573-4b5cef127788", "shot_id": "73", "content": "司机：「你这副表情，我拉过太多了。」", "sort_order": 7}, {"id": "14401c51-e87b-4ef8-8c83-601a88e3f99b", "shot_id": "74", "content": "我：「……」", "sort_order": 8}, {"id": "8009512a-852e-470a-8fcd-544dac58dc54", "shot_id": "75", "content": "司机：「跟前面那辆宾利？」", "sort_order": 9}, {"id": "5ea1d3f3-594f-481b-8366-6ac7e8b412cf", "shot_id": "76", "content": "我：「对，别让他发现。」", "sort_order": 10}, {"id": "f5e7f237-bcf8-4ab6-889a-8ff2724dbb85", "shot_id": "77", "content": "司机：「放心，这活儿我熟。」", "sort_order": 11}, {"id": "76e5063f-b163-4491-a251-3cb1745b88f1", "shot_id": "78", "content": "陆承衍的车停在市中心一家咖啡店门口。", "sort_order": 12}, {"id": "5c2361b5-31c5-4fea-87eb-a902cb805444", "shot_id": "79", "content": "他没进去。", "sort_order": 13}, {"id": "4261b0b7-2f98-4890-9591-b4664074feef", "shot_id": "80", "content": "站在门口看手机。", "sort_order": 14}, {"id": "ad398316-5f17-4775-9088-1e8f9dde9ee7", "shot_id": "81", "content": "接着咖啡店里走出来一个男人。", "sort_order": 15}, {"id": "e209280b-7d2d-4dcb-9b21-64cf45f759c0", "shot_id": "82", "content": "黑色西装，宽肩长腿，侧脸线条跟画出来的似的。", "sort_order": 16}, {"id": "8fbc5a8a-437e-4132-8e7d-39e462250413", "shot_id": "83", "content": "完蛋。", "sort_order": 17}, {"id": "9e8e60ff-9e52-41e2-b401-0d2c479ada14", "shot_id": "84", "content": "我老公外面的人那么帅？", "sort_order": 18}, {"id": "bd7277dc-34b7-4435-b97a-437900d49427", "shot_id": "85", "content": "还比我高，我跟他打架的话能打赢吗？", "sort_order": 19}, {"id": "eef449c4-c90a-4d78-aba2-57ee0b7f5227", "shot_id": "86", "content": "不行不行。", "sort_order": 20}, {"id": "414e637f-07fb-429f-9637-d283614e3264", "shot_id": "87", "content": "得想个别的法子。", "sort_order": 21}, {"id": "a60ecd9d-2961-40e6-919a-fe42fa2c96c0", "shot_id": "88", "content": "要不，我把这男人勾过来？", "sort_order": 22}, {"id": "e5a02d1c-c737-43e4-b29c-6a4b59ea77f1", "shot_id": "89", "content": "这样他就不会喜欢我老公了？", "sort_order": 23}, {"id": "747e97b6-48dc-4151-8f98-15725912b380", "shot_id": "90", "content": "嗯。", "sort_order": 24}, {"id": "206b4f1a-6a19-45b4-8378-42fe79e6e984", "shot_id": "91", "content": "可行。", "sort_order": 25}, {"id": "c9437333-308a-4adb-9b60-4106bca76f06", "shot_id": "92", "content": "想着，我死死盯着那男人。", "sort_order": 26}, {"id": "94880b17-343b-4a9e-a521-cac66901a561", "shot_id": "93", "content": "那男人朝我老公点了点头。", "sort_order": 27}, {"id": "583e70f5-55db-4f55-8a02-3f7d6df67abc", "shot_id": "94", "content": "陆承衍也朝他点了点头。", "sort_order": 28}, {"id": "697d32d4-12e0-492b-9759-4bfefa718667", "shot_id": "95", "content": "还别说，他们两站一起，倒真是配的一脸。", "sort_order": 29}, {"id": "d8de2c9f-07df-4675-ba5e-31db52a4e5dd", "shot_id": "96", "content": "呸。", "sort_order": 30}, {"id": "179d9407-2a06-47bb-a7e8-c74628072efc", "shot_id": "97", "content": "不对。", "sort_order": 31}, {"id": "ce85aa1a-7428-4c11-9b65-a81026e0a760", "shot_id": "98", "content": "我老公只能跟我配。", "sort_order": 32}, {"id": "3cc332b3-487c-45c0-a54e-1d92566bc5cb", "shot_id": "99", "content": "接着两个人一前一后进去了。", "sort_order": 33}, {"id": "ec0bd1a9-96a7-402f-b6c6-761380b05e6a", "shot_id": "100", "content": "靠窗的位置。", "sort_order": 34}, {"id": "d13ab995-9376-4d0b-a516-5a8d0789d1a3", "shot_id": "101", "content": "面对面坐下。", "sort_order": 35}, {"id": "170faa68-dcb4-4446-ba34-82aad63d230f", "shot_id": "102", "content": "陆承衍把手机推到那男人面前。", "sort_order": 36}, {"id": "af5c6a42-6896-43f7-84c7-c65fd08b950c", "shot_id": "103", "content": "那男人笑了。", "sort_order": 37}, {"id": "69a58136-9381-4fc2-835d-bce2abc337fb", "shot_id": "104", "content": "笑得……很好看。", "sort_order": 38}, {"id": "2ab6cca7-02eb-4542-9218-34402783872b", "shot_id": "105", "content": "好看到我隔着一条马路都觉得刺眼。", "sort_order": 39}, {"id": "c49624a4-41f6-49b9-8e17-f2abd387516c", "shot_id": "106", "content": "我躲在广告牌后面，牙齿咬得咯吱响。", "sort_order": 40}, {"id": "fb6d4033-3c93-4018-9ec0-1ce7da3310c3", "shot_id": "107", "content": "呵。", "sort_order": 41}, {"id": "a1f9dd33-a154-4561-b0af-453e988fabe3", "shot_id": "108", "content": "陆承衍都没对我笑过。", "sort_order": 42}, {"id": "a6183c6d-0044-40d0-a7a7-ea9d38ba7994", "shot_id": "109", "content": "他只会躲我，反锁卧室门。", "sort_order": 43}, {"id": "59681fec-b85a-43ea-96d1-0aa30e581baf", "shot_id": "110", "content": "现在呢？", "sort_order": 44}, {"id": "a3705e36-e743-4f41-8d61-f9cf4802250c", "shot_id": "111", "content": "跟别人喝咖啡，笑得那么温柔。", "sort_order": 45}, {"id": "2799f740-bb03-4b22-91b5-d7de57dbb2c8", "shot_id": "112", "content": "还给别人看手机，我都没看过他手机。", "sort_order": 46}, {"id": "5070122c-a866-40d0-b453-1485b07220ef", "shot_id": "113", "content": "这我能忍吗？", "sort_order": 47}, {"id": "ca5575d3-0a56-466a-a6d7-ec7395bc99b7", "shot_id": "114", "content": "不能。", "sort_order": 48}, {"id": "5892857b-eb19-42d2-9102-0dfe18a85c32", "shot_id": "115", "content": "我冲过马路。", "sort_order": 49}, {"id": "19311b42-0a9d-491f-b925-b1b6e9f462b9", "shot_id": "116", "content": "推开咖啡店的门。", "sort_order": 50}, {"id": "14d52e33-6e83-40e9-aa1a-707b2127046d", "shot_id": "117", "content": "铃铛「叮」的一声。", "sort_order": 51}, {"id": "80361d22-6458-424b-abc3-1fef9f625960", "shot_id": "118", "content": "全店的人都抬头看我。", "sort_order": 52}, {"id": "d7f7003b-d588-4114-8e36-cf12dd2a1ecf", "shot_id": "119", "content": "我不管。", "sort_order": 53}, {"id": "c44eb943-ff85-4da3-9019-28985225d402", "shot_id": "120", "content": "我直直冲到窗边，一把拽住陆承衍的胳膊，把他拽起。", "sort_order": 54}, {"id": "66d20a18-73aa-4c22-9103-00a65144ef0b", "shot_id": "121", "content": "「陆承衍！」", "sort_order": 55}, {"id": "8f59d509-5960-4f35-8706-4461356859f9", "shot_id": "122", "content": "声音大得连我自己都吓一跳。", "sort_order": 56}, {"id": "c770ce8b-764c-4b5c-9feb-56ea33adc655", "shot_id": "123", "content": "「这就是你外面偷偷养的男朋友？", "sort_order": 57}, {"id": "4d0580f7-cfaf-40c0-8494-1cf315d3a432", "shot_id": "124", "content": "你太过分了，他不就比我高那半个头吗？他不就比我长的好点吗？", "sort_order": 58}, {"id": "8d4b8bf0-0a71-4251-9f0f-ca653099a617", "shot_id": "125", "content": "你要他不要你老婆我？我可是你老婆！」", "sort_order": 59}, {"id": "015af829-6c05-4641-a2ae-f4041763dd16", "shot_id": "126", "content": "喊完，还很是应景的掉出来几滴眼泪。", "sort_order": 60}, {"id": "e360675d-24ce-4b4c-b5e3-d42516208065", "shot_id": "127", "content": "我长的白，五官精致，桃花眼掉眼泪的时候，", "sort_order": 61}, {"id": "0b1c7c39-227b-4a59-be39-8e317becc7f3", "shot_id": "128", "content": "很有一种小可怜的模样。", "sort_order": 62}, {"id": "b5fc30df-23e3-49ed-b1e3-12bad11d2f83", "shot_id": "129", "content": "当然了，这个怎么掉眼泪，我也是对着镜子练过的。", "sort_order": 63}, {"id": "1aa352fd-01d8-485f-9d05-47635930197a", "shot_id": "130", "content": "没办法，自己的老公太难勾了，总得下点功夫的。", "sort_order": 64}, {"id": "05fdf1d0-6326-4da5-9c9d-2d15200679ba", "shot_id": "131", "content": "陆承衍转头看我。", "sort_order": 65}, {"id": "fdb761eb-ac05-467f-a8db-2cddf6db257d", "shot_id": "132", "content": "表情从错愕，到无奈，最后却笑了。", "sort_order": 66}, {"id": "aafff290-284d-4496-9034-38acd871d654", "shot_id": "133", "content": "笑的很是有些莫名其妙的那种。", "sort_order": 67}, {"id": "da8c9e65-2a04-40ba-87c4-98d874a25fca", "shot_id": "134", "content": "还伸手揽住了我的腰。", "sort_order": 68}, {"id": "cde14974-3aaf-45b1-a5b6-12ff25ff75a7", "shot_id": "135", "content": "另外一只手还放我脑袋上，摸了摸我的头发。", "sort_order": 69}, {"id": "c95dae84-ec1d-42b7-ab66-c8498c921c1e", "shot_id": "136", "content": "给我激动的，直接就对着他的脸吧唧一口。", "sort_order": 70}, {"id": "4001a792-e754-4aa0-93f3-575475fc2d64", "shot_id": "137", "content": "「老公，人家也想喝咖啡的拉，你怎么不带我来喝咖啡？」", "sort_order": 71}, {"id": "ff5c22de-9ef3-4a20-b62c-878fb40b3513", "shot_id": "138", "content": "「江迟，你在干什么？」", "sort_order": 72}, {"id": "219bb0a1-5950-427f-a124-227b72a05f77", "shot_id": "139", "content": "我莫名其妙的看了我老公对面坐着的那男人一眼。", "sort_order": 73}]}, {"id": "fbdbd469-7b67-4ea5-b5ad-51ac20b4e1fb", "title": "恢复记忆后的社死现场", "sort_order": 2, "shots": [{"id": "766c7690-217f-4cb1-9e7e-6f066c955bad", "shot_id": "140", "content": "这人有病吧。", "sort_order": 0}, {"id": "c3e78c7f-1a2c-4614-896d-3a08c9da6764", "shot_id": "141", "content": "我亲我自己老公，碍着他了？", "sort_order": 1}, {"id": "48c9dda9-d58d-47fe-a2df-c964d7e27c38", "shot_id": "142", "content": "那么大声凶我干什么？", "sort_order": 2}, {"id": "10718745-330d-4b1d-80ad-f9a39eb98789", "shot_id": "143", "content": "就在我还没反应过来怎么回事的时候，", "sort_order": 3}, {"id": "2cee16a9-a2e2-4cad-8373-673cc0ce1284", "shot_id": "144", "content": "那男人起身，直接过来，把我拽了过去。", "sort_order": 4}, {"id": "052cb61e-f5f2-461d-a17c-1d2d913406b2", "shot_id": "145", "content": "拽进了他的怀里。", "sort_order": 5}, {"id": "029110f0-f41f-4b5f-ae7d-34456728b5db", "shot_id": "146", "content": "？", "sort_order": 6}, {"id": "09dd3284-83e8-4e80-bd2f-b052eafa88fe", "shot_id": "147", "content": "？？", "sort_order": 7}, {"id": "f25008f5-3de4-4145-be94-e54fe8350a0c", "shot_id": "148", "content": "做什么？", "sort_order": 8}, {"id": "5aaf729c-bb7d-4823-a4d0-e94722650c5a", "shot_id": "149", "content": "我刚刚可没勾他啊，我勾的是我自己的老公啊。", "sort_order": 9}, {"id": "da5a9519-2d5d-49be-bdab-e74878167c14", "shot_id": "150", "content": "我的魅力那么大的？", "sort_order": 10}, {"id": "a1334db2-a0bb-442f-8420-2c479b9c6fa9", "shot_id": "151", "content": "我想说点什么，他就在我耳边", "sort_order": 11}, {"id": "bd63249e-48b0-4b18-abbb-665a15503327", "shot_id": "152", "content": "「老婆。玩够了吗？玩够了，我们回家了！」", "sort_order": 12}, {"id": "652e13c8-db72-4c78-b579-fb567fd1de4e", "shot_id": "153", "content": "我猛的抬起头，对上了他的眼睛。", "sort_order": 13}, {"id": "967aad4c-47e1-4f6d-a996-23a88313321c", "shot_id": "154", "content": "他眼睛很黑，很沉，像一潭深水。", "sort_order": 14}, {"id": "afdd4f65-397b-4f3b-84fe-fc2527984cdb", "shot_id": "155", "content": "他直接一个低头就堵住了我的嘴。", "sort_order": 15}, {"id": "5c4b5257-9302-4d08-a1e2-8faf276625a2", "shot_id": "156", "content": "我愣住了。", "sort_order": 16}, {"id": "7375981a-3772-40ca-b805-b972ceb970d8", "shot_id": "157", "content": "他，他，他干什么？", "sort_order": 17}, {"id": "c0d5adea-a556-4089-96a0-d7b1653f5f97", "shot_id": "158", "content": "还有他刚刚叫我什么？叫我老婆？", "sort_order": 18}, {"id": "4b12c54a-c97b-4a3e-88b7-642c2f6d6f69", "shot_id": "159", "content": "他有病吧？", "sort_order": 19}, {"id": "c1c6c186-d44d-404a-ab72-a2e9552d8ca3", "shot_id": "160", "content": "我老公看着啊……", "sort_order": 20}, {"id": "24f4a71e-1d6e-4c78-8d5a-e32f2eb13d3f", "shot_id": "161", "content": "这混蛋亲了很久。", "sort_order": 21}, {"id": "2cc2d3fd-1334-4cfa-bee5-5480a2898739", "shot_id": "162", "content": "亲到我忽然就记起来了。", "sort_order": 22}, {"id": "0cb46423-9fcd-4018-bac8-25bb84ec8efb", "shot_id": "163", "content": "傅时深。", "sort_order": 23}, {"id": "5455b8de-fdf0-4869-b09e-05b696df3195", "shot_id": "164", "content": "我亲老公。", "sort_order": 24}, {"id": "718423e1-c411-4556-9971-74be5bd61248", "shot_id": "165", "content": "真老公。", "sort_order": 25}, {"id": "ad0f704d-139a-45ed-9a14-2e37cb9554e9", "shot_id": "166", "content": "我看看傅时深，再看看陆承衍。", "sort_order": 26}, {"id": "e13c4f39-2c62-450b-92b2-ce75453040c7", "shot_id": "167", "content": "我好像在过去失忆的一个月里，做了什么不得了的事情。", "sort_order": 27}, {"id": "40c9c043-e4e1-475c-a51f-33ac944a516c", "shot_id": "168", "content": "陆承衍是我死对头，", "sort_order": 28}, {"id": "77e8e4ae-8cda-43b7-9218-2173568cb553", "shot_id": "169", "content": "因为他喜欢我老公，当初我跟他一起追我老公的。", "sort_order": 29}, {"id": "c27f36b9-3a00-497c-bf7a-22f3e1e0b35b", "shot_id": "170", "content": "我老公傅时深选了我。", "sort_order": 30}, {"id": "8d2987d9-1a38-4a1d-8e1a-2c44e045eb36", "shot_id": "171", "content": "我跟他就成了水火不容的死对头。", "sort_order": 31}, {"id": "93e9d698-ab8b-4ea4-9cec-fded8baed4c8", "shot_id": "172", "content": "可我过去一个月……", "sort_order": 32}, {"id": "c3762074-0eeb-41f1-9f05-7bdf9ce946bf", "shot_id": "173", "content": "还有刚刚……", "sort_order": 33}, {"id": "09f151c2-4c07-48a9-971b-de118081edec", "shot_id": "174", "content": "我一把推开了傅时深。", "sort_order": 34}, {"id": "1ca4ce21-453f-47e7-9829-a44a3899a179", "shot_id": "175", "content": "「傅时深你怎么回事？我都一个月没回家你不会找我啊？", "sort_order": 35}, {"id": "e99a4da8-c096-4c58-8d70-a186e32a9ccf", "shot_id": "176", "content": "看看你做的事情。」", "sort_order": 36}, {"id": "51c4c6a0-8dde-4aa4-9d58-6532af48d130", "shot_id": "177", "content": "「都怪你，害我连老公都认错了，你怎么可以犯这样的错？」", "sort_order": 37}, {"id": "efb8952a-5bda-4315-9617-c003517200d7", "shot_id": "178", "content": "「哼，你这样的老公，我不要了。」", "sort_order": 38}, {"id": "d28e46e5-8b80-4127-a517-1862a981761e", "shot_id": "179", "content": "噼里啪啦的说完这么几句，我跑了。", "sort_order": 39}, {"id": "88855f0b-9250-4eeb-ab6b-d0a5571f14c2", "shot_id": "180", "content": "不得了了，傅时深可不是个好哄的。", "sort_order": 40}, {"id": "e2096ea4-1150-41be-97f1-797774669bcb", "shot_id": "181", "content": "陆承衍那个阴湿男鬼一样的，也是个不好搞的。", "sort_order": 41}, {"id": "f6fe282d-dc5f-428f-bfa0-f56907cdc406", "shot_id": "182", "content": "不行。", "sort_order": 42}, {"id": "fb123483-ad85-4a6b-8434-bd2f90b53c29", "shot_id": "183", "content": "两个都不能要了。", "sort_order": 43}, {"id": "e29c0179-d0ae-44b1-8b2f-601ac60c8d37", "shot_id": "184", "content": "我推开咖啡店的门，冲过马路，拦了辆出租车。", "sort_order": 44}, {"id": "83264565-3bcd-48bf-bf89-1b83852fc25f", "shot_id": "185", "content": "又是刚才那个司机。", "sort_order": 45}, {"id": "e2a65686-b0dc-46fd-8032-8cf92da90c66", "shot_id": "186", "content": "司机从后视镜看我：「小伙子，这么快就抓完了？", "sort_order": 46}, {"id": "b3296e71-4ee6-4d47-bb5d-1eaa6da3308e", "shot_id": "187", "content": "是打不过吗？要不要我帮你啊？」", "sort_order": 47}, {"id": "e9ffabae-c0e2-440f-8239-dcc392964626", "shot_id": "188", "content": "我：「师傅，快走，快走，抓错了！」", "sort_order": 48}, {"id": "debaa486-2d8e-4df6-8c0d-4785a0b11320", "shot_id": "189", "content": "司机一脚油门，车「嗡」地飞出去。", "sort_order": 49}, {"id": "b85b1880-d12c-44ca-b43a-dbc43146bd3b", "shot_id": "190", "content": "我瘫在后座，心跳得跟打鼓似的。", "sort_order": 50}, {"id": "5d5461a2-4206-4d25-acf0-8cc098460673", "shot_id": "191", "content": "脑子里只有一个念头：", "sort_order": 51}, {"id": "ed0b85c2-3889-4bfd-8d17-c20540ca7d28", "shot_id": "192", "content": "完了。", "sort_order": 52}, {"id": "1f490108-6ed5-4c15-b614-8a509ea28211", "shot_id": "193", "content": "原来出车的人是我。", "sort_order": 53}, {"id": "f3e2ede6-7113-496f-b1ab-153eb1e1424b", "shot_id": "194", "content": "我当着我老公的面，抱着我死对头叫了「老公」。", "sort_order": 54}]}, {"id": "7732d2ac-38ef-4a06-872e-15d4f3baca49", "title": "避难胖子家及回忆失忆荒唐事", "sort_order": 3, "shots": [{"id": "ba03708f-ada7-49da-8103-ac948f1ca312", "shot_id": "195", "content": "我掏出手机，快速给我的发小胖子打去一个电话。", "sort_order": 0}, {"id": "972e38e3-fd63-4e21-bc57-f12eabf36674", "shot_id": "196", "content": "我拨过去，声音都在抖：「胖子，救我。」", "sort_order": 1}, {"id": "389bd62e-224d-462c-b7f7-c7c7a4cc2287", "shot_id": "197", "content": "胖子阴阳怪气，「呦，江总这是把我从黑名单放出来了？", "sort_order": 2}, {"id": "788859e8-814e-45e6-92a0-3c8c5c5f95d4", "shot_id": "198", "content": "不怕我说你老公坏话，破坏你们夫夫感情了？」", "sort_order": 3}, {"id": "c5f8ad27-ea71-4a57-8c63-b563bc8721e1", "shot_id": "199", "content": "我想起来了。", "sort_order": 4}, {"id": "1d1a1ecf-b6b1-4534-98df-3e8705e69e98", "shot_id": "200", "content": "这一个月胖子给我打过很多电话的，", "sort_order": 5}, {"id": "da3b613f-db30-4ff2-bfcb-665f8cea2ea6", "shot_id": "201", "content": "每次都跟我说陆承衍不是我老公，", "sort_order": 6}, {"id": "2f43841f-954e-4fd6-a32c-f73d80a795f5", "shot_id": "202", "content": "而我每次都说他是见不得我好，想要破坏我夫夫感情。", "sort_order": 7}, {"id": "330db5b2-8c17-4c04-9177-61d912daa096", "shot_id": "203", "content": "啧。", "sort_order": 8}, {"id": "fe6efcd1-b705-410e-bbbe-0da9ce26b3f8", "shot_id": "204", "content": "我好歹是个总啊，怎么失忆了就跟中蛊一样？", "sort_order": 9}, {"id": "aee9ee36-ca6f-40d3-9310-c5c76015e3c0", "shot_id": "205", "content": "我怎么能抱着陆承衍喊了一个月的老公呢？", "sort_order": 10}, {"id": "8a1c5f39-d70e-41f2-916c-1bea35f5fa56", "shot_id": "206", "content": "还，还……", "sort_order": 11}, {"id": "ee52e0d3-436c-4995-9610-5ffb2e990aa4", "shot_id": "207", "content": "算了。", "sort_order": 12}, {"id": "8d6bbcaf-cc51-4e93-bbc2-089fd5811bfe", "shot_id": "208", "content": "往事不可追……", "sort_order": 13}, {"id": "16101fcd-c849-4151-865c-a972cc86a7f6", "shot_id": "209", "content": "「老子快死了，你就说救不救？我马上到你家了。」", "sort_order": 14}, {"id": "eb3fd8fe-0ced-4532-a56e-0916fb7937ee", "shot_id": "210", "content": "胖子住城东，老小区，六楼，没电梯。", "sort_order": 15}, {"id": "f2dd9df0-e755-4fd3-9011-2b9f0ef6ced7", "shot_id": "211", "content": "我一口气爬上去，砸门。", "sort_order": 16}, {"id": "e856583d-60a4-4c48-a50f-51f3d906b04d", "shot_id": "212", "content": "胖子开门，嘴里还嚼着薯片。", "sort_order": 17}, {"id": "5e8a70a2-c1b9-48b8-b2d5-dc8643eec9a7", "shot_id": "213", "content": "「江总你还真来了，你……」", "sort_order": 18}, {"id": "377f6893-fa38-4339-aabd-80ae3128f459", "shot_id": "214", "content": "我扒开门挤进去，反手把门锁死。", "sort_order": 19}, {"id": "d0e82611-6ed9-4dbe-8756-84d3a177c775", "shot_id": "215", "content": "「别说了，快让我进去躲躲！」", "sort_order": 20}, {"id": "e9d787e9-7f31-47b1-8630-f6df68e34de7", "shot_id": "216", "content": "胖子把薯片袋子放下，叹了口气，表情复杂得像便秘。", "sort_order": 21}, {"id": "eedd7060-6078-42b5-9f1b-16ee5dfd1037", "shot_id": "217", "content": "「江迟，你失忆这一个月，我找过你八次。」", "sort_order": 22}, {"id": "3c90c5b3-d1c1-43ff-b928-c436d8a5c3d8", "shot_id": "218", "content": "「你第一次见我说：『你谁啊？我老公不让我跟陌生人说话。』」", "sort_order": 23}, {"id": "abe173ca-5d6c-4cae-a358-98e4c586a5e1", "shot_id": "219", "content": "「第二次你说：『死胖子别烦我，我要跟我老公二人世界。』」", "sort_order": 24}, {"id": "7e9902d8-f6ad-4ecc-b9b7-945a6822a3ce", "shot_id": "220", "content": "「第三次你直接放狗咬我。」", "sort_order": 25}, {"id": "262e4524-119c-48df-bffa-6319aedcff4f", "shot_id": "221", "content": "我：「……」", "sort_order": 26}, {"id": "81257b57-2afe-49d3-a060-1a05b61147a2", "shot_id": "222", "content": "胖子：「我说我不是陌生人，我是你发小。", "sort_order": 27}, {"id": "e9b437bb-90be-4296-8255-2259980cb474", "shot_id": "223", "content": "你说你有老公了，发小算什么。」", "sort_order": 28}, {"id": "57523c15-30d7-4579-afea-50adae1e2719", "shot_id": "224", "content": "我：「……」", "sort_order": 29}, {"id": "525c261e-af00-4091-89ab-fac027e673ac", "shot_id": "225", "content": "胖子：「我说你有真老公，叫傅时深。你说我诅咒你出轨。」", "sort_order": 30}, {"id": "7ad44106-42fe-4b0a-9567-26aa8c3dd903", "shot_id": "226", "content": "我：「行了行了，兄弟，反正你让我在你这儿躲躲先。", "sort_order": 31}, {"id": "ce425679-7bc6-4c17-8795-d07846399d94", "shot_id": "227", "content": "我得先捋捋。", "sort_order": 32}, {"id": "79b5eafe-be23-491d-924a-ee7fcb798077", "shot_id": "228", "content": "他们两个肯定不会放过我的，我身份证那些东西呢？", "sort_order": 33}, {"id": "dbbf3f76-e481-459f-b354-55f2b9247c2a", "shot_id": "229", "content": "我还是先跑国外躲躲吧。」", "sort_order": 34}, {"id": "77161ff6-bc40-4236-bb0a-db9eddbe9218", "shot_id": "230", "content": "胖子：「江总，你一个月没去公司了，", "sort_order": 35}, {"id": "971a0349-436b-4f4d-9552-864add9ca7c7", "shot_id": "231", "content": "你公司等会儿都要破产了，你还出国？」", "sort_order": 36}, {"id": "2e4fddcc-9a76-4e21-a1fc-24fc286242e3", "shot_id": "232", "content": "啧。", "sort_order": 37}, {"id": "dd907fa4-31ab-47f7-80fd-87b485a56a7b", "shot_id": "233", "content": "是啊。", "sort_order": 38}, {"id": "d953cb61-3872-4917-9cf3-54f6ba46be81", "shot_id": "234", "content": "我还有一个公司来着。", "sort_order": 39}, {"id": "4ee84926-7e9f-45cd-8889-9eb0886a2f69", "shot_id": "235", "content": "那过去一个月我都没去公司，怎么就没人找我？", "sort_order": 40}, {"id": "b3c39aa3-e29d-43d4-97d4-32e6053643e2", "shot_id": "236", "content": "我没有助理？", "sort_order": 41}, {"id": "20bc9f1b-f0bb-4327-8346-add34f76ae26", "shot_id": "237", "content": "我没有员工？", "sort_order": 42}, {"id": "41ffdf17-f403-48dc-88e6-3869f2bd14d1", "shot_id": "238", "content": "老公不找我，老公不爱我，我助理员工呢？", "sort_order": 43}, {"id": "97a72e56-8e5d-4e68-87e1-70cd19547729", "shot_id": "239", "content": "这事定是有猫腻。", "sort_order": 44}, {"id": "c8297e25-7452-4393-9a26-655e543a7a33", "shot_id": "240", "content": "我颓废的坐在沙发上。", "sort_order": 45}, {"id": "20365d67-9ced-471b-b127-2652b9fe2fe0", "shot_id": "241", "content": "想着一个一个来解决。", "sort_order": 46}, {"id": "a8f928b2-b643-4780-b544-2b379699cedd", "shot_id": "242", "content": "先解决陆承衍吧。", "sort_order": 47}, {"id": "74116fd8-2dc9-4655-8986-647e5a533425", "shot_id": "243", "content": "傅时深怎么也是我真老公，", "sort_order": 48}, {"id": "81aa4e22-2958-4639-a73b-038dfca5f899", "shot_id": "244", "content": "到时候哭一哭，撒撒娇应该可以过去。", "sort_order": 49}]}, {"id": "f1934fb0-5358-4e92-9a3c-34b40c3a73ee", "title": "失忆期的社死回忆与死对头找上门", "sort_order": 4, "shots": [{"id": "a3076792-6eb6-4b20-93e3-de82406ee080", "shot_id": "245", "content": "所以这一个月我到底对陆承衍干了什么？", "sort_order": 0}, {"id": "697c5f3f-6c5b-462b-8b35-7ebd395c9e84", "shot_id": "246", "content": "我趁他洗澡偷拿他内裤。", "sort_order": 1}, {"id": "2376f191-a934-4944-9f5c-b1aa6fd49588", "shot_id": "247", "content": "趁他睡觉把门撬了，偷亲他……", "sort_order": 2}, {"id": "bbfc7337-8f86-4cbe-8f8f-22781cd43977", "shot_id": "248", "content": "每天抱着他胳膊说「老公你身上好香」。", "sort_order": 3}, {"id": "f9b5dfdc-a450-40e6-aebd-30b6162675d4", "shot_id": "249", "content": "他躲我，我追。", "sort_order": 4}, {"id": "da10ac60-e4a1-4c1f-9b7b-b328d9e6ba0f", "shot_id": "250", "content": "他再躲，我直接扑。", "sort_order": 5}, {"id": "68b91e1b-610c-4507-ab38-59395ff7c69c", "shot_id": "251", "content": "他反锁门，我撬门。", "sort_order": 6}, {"id": "5cdbea8a-98ec-4bab-a330-35bee134a4de", "shot_id": "252", "content": "他说「我是你死对头」，我说「死对头老公别闹」。", "sort_order": 7}, {"id": "45d87631-b343-45ab-99a0-a4b0e5bd8481", "shot_id": "253", "content": "……", "sort_order": 8}, {"id": "d717a318-4b14-4b71-8d40-4427e855e4cc", "shot_id": "254", "content": "哎。", "sort_order": 9}, {"id": "817ff9c8-75b0-4904-9e25-ee1bc1812591", "shot_id": "255", "content": "心累。", "sort_order": 10}, {"id": "d6ae0a57-1dc4-4b9f-81a5-c167f11c72db", "shot_id": "256", "content": "我这是把十八辈子的脸都丢尽了？", "sort_order": 11}, {"id": "c2a9107a-c310-4883-8f57-92a29c7f77e0", "shot_id": "257", "content": "忽然。", "sort_order": 12}, {"id": "17155569-f3c5-4bcb-a986-c72f1e509264", "shot_id": "258", "content": "胖子家门被敲响了。", "sort_order": 13}, {"id": "d4ad7d12-33f5-4219-9539-e6ada35bdbff", "shot_id": "259", "content": "三下。", "sort_order": 14}, {"id": "c004fc92-0964-45c7-8bb9-14d08437acb6", "shot_id": "260", "content": "不轻不重。", "sort_order": 15}, {"id": "a83bf081-ec68-4985-85f2-4c805c278ac1", "shot_id": "261", "content": "很礼貌。", "sort_order": 16}, {"id": "790b9e9e-a68b-43b0-b5c9-10e19dab53c1", "shot_id": "262", "content": "但不知道为啥，我汗毛全竖起来了。", "sort_order": 17}, {"id": "5fd80741-925b-4ca7-aa17-9e2f541c067c", "shot_id": "263", "content": "胖子也愣了。", "sort_order": 18}, {"id": "c07de017-a2fa-46b3-82ad-da4f7b39c92a", "shot_id": "264", "content": "「谁啊？」", "sort_order": 19}, {"id": "48ca0727-39c6-4ad8-b2cf-17ecb7001923", "shot_id": "265", "content": "门外传来一个声音。", "sort_order": 20}, {"id": "d215d74a-f975-4368-b8e4-1c982fd50ac7", "shot_id": "266", "content": "低沉，冷淡，像冰碴子。", "sort_order": 21}, {"id": "f88d7ede-7b4b-435b-876a-7e7bde83b6f5", "shot_id": "267", "content": "「陆承衍。」", "sort_order": 22}, {"id": "56a82475-ee6e-4849-8e0d-09baf2625d37", "shot_id": "268", "content": "我直接从沙发上弹起来，一把捂住胖子的嘴。", "sort_order": 23}, {"id": "4b3afa6c-64d6-4ebf-8c48-1bbbed201e5b", "shot_id": "269", "content": "「别说我在这儿！」", "sort_order": 24}, {"id": "acec039d-fa52-47e4-9773-41564ba97baa", "shot_id": "270", "content": "胖子被我捂得翻白眼。", "sort_order": 25}, {"id": "2111f3ed-793f-4cb9-b869-6cc2ec0fa90b", "shot_id": "271", "content": "门外又响了一声。", "sort_order": 26}, {"id": "6baf2534-b6eb-4365-9a02-2b27b6b11e4b", "shot_id": "272", "content": "「江迟，开门。我知道你在里面。」", "sort_order": 27}, {"id": "1800c321-1b36-4cc9-9e97-35f7052ec7b8", "shot_id": "273", "content": "我压低嗓子：「他怎么知道？」", "sort_order": 28}, {"id": "5a8b7450-2aaf-4169-8a5b-51a36f2c5f6c", "shot_id": "274", "content": "胖子掰开我的手，喘了两口气。", "sort_order": 29}, {"id": "2269ac35-a140-4b7e-be02-5e2d49221985", "shot_id": "275", "content": "「我怎么知道？这个姓陆的不会在你手机上安装定位了吧？", "sort_order": 30}, {"id": "cd5c3d81-e73f-4954-ac2d-a511a0bdb20d", "shot_id": "276", "content": "别说，姓陆的那玩意儿还真能干出来。」", "sort_order": 31}, {"id": "aad5d9e7-cf2c-43e0-941d-f8f509401c79", "shot_id": "277", "content": "门外，陆承衍的声音又响起来。", "sort_order": 32}, {"id": "6641b4a2-f019-4899-bab0-56b9aef31745", "shot_id": "278", "content": "「江迟，我数三下。一。」", "sort_order": 33}, {"id": "abf0f1a9-9eae-4c81-9da4-d8bd16a109be", "shot_id": "279", "content": "我冲到窗边，往下看。", "sort_order": 34}, {"id": "c961049b-3689-4590-a958-ec96f7796a27", "shot_id": "280", "content": "六楼。", "sort_order": 35}, {"id": "e8d36f6c-a843-4eb6-b059-f8301c92b136", "shot_id": "281", "content": "跳下去不死也残。", "sort_order": 36}, {"id": "5aa237ab-79eb-4015-9fe3-0ccae0d1fd8f", "shot_id": "282", "content": "「二。」", "sort_order": 37}, {"id": "5f274e18-fb70-4ca9-8f33-3a8146875479", "shot_id": "283", "content": "我看胖子。", "sort_order": 38}, {"id": "c0f088a0-8643-4682-a5f1-0ac765ccb34e", "shot_id": "284", "content": "胖子摇头：「别看我，我打不过他。」", "sort_order": 39}, {"id": "097ede30-5889-4c92-9793-3a8f2ff70d73", "shot_id": "285", "content": "我：「……」", "sort_order": 40}, {"id": "be1f4e48-e7f4-46f0-be89-f470270c8b2d", "shot_id": "286", "content": "「三。」", "sort_order": 41}, {"id": "af51ab1b-c635-4ebe-a4d9-4041cd670b63", "shot_id": "287", "content": "门「砰」地一声，被一脚踹开。", "sort_order": 42}, {"id": "e90f845f-b23a-4275-812d-9f7a3242476c", "shot_id": "288", "content": "陆承衍站在门口，西装外套搭在手臂上，", "sort_order": 43}, {"id": "d3b029bb-c356-4ecc-8ab8-c0c42d89207b", "shot_id": "289", "content": "衬衫领口解了两颗扣子。", "sort_order": 44}, {"id": "96978678-3bd6-4e99-a4ee-8346a8f8a090", "shot_id": "290", "content": "他看着我，眼神像在看一只跑不掉的兔子。", "sort_order": 45}, {"id": "579710b0-b78a-4faa-bb25-1695cc8759cb", "shot_id": "291", "content": "「跑啊。怎么不跑了？」", "sort_order": 46}, {"id": "41eaea44-9e3b-4837-baf1-307e803de4c1", "shot_id": "292", "content": "我后退，撞到沙发角。", "sort_order": 47}, {"id": "acfe044d-0a32-415e-bd3f-e8d6db7a0eff", "shot_id": "293", "content": "「陆承衍，你冷静。我是个有老公的人。」", "sort_order": 48}, {"id": "ae51f812-7646-4f41-bf78-b0ffc58489a1", "shot_id": "294", "content": "「哟，现在记得你有老公了？」", "sort_order": 49}, {"id": "68135de7-24a6-4ae3-acbb-19efd702a88c", "shot_id": "295", "content": "我：「刚刚记起来的。」", "sort_order": 50}, {"id": "72883ee5-f7c9-46dc-a5e6-c06f1f6782ad", "shot_id": "296", "content": "他：「可你喊我老公喊了一个月。」", "sort_order": 51}, {"id": "7d819ce4-ab12-4cf8-b567-aacda3dee0db", "shot_id": "297", "content": "我：「我失忆了。」", "sort_order": 52}, {"id": "d3f2b197-5c14-482f-8688-80612643baf0", "shot_id": "298", "content": "他：「失忆了就能随便抱人、亲人，还要晚上节目？」", "sort_order": 53}, {"id": "5ebd50ef-0797-44eb-a2c5-280ecc59baa4", "shot_id": "299", "content": "我：「……」", "sort_order": 54}, {"id": "36e35507-9014-4a7b-bf21-53b4f868f3fa", "shot_id": "300", "content": "他朝我走过来。", "sort_order": 55}, {"id": "1bccf47d-5212-49a4-bf79-7d7e5fb849cf", "shot_id": "301", "content": "我往后退。", "sort_order": 56}, {"id": "10498ba2-5731-4ed2-80bd-17b4944caaa9", "shot_id": "302", "content": "退到墙角，没路了。", "sort_order": 57}, {"id": "843a6b54-45aa-4f49-a3ce-5bbe93cd52e7", "shot_id": "303", "content": "他伸手，一把捏住我的下巴，逼我抬头看他。", "sort_order": 58}]}, {"id": "aa43edf0-5785-4870-b498-58f72db9c2f3", "title": "死对头的绑架与真假老公修罗场", "sort_order": 5, "shots": [{"id": "a3a5877c-f90d-48d0-a280-07a341927905", "shot_id": "304", "content": "「江迟，你喊老公，就得对我负责。别想跑！」", "sort_order": 0}, {"id": "682df900-ecc7-41fa-8236-afefc61708cc", "shot_id": "305", "content": "干嘛啊。", "sort_order": 1}, {"id": "eac22bbb-9c26-4012-8620-b60c9970707a", "shot_id": "306", "content": "负什么责啊？", "sort_order": 2}, {"id": "4b399dde-4773-4db6-88ae-c55722906e5a", "shot_id": "307", "content": "我一个有老公的人！", "sort_order": 3}, {"id": "f48c0090-7164-4977-af1d-b136917b16f7", "shot_id": "308", "content": "我被陆承衍扛下楼，塞到副驾驶。", "sort_order": 4}, {"id": "8b305e23-e9b0-4874-8e95-5eb83ce05c4e", "shot_id": "309", "content": "我被陆承衍关在了他的家里。", "sort_order": 5}, {"id": "11eed001-d4e8-4efb-a5d5-8ce88a57e297", "shot_id": "310", "content": "他还说要追我。", "sort_order": 6}, {"id": "fa2a2fe1-41a2-409b-bc41-debd14f767e8", "shot_id": "311", "content": "说关起来，更好追，不用费劲。", "sort_order": 7}, {"id": "4ff266ce-6df4-4994-aae7-37abe9ed3137", "shot_id": "312", "content": "我都以为我耳朵坏了。", "sort_order": 8}, {"id": "158c8bd6-bd34-4302-8a28-82c289c1a324", "shot_id": "313", "content": "追什么？", "sort_order": 9}, {"id": "44c3a2eb-601a-4d64-8d21-520d87e94b6b", "shot_id": "314", "content": "我不是有老公吗？", "sort_order": 10}, {"id": "847bed96-4036-4e9a-b0d5-c5b1889c551f", "shot_id": "315", "content": "我刚要跟他讲讲道理，", "sort_order": 11}, {"id": "7d6e146b-5833-4e86-bd08-94328a394bfb", "shot_id": "316", "content": "接着就看见我的真老公出现在我跟前……", "sort_order": 12}, {"id": "4a5fd733-2247-458c-8a69-2ec8c0d6f269", "shot_id": "317", "content": "傅时深是翻阳台进来的。", "sort_order": 13}, {"id": "ab008213-c15e-417c-b1af-d0849d692472", "shot_id": "318", "content": "六楼。", "sort_order": 14}, {"id": "76d5a34c-9169-4f74-a487-a561c042158b", "shot_id": "319", "content": "他家保镖在下面举着手机拍。", "sort_order": 15}, {"id": "ca8ddb9f-e910-4ba6-8199-7b35bf2c93f6", "shot_id": "320", "content": "也不怕摔死。", "sort_order": 16}, {"id": "00de83aa-4922-484d-923c-a05d0ffd80b1", "shot_id": "321", "content": "陆承衍正在厨房给我热糖醋排骨，", "sort_order": 17}, {"id": "14152b8a-3133-4791-8166-63fc2c89f691", "shot_id": "322", "content": "听见动静，拎着锅铲就出来了。", "sort_order": 18}, {"id": "73d85490-2fc7-4f61-9824-8b4397ccff28", "shot_id": "323", "content": "「傅时深，你他妈走门会死？吓到我老婆，你赔不起。」", "sort_order": 19}, {"id": "8fd7b872-c7b0-4fa6-8550-d66143170b31", "shot_id": "324", "content": "傅时深拍拍袖子上的灰。", "sort_order": 20}, {"id": "f76a02e4-4ef2-4a47-bb38-b91af08d58c6", "shot_id": "325", "content": "「走门你会让我进来？", "sort_order": 21}, {"id": "00a78938-9a1b-4790-9de0-d2143e764cd6", "shot_id": "326", "content": "有别墅不住，非跑到六楼来，不就是为了防我？", "sort_order": 22}, {"id": "457e92aa-738c-4ddb-a2e9-ca7efd24ead4", "shot_id": "327", "content": "不对，谁是你老婆？江迟是我老婆。」", "sort_order": 23}, {"id": "b2d85bc5-0f69-44fb-9823-6927a75ce79d", "shot_id": "328", "content": "他扫了我一眼。", "sort_order": 24}, {"id": "532b7f98-0668-42e1-8ce1-0635315e019b", "shot_id": "329", "content": "那一眼，又深又沉，像要把我钉在沙发上。", "sort_order": 25}, {"id": "cb2cae53-7e14-4b49-98d1-d39940fa886b", "shot_id": "330", "content": "「江迟，过来。」", "sort_order": 26}, {"id": "ff2cacf1-26d2-4e7f-94d7-cdcdae770b93", "shot_id": "331", "content": "我还没动，陆承衍直接挡在我前面。", "sort_order": 27}, {"id": "e507e710-7771-4597-929a-240a2a2a3736", "shot_id": "332", "content": "「这一个月他天天挂我身上，晚上害怕了往我怀里钻，", "sort_order": 28}, {"id": "af3853a6-3eca-47c6-a055-56ec3282de4f", "shot_id": "333", "content": "饿了张嘴让我喂，洗澡还要我递毛巾，你让他过去就过去？」", "sort_order": 29}, {"id": "d8d2130a-f5bd-43c4-913f-d87f29058efd", "shot_id": "334", "content": "我缩了缩头，小说嘀咕，「那是因为我不记得！」", "sort_order": 30}, {"id": "03408b13-e00d-4c01-b6b5-688da53b7852", "shot_id": "335", "content": "陆承衍回头瞪我：「你闭嘴，现在没让你说话。」", "sort_order": 31}, {"id": "4123bf6b-507b-4092-9530-52a800e6063e", "shot_id": "336", "content": "我：「哦。」", "sort_order": 32}, {"id": "99e30cea-e18c-4ae8-8f64-9fc6b618aa02", "shot_id": "337", "content": "好可怕啊！", "sort_order": 33}, {"id": "53d87d14-486b-4a18-a0cf-09e572573f65", "shot_id": "338", "content": "他们好凶！！", "sort_order": 34}, {"id": "ae754ece-7291-40e0-8dba-3e58556a30a3", "shot_id": "339", "content": "傅时深没理他，直接看着我。", "sort_order": 35}, {"id": "30be693f-f89a-4bf9-9f48-920d42155058", "shot_id": "340", "content": "「江迟，陆承衍把我困在瑞典一个月，", "sort_order": 36}, {"id": "41886a2e-82ee-420f-831e-3b3bec5b9e7c", "shot_id": "341", "content": "不是我不回来找你，是他害我。」", "sort_order": 37}, {"id": "87dc6482-9d32-4ee7-97bb-1c6bff44bfd9", "shot_id": "342", "content": "「他还说你在他那儿很好，他还说他会照顾好你。」", "sort_order": 38}, {"id": "6546e05b-f26d-4d89-b0a9-20b41b2418f5", "shot_id": "343", "content": "他的声音很平，但每个字都像从牙缝里挤出来的。", "sort_order": 39}, {"id": "ad3fa376-c0f1-4b5a-87ef-e327e24c1016", "shot_id": "344", "content": "我愣住了。", "sort_order": 40}, {"id": "94a34dff-9084-4690-bf17-7b1b17fb5971", "shot_id": "345", "content": "「他说我很好，你就信了？你让我死对头照顾我？」", "sort_order": 41}, {"id": "73a5eaff-1a49-459f-a358-191d8e8aa879", "shot_id": "346", "content": "傅时深脸色很难看，双眸通红。", "sort_order": 42}]}]}	[{"timestamp": "2026-08-26T03:37:38.142377+00:00", "message": "生成脚本", "level": "info"}, {"timestamp": "2026-08-26T03:37:38.145883+00:00", "message": "任务开始执行", "level": "info"}, {"timestamp": "2026-08-26T03:40:38.077988+00:00", "message": "任务完成", "level": "success"}]	\N	2026-08-26 11:37:38.145872+08	2026-08-26 11:40:38.077971+08	2026-08-26 11:37:38.140699+08	2026-08-26 11:40:38.079195+08	
fc08c929-e302-4f36-8975-7b2007c668db	0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea	ai_extract_scenes	cancelled	normal	0	{"world_id": "37eddb38-8e9e-4800-8c37-8ce74d45e2ca", "novel_text": "我老公好像有男朋友了。\\r\\n不抱我了，不亲我了，晚上节目也没有了！\\r\\n还说我是他死对头，不是他老婆。\\r\\n呵！渣男。\\r\\n肯定是外面那个闹着要名分了。\\r\\n我偏不如他愿。\\r\\n我就要抱他，亲他，跟他回家！\\r\\n后来我恢复了记忆。\\r\\n哦豁！\\r\\n我好像……还真是他死对头。\\r\\n更要命的是，我还真有一个老公。\\r\\n而此刻，我亲老公正站在我面前，看着我抱着死对头喊老公，眸色幽深，声音冰冷：\\r\\n「老婆，玩够了吗？」\\r\\n我老公好像有男朋友了。\\r\\n别问我怎么发现的。\\r\\n他不抱我。\\r\\n不亲我。\\r\\n我才二十二岁啊。\\r\\n那么美丽的年纪，晚上看着自己的老公，这不要我命吗？\\r\\n我老公他，每天晚上都反锁卧室门，防我跟防贼一样。\\r\\n我抱着枕头在沙发上，对着天花板，假装掉了一晚上眼泪。\\r\\n他都不哄我。\\r\\n哼。\\r\\n渣男！\\r\\n眼泪流干之后，我悟了。\\r\\n男人的心，跟综艺排播一样，说撤就撤。\\r\\n可凭什么啊？\\r\\n凭什么他说撤就撤？\\r\\n就因为我出车祸失忆了？\\r\\n失忆了，就可以不用养我这个老婆了？\\r\\n失忆了，就可以欺负我给外面那个名分了？\\r\\n我偏不如他愿。\\r\\n我天天喊他老公。\\r\\n他天天说不是我老公，说他是我死对头。\\r\\n我一开始还难过。\\r\\n后来听麻了。\\r\\n死对头就死对头呗。\\r\\n死对头就不能当老公吗？\\r\\n反正我失忆了，我微信置顶是他。\\r\\n他肯定是我老公。\\r\\n不让我叫老公，一定是外面那个臭不要脸的跟他做的局。\\r\\n那我偏要叫。\\r\\n「死对头老公，早上好。」\\r\\n「死对头老公，晚上见。」\\r\\n「死对头老公，今天节目安排一下？」\\r\\n他被我气得脸红了，耳朵也红的很……\\r\\n但最近，他连「死对头」都不乐意说了。\\r\\n他开始躲我。\\r\\n我走近一步，他退两步。\\r\\n我伸手想抱，他直接侧身。\\r\\n我垫脚想亲，他一把捂住我的嘴，表情像在防贼。\\r\\n晚上洗完澡，我裹着浴巾在他眼前晃。\\r\\n他连看都不看一眼。\\r\\n以前他至少会红着耳尖骂我「不知羞」。\\r\\n现在呢？\\r\\n他拿起手机，直接进了书房，门「砰」地一声。\\r\\n我站在客厅，浴巾都掉了。\\r\\n他也没回头。\\r\\n哎。\\r\\n看来我老公外面的那个人，已经等不急了。\\r\\n到底是哪个狐狸精啊，怎么把我老公哄的不要我了？\\r\\n天杀的啊！\\r\\n世界上那么多男人，非要抢我老公吗？\\r\\n我是个传统的男人，我得让我这个迷途的老公知返。\\r\\n于是我开始跟踪陆承衍。\\r\\n我打算找到他外面的那个男朋友，先好好跟人讲讲道理，要是道理讲不通，我一米八的个子还可以跟他打一架。\\r\\n卫衣、口罩、鸭舌帽，全副武装。\\r\\n出租车司机从后视镜瞄我一眼。\\r\\n「小伙子，抓奸啊？」\\r\\n我：「师傅，您怎么知道？」\\r\\n司机：「你这副表情，我拉过太多了。」\\r\\n我：「……」\\r\\n司机：「跟前面那辆宾利？」\\r\\n我：「对，别让他发现。」\\r\\n司机：「放心，这活儿我熟。」\\r\\n陆承衍的车停在市中心一家咖啡店门口。\\r\\n他没进去。\\r\\n站在门口看手机。\\r\\n接着咖啡店里走出来一个男人。\\r\\n黑色西装，宽肩长腿，侧脸线条跟画出来的似的。\\r\\n完蛋。\\r\\n我老公外面的人那么帅？\\r\\n还比我高，我跟他打架的话能打赢吗？\\r\\n不行不行。\\r\\n得想个别的法子。\\r\\n要不，我把这男人勾过来？\\r\\n这样他就不会喜欢我老公了？\\r\\n嗯。\\r\\n可行。\\r\\n想着，我死死盯着那男人。\\r\\n那男人朝我老公点了点头。\\r\\n陆承衍也朝他点了点头。\\r\\n还别说，他们两站一起，倒真是配的一脸。\\r\\n呸。\\r\\n不对。\\r\\n我老公只能跟我配。\\r\\n接着两个人一前一后进去了。\\r\\n靠窗的位置。\\r\\n面对面坐下。\\r\\n陆承衍把手机推到那男人面前。\\r\\n那男人笑了。\\r\\n笑得……很好看。\\r\\n好看到我隔着一条马路都觉得刺眼。\\r\\n我躲在广告牌后面，牙齿咬得咯吱响。\\r\\n呵。\\r\\n陆承衍都没对我笑过。\\r\\n他只会躲我，反锁卧室门。\\r\\n现在呢？\\r\\n跟别人喝咖啡，笑得那么温柔。\\r\\n还给别人看手机，我都没看过他手机。\\r\\n这我能忍吗？\\r\\n不能。\\r\\n我冲过马路。\\r\\n推开咖啡店的门。\\r\\n铃铛「叮」的一声。\\r\\n全店的人都抬头看我。\\r\\n我不管。\\r\\n我直直冲到窗边，一把拽住陆承衍的胳膊，把他拽起。\\r\\n「陆承衍！」\\r\\n声音大得连我自己都吓一跳。\\r\\n「这就是你外面偷偷养的男朋友？\\r\\n你太过分了，他不就比我高那半个头吗？他不就比我长的好点吗？\\r\\n你要他不要你老婆我？我可是你老婆！」\\r\\n喊完，还很是应景的掉出来几滴眼泪。\\r\\n我长的白，五官精致，桃花眼掉眼泪的时候，很有一种小可怜的模样。\\r\\n当然了，这个怎么掉眼泪，我也是对着镜子练过的。\\r\\n没办法，自己的老公太难勾了，总得下点功夫的。\\r\\n陆承衍转头看我。\\r\\n表情从错愕，到无奈，最后却笑了。\\r\\n笑的很是有些莫名其妙的那种。\\r\\n还伸手揽住了我的腰。\\r\\n另外一只手还放我脑袋上，摸了摸我的头发。\\r\\n给我激动的，直接就对着他的脸吧唧一口。\\r\\n「老公，人家也想喝咖啡的拉，你怎么不带我来喝咖啡？」\\r\\n「江迟，你在干什么？」\\r\\n我莫名其妙的看了我老公对面坐着的那男人一眼。\\r\\n这人有病吧。\\r\\n我亲我自己老公，碍着他了？\\r\\n那么大声凶我干什么？\\r\\n就在我还没反应过来怎么回事的时候，那男人起身，直接过来，把我拽了过去。\\r\\n拽进了他的怀里。\\r\\n？\\r\\n？？\\r\\n做什么？\\r\\n我刚刚可没勾他啊，我勾的是我自己的老公啊。\\r\\n我的魅力那么大的？\\r\\n我想说点什么，他就在我耳边\\r\\n「老婆。玩够了吗？玩够了，我们回家了！」\\r\\n我猛的抬起头，对上了他的眼睛。\\r\\n他眼睛很黑，很沉，像一潭深水。\\r\\n他直接一个低头就堵住了我的嘴。\\r\\n我愣住了。\\r\\n他，他，他干什么？\\r\\n还有他刚刚叫我什么？叫我老婆？\\r\\n他有病吧？\\r\\n我老公看着啊……\\r\\n这混蛋亲了很久。\\r\\n亲到我忽然就记起来了。\\r\\n傅时深。\\r\\n我亲老公。\\r\\n真老公。\\r\\n我看看傅时深，再看看陆承衍。\\r\\n我好像在过去失忆的一个月里，做了什么不得了的事情。\\r\\n陆承衍是我死对头，因为他喜欢我老公，当初我跟他一起追我老公的。\\r\\n我老公傅时深选了我。\\r\\n我跟他就成了水火不容的死对头。\\r\\n可我过去一个月……\\r\\n还有刚刚……\\r\\n我一把推开了傅时深。\\r\\n「傅时深你怎么回事？我都一个月没回家你不会找我啊？看看你做的事情。」\\r\\n「都怪你，害我连老公都认错了，你怎么可以犯这样的错？」\\r\\n「哼，你这样的老公，我不要了。」\\r\\n噼里啪啦的说完这么几句，我跑了。\\r\\n不得了了，傅时深可不是个好哄的。\\r\\n陆承衍那个阴湿男鬼一样的，也是个不好搞的。\\r\\n不行。\\r\\n两个都不能要了。\\r\\n我推开咖啡店的门，冲过马路，拦了辆出租车。\\r\\n又是刚才那个司机。\\r\\n司机从后视镜看我：「小伙子，这么快就抓完了？是打不过吗？要不要我帮你啊？」\\r\\n我：「师傅，快走，快走，抓错了！」\\r\\n司机一脚油门，车「嗡」地飞出去。\\r\\n我瘫在后座，心跳得跟打鼓似的。\\r\\n脑子里只有一个念头：\\r\\n完了。\\r\\n原来出车的人是我。\\r\\n我当着我老公的面，抱着我死对头叫了「老公」。\\r\\n我掏出手机，快速给我的发小胖子打去一个电话。\\r\\n我拨过去，声音都在抖：「胖子，救我。」\\r\\n胖子阴阳怪气，「呦，江总这是把我从黑名单放出来了？不怕我说你老公坏话，破坏你们夫夫感情了？」\\r\\n我想起来了。\\r\\n这一个月胖子给我打过很多电话的，每次都跟我说陆承衍不是我老公，而我每次都说他是见不得我好，想要破坏我夫夫感情。\\r\\n啧。\\r\\n我好歹是个总啊，怎么失忆了就跟中蛊一样？\\r\\n我怎么能抱着陆承衍喊了一个月的老公呢？\\r\\n还，还……\\r\\n算了。\\r\\n往事不可追……\\r\\n「老子快死了，你就说救不救？我马上到你家了。」\\r\\n胖子住城东，老小区，六楼，没电梯。\\r\\n我一口气爬上去，砸门。\\r\\n胖子开门，嘴里还嚼着薯片。\\r\\n「江总你还真来了，你……」\\r\\n我扒开门挤进去，反手把门锁死。\\r\\n「别说了，快让我进去躲躲！」\\r\\n胖子把薯片袋子放下，叹了口气，表情复杂得像便秘。\\r\\n「江迟，你失忆这一个月，我找过你八次。」\\r\\n「你第一次见我说：『你谁啊？我老公不让我跟陌生人说话。』」\\r\\n「第二次你说：『死胖子别烦我，我要跟我老公二人世界。』」\\r\\n「第三次你直接放狗咬我。」\\r\\n我：「……」\\r\\n胖子：「我说我不是陌生人，我是你发小。你说你有老公了，发小算什么。」\\r\\n我：「……」\\r\\n胖子：「我说你有真老公，叫傅时深。你说我诅咒你出轨。」\\r\\n我：「行了行了，兄弟，反正你让我在你这儿躲躲先。我得先捋捋。他们两个肯定不会放过我的，我身份证那些东西呢？我还是先跑国外躲躲吧。」\\r\\n胖子：「江总，你一个月没去公司了，你公司等会儿都要破产了，你还出国？」\\r\\n啧。\\r\\n是啊。\\r\\n我还有一个公司来着。\\r\\n那过去一个月我都没去公司，怎么就没人找我？\\r\\n我没有助理？\\r\\n我没有员工？\\r\\n老公不找我，老公不爱我，我助理员工呢？\\r\\n这事定是有猫腻。\\r\\n我颓废的坐在沙发上。\\r\\n想着一个一个来解决。\\r\\n先解决陆承衍吧。\\r\\n傅时深怎么也是我真老公，到时候哭一哭，撒撒娇应该可以过去。\\r\\n所以这一个月我到底对陆承衍干了什么？\\r\\n我趁他洗澡偷拿他内裤。\\r\\n趁他睡觉把门撬了，偷亲他……\\r\\n每天抱着他胳膊说「老公你身上好香」。\\r\\n他躲我，我追。\\r\\n他再躲，我直接扑。\\r\\n他反锁门，我撬门。\\r\\n他说「我是你死对头」，我说「死对头老公别闹」。\\r\\n……\\r\\n哎。\\r\\n心累。\\r\\n我这是把十八辈子的脸都丢尽了？\\r\\n忽然。\\r\\n胖子家门被敲响了。\\r\\n三下。\\r\\n不轻不重。\\r\\n很礼貌。\\r\\n但不知道为啥，我汗毛全竖起来了。\\r\\n胖子也愣了。\\r\\n「谁啊？」\\r\\n门外传来一个声音。\\r\\n低沉，冷淡，像冰碴子。\\r\\n「陆承衍。」\\r\\n我直接从沙发上弹起来，一把捂住胖子的嘴。\\r\\n「别说我在这儿！」\\r\\n胖子被我捂得翻白眼。\\r\\n门外又响了一声。\\r\\n「江迟，开门。我知道你在里面。」\\r\\n我压低嗓子：「他怎么知道？」\\r\\n胖子掰开我的手，喘了两口气。\\r\\n「我怎么知道？这个姓陆的不会在你手机上安装定位了吧？别说，姓陆的那玩意儿还真能干出来。」\\r\\n门外，陆承衍的声音又响起来。\\r\\n「江迟，我数三下。一。」\\r\\n我冲到窗边，往下看。\\r\\n六楼。\\r\\n跳下去不死也残。\\r\\n「二。」\\r\\n我看胖子。\\r\\n胖子摇头：「别看我，我打不过他。」\\r\\n我：「……」\\r\\n「三。」\\r\\n门「砰」地一声，被一脚踹开。\\r\\n陆承衍站在门口，西装外套搭在手臂上，衬衫领口解了两颗扣子。\\r\\n他看着我，眼神像在看一只跑不掉的兔子。\\r\\n「跑啊。怎么不跑了？」\\r\\n我后退，撞到沙发角。\\r\\n「陆承衍，你冷静。我是个有老公的人。」\\r\\n「哟，现在记得你有老公了？」\\r\\n我：「刚刚记起来的。」\\r\\n他：「可你喊我老公喊了一个月。」\\r\\n我：「我失忆了。」\\r\\n他：「失忆了就能随便抱人、亲人，还要晚上节目？」\\r\\n我：「……」\\r\\n他朝我走过来。\\r\\n我往后退。\\r\\n退到墙角，没路了。\\r\\n他伸手，一把捏住我的下巴，逼我抬头看他。\\r\\n「江迟，你喊老公，就得对我负责。别想跑！」\\r\\n干嘛啊。\\r\\n负什么责啊？\\r\\n我一个有老公的人！\\r\\n我被陆承衍扛下楼，塞到副驾驶。\\r\\n我被陆承衍关在了他的家里。\\r\\n他还说要追我。\\r\\n说关起来，更好追，不用费劲。\\r\\n我都以为我耳朵坏了。\\r\\n追什么？\\r\\n我不是有老公吗？\\r\\n我刚要跟他讲讲道理，接着就看见我的真老公出现在我跟前……\\r\\n傅时深是翻阳台进来的。\\r\\n六楼。\\r\\n他家保镖在下面举着手机拍。\\r\\n也不怕摔死。\\r\\n陆承衍正在厨房给我热糖醋排骨，听见动静，拎着锅铲就出来了。\\r\\n「傅时深，你他妈走门会死？吓到我老婆，你赔不起。」\\r\\n傅时深拍拍袖子上的灰。\\r\\n「走门你会让我进来？有别墅不住，非跑到六楼来，不就是为了防我？不对，谁是你老婆？江迟是我老婆。」\\r\\n他扫了我一眼。\\r\\n那一眼，又深又沉，像要把我钉在沙发上。\\r\\n「江迟，过来。」\\r\\n我还没动，陆承衍直接挡在我前面。\\r\\n「这一个月他天天挂我身上，晚上害怕了往我怀里钻，饿了张嘴让我喂，洗澡还要我递毛巾，你让他过去就过去？」\\r\\n我缩了缩头，小说嘀咕，「那是因为我不记得！」\\r\\n陆承衍回头瞪我：「你闭嘴，现在没让你说话。」\\r\\n我：「哦。」\\r\\n好可怕啊！\\r\\n他们好凶！！\\r\\n傅时深没理他，直接看着我。\\r\\n「江迟，陆承衍把我困在瑞典一个月，不是我不回来找你，是他害我。」\\r\\n「他还说你在他那儿很好，他还说他会照顾好你。」\\r\\n他的声音很平，但每个字都像从牙缝里挤出来的。\\r\\n我愣住了。\\r\\n「他说我很好，你就信了？你让我死对头照顾我？」\\r\\n傅时深脸色很难看，双眸通红。\\r\\n"}	null	[{"timestamp": "2026-08-26T03:41:32.350987+00:00", "message": "提取场景", "level": "info"}, {"timestamp": "2026-08-26T03:41:32.353427+00:00", "message": "开始提取场景...", "level": "info"}]	\N	2026-08-26 11:41:32.353416+08	\N	2026-08-26 11:41:32.348931+08	2026-08-26 11:50:04.305647+08	
