2e3c7828-cb91-4927-9404-a43b6133218d	0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea	generate_image_prompts	completed	normal	100	{"novel_id": "fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30"}	{"chapters": [{"id": "e0309eb3-8218-4498-87f8-800220241978", "title": "发现死对头老公出轨的危机感", "sort_order": 0, "pages": [{"id": "1957c97d-ac73-4804-b8b1-f435d55f7e24", "page_id": "P1", "layout_type": "L01 全屏格 (90%+)", "page_purpose": "开场悬念引出，展现主角清冷忧郁的状态", "visual_focus": "江迟捏抱枕的用力骨节与微蹙的眉头", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, romantic and youthful atmosphere, soft natural lighting, hints of peach pink and warm beige, clean white highlights. Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes, natural emotional expressions. The page layout is L01 full-screen panel (90%+). [Panel 1 (shotId 01, full screen)]: Close-up shot, fixed camera. Inside a modern apartment living room. 江迟 sits alone on a fabric sofa, with 江迟's hands tightly gripping a pillow with worn edges. 江迟's lips are pressed tightly together, eyebrows slightly pointing downwards, chin slightly raised up. In the background, there is a large floor-to-ceiling window with glowing neon signs outside. A hint of cool-toned neon light from outside hits 江迟's side face, creating a clean contrast. The visual focus is heavily on 江迟's downward-pressing eyebrows and the visible finger joints tightly squeezing the pillow. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我老公好像有男朋友了。'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "01", "sortOrder": 0}], "sort_order": 0}, {"id": "5e76a6c2-c0f5-44d7-8ff8-4dc8266abb9e", "page_id": "P2", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "情绪迅速反转，从清冷转为夸张哭闹，并引出互动对象", "visual_focus": "江迟瘫倒乱蹬的夸张动作对比陆承衍的冷峻", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, romantic and youthful atmosphere, soft natural lighting. Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes. The page layout is L05 top large, bottom small split layout (70% + 30%). [Panel 1 (shotId 02, top large panel)]: Medium shot, pull-back camera. Inside a modern apartment living room. 江迟 collapses flat on a wide sofa, legs kicking wildly in the air, hands grabbing 江迟's own soft hair, mouth wide open, a single crystal-clear teardrop squeezing out from the corner of 江迟's eye. Comic books and snack bags are scattered around the sofa. Warm soft light falls from the ceiling lamp. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '不抱我了，不亲我了，晚上节目也没有了！'. [Panel 2 (shotId 03, bottom small panel)]: Medium close-up, fixed camera. The panel is split into two halves. 陆承衍 wears a well-tailored black shirt, one hand in 陆承衍's pocket, the other hand extending an index finger pointing at 江迟. 陆承衍's eyebrows are tightly knitted, lips drawn into a straight line. 江迟 stands opposite, hands on 江迟's hips, cheeks puffed out. Modern apartment hallway setting. Bright overhead lighting falling vertically. A white speech bubble with soft shadow contains the Chinese text '还说我是他死对头，不是他老婆。'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "02", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "03", "sortOrder": 1}], "sort_order": 1}, {"id": "99fc0b5c-70b3-4a32-b524-8219b9f3d91a", "page_id": "P3", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "展现江迟愤怒不甘的情绪递进", "visual_focus": "江迟脚踩茶几爆发的动作与最后紧咬的下唇", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition. The page layout is L17 vertical scroll, staggered large, medium, small panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 04, top panel)]: Extreme close-up on 江迟's face. 江迟's mouth corners curl up on one side revealing a small canine tooth, eyes half-squinted, arms crossed over 江迟's chest. Blurred background with sharp lightning bolt comic effects. Dramatic lighting hitting from below. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '呵！渣男。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 05, middle large panel)]: Full shot. 江迟 stands up abruptly from the sofa, placing one foot on the edge of the coffee table, raising 江迟's right fist high in the air, eyes wide open with two fiery flame effects burning in the pupils. A glass cup on the coffee table has ripples in the water. Warm bright indoor light, highly saturated colors. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '肯定是外面那个闹着要名分了。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 06, bottom small panel)]: Close-up, low angle. 江迟 lowers 江迟's head, bangs covering 江迟's eyes. 江迟's hands are tightly clenched into fists at 江迟's sides, nails digging deep into the palms, corners of the mouth turning downwards, teeth aggressively biting 江迟's own lower lip. Background features dark space with a few red intersecting lines. Backlit effect with sharp rim light around 江迟's face. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我偏不如他愿。'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "04", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "05", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "06", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 2}, {"id": "980dee4a-efcb-4320-b8a6-4db64af01fb1", "page_id": "P4", "layout_type": "L04 出血格 (85%+, 元素冲破边框)", "page_purpose": "强烈的反击宣言，充满漫画式的浪漫冲动", "visual_focus": "江迟张开双臂灿烂夺目的笑容", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel. The page layout is L04 full-bleed panel with elements breaking the border (85%+). [Panel 1 (shotId 07, full screen)]: Medium shot, tracking camera. 江迟 takes a big step forward, arms spread wide open in a hugging posture, eyes sparkling brightly, corners of the mouth curved upwards into a huge, radiant smile. The background is filled with bright pink heart bubbles and twinkling star effects. 江迟 is entirely enveloped in a soft warm yellow glowing halo. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '我就要抱他，亲他，跟他回家！'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "07", "sortOrder": 0}], "sort_order": 3}, {"id": "3a38d764-0482-4030-b015-d550266b3571", "page_id": "P5", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "突发剧情转折：记忆恢复带来的震撼冲击", "visual_focus": "碎裂的记忆画面与江迟夸张震惊的表情", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, fresh and airy feel. The page layout is L05 top large, bottom small split layout (70% + 30%). [Panel 1 (shotId 08, top large panel)]: Close-up, fixed camera. A graphic glass-shattering comic effect covers the frame. 江迟's eyes suddenly widen perfectly round, pupils shrinking drastically, lips slightly parted open, a single drop of cold sweat sliding down 江迟's forehead. Pure white background with floating shattered fragments containing memory scenes. Intense white light hits from the front. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '后来我恢复了记忆。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 09, bottom small panel)]: Extreme close-up. 江迟's mouth is wide open in an 'O' shape, both hands covering 江迟's own cheeks, eyes bulging out like bells looking slightly towards the top left. The background is heavily populated with giant exclamation mark and question mark effects, vibrant colors. Flat even lighting preserving comic exaggeration. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '哦豁！'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "08", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "09", "sortOrder": 1}], "sort_order": 4}, {"id": "f86d2706-eb38-4eb2-aa94-5d53c4e3f314", "page_id": "P6", "layout_type": "L07 上下双分·均等 (50%+50%)", "page_purpose": "揭示真相时的自我吐槽与荒谬感", "visual_focus": "死对头的割裂感与红色结婚证的冲击", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft natural lighting. The page layout is L07 equal top and bottom split layout (50% + 50%). [Panel 1 (shotId 10, top panel)]: Medium close-up, tilted angle. The panel is split vertically. Left side: 陆承衍 stands with arms crossed over 陆承衍's chest, casting a sharp sidelong glance. Right side: 江迟 holds 江迟's head with both hands, mouth wide open, corner of the eye twitching with comic lines. A sharp crack line effect runs down the middle between the two characters. 陆承衍 is under cool blue lighting while 江迟 is under warm yellow lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我好像……还真是他死对头。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 11, bottom panel)]: Close-up, push-in camera. 江迟 places one hand on 江迟's forehead, the other hand scratching wildly in the air, eyebrows pinched tightly together, eyelids drooping downward heavily. A translucent illusion of a red marriage certificate floats in the background. Overhead lighting casting deep shadows in 江迟's eye sockets. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '更要命的是，我还真有一个老公。'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "10", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "11", "sortOrder": 1}], "sort_order": 5}, {"id": "18890c4d-39b6-4705-989d-fdb2ccbc0187", "page_id": "P7", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "正牌老公登场，极强的修罗场压迫感", "visual_focus": "傅时深高大的背光身形与极度深邃冰冷的眼眸", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, cinematic storyboard composition. The page layout is L05 top large, bottom small split layout (70% + 30%). [Panel 1 (shotId 12, top large panel)]: Full shot, low angle. Outside a coffee shop. 傅时深 stands tall and straight, wearing a dark high-end tailored suit, hands hanging naturally at 傅时深's sides. Further back, 江迟 is tightly hugging 陆承衍's arm with both hands, while 陆承衍 looks down at 江迟. Modern city street at night with soft neon lights. 傅时深 is completely backlit by the streetlamps, 傅时深's face covered in deep shadows, exuding a heavy presence. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '而此刻，我亲老公正站在我面前，'. [Panel 2 (shotId 13, bottom small panel)]: Close-up, fixed camera. Extreme close-up on 傅时深's eyes. 傅时深's eyes are narrow, pupils pitch black without any catchlights, brow ridge pressing down low, thin lips pressed into a tight straight line, jawline rigid and tense. In the blurred background, the silhouettes of 江迟 and 陆承衍 are visible. Hard top light hits 傅时深's brow bone. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '看着我抱着死对头喊老公，眸色幽深，声音冰冷：'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "12", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "13", "sortOrder": 1}], "sort_order": 6}, {"id": "7ab7beec-2aae-4bd8-bba9-65e5d26f00c2", "page_id": "P8", "layout_type": "L01 全屏格 (90%+)", "page_purpose": "剧情核心爆点，正牌老公的致命发问", "visual_focus": "傅时深扯领带的压迫感与冰冷的弧度", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, fresh and elegant visual feel. The page layout is L01 full-screen panel (90%+). [Panel 1 (shotId 14, full screen center)]: Medium close-up, push-in camera. 傅时深 leans forward slightly, raising 傅时深's left hand to gently pull on 傅时深's own necktie. 傅时深's eyes stare intensely straight ahead, corners of 傅时深's mouth lifting into a very faint, icy arc. The edges of the frame darken, focusing entirely on 傅时深's face. Cool-toned streetlamp light from the side traces the sharp contours of 傅时深's profile. A white speech bubble with soft shadow contains the Chinese text '「老婆，玩够了吗？」'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "14", "sortOrder": 0}], "sort_order": 7}, {"id": "285d0cf2-ceb8-452e-b89a-40c6ac3335ee", "page_id": "P9", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "开启回忆杀转场，铺垫失忆期间的乌龙相处", "visual_focus": "时光回溯的寂寥背景与江迟俏皮动作的对比", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones. The page layout is L17 vertical scroll, staggered large, medium, small panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 15, top panel)]: Long shot. Exterior view of a modern apartment revealing the inside through huge floor-to-ceiling windows. 江迟 sits alone, looking tiny, in the corner of a massive sofa, holding a mobile phone. 陆承衍 walks away towards another room, turning 陆承衍's back entirely to 江迟. Starry city night view outside. Cool blue night tones outside contrasting with warm but sparse indoor lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我老公好像有男朋友了。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 16, middle panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 places an index finger over 江迟's lips in a 'hush' gesture, one eye wide open, the other eye completely closed, with a playful smile on 江迟's mouth. The background features a giant comic magnifying glass icon. Bright warm yellow light hits 江迟's face evenly. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '别问我怎么发现的。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 17, bottom panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 lunges forward with both arms wide open trying to grab. 陆承衍 swiftly slides and dodges to the right side. 江迟 misses, 江迟's hands hovering in mid-air, body leaning forward off balance. Soft carpeted apartment living room. Action speed lines emphasize 陆承衍's swift movement. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他不抱我。'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "15", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "16", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "17", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 8}, {"id": "b1da82ca-667b-4f4e-9a87-ac525d67d57e", "page_id": "P10", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "连续展现江迟单方面求爱被拒的搞笑日常", "visual_focus": "捏鸭子嘴、面条泪及可怜巴巴的眼神", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones. The page layout is L15 vertical scroll, three equal horizontal panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 18, top panel)]: Medium close-up. 江迟 pushes lips outward, eyes closed tightly, cheeks flushed red, hands gripping tightly onto 陆承衍's sleeve. 陆承衍 uses 陆承衍's thumb and index finger to pinch 江迟's lips together into a duck-bill shape, 陆承衍's eyebrows slightly furrowed. Warm floor lamp lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '不亲我。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 19, middle panel)]: Close-up, low angle. 江迟 rests 江迟's chin on both palms, eyes sparkling brightly, two exaggerated thick waterfall-like comic tears streaming out from 江迟's eyes, mouth wide open. A large '22' number bubble floats in the background. Soft and fresh lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我才二十二岁啊。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 20, bottom panel)]: Medium shot, high angle. 江迟 wears silk pajamas, sitting on the edge of the bed, hands tightly gripping the edge of the blanket, staring pitifully at 陆承衍's back. 陆承衍 walks towards the door with large strides, not looking back. Spacious bedroom with a large bed. Dim wa