pen. 陆承衍 strides rapidly away in the front, breaking into a slight jog, turning the head back glancing with sharp vigilant eyes. Circling around the living room sofa. Horizontal comic speed lines emphasize the running motion. Bright indoor lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他开始躲我。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 50, bottom small panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 steps one big foot forward landing firmly on the tiled floor. 陆承衍 instantly steps back two paces in response, crossing both arms tightly across the chest in a defensive guard pose. Flat lighting focusing on the legs and body language. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我走近一步，他退两步。'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "48", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "49", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "50", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 22}, {"id": "315c8da5-ea64-4ed9-808a-d8ea44d0ffca", "page_id": "P24", "layout_type": "L07 上下双分·均等 (50%+50%)", "page_purpose": "极限防守的动作分解", "visual_focus": "悬空的双手与防贼一般捂嘴的大手", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones. The page layout is L07 equal top and bottom split layout (50% + 50%). [Panel 1 (shotId 51, top panel)]: Medium close-up. 江迟 stretches both arms straight forward, fingers open wide ready to hug. 陆承衍 sharply twists the upper body rightwards, dodging the arms completely, letting 江迟's hands barely graze past the fabric of the shirt. Dynamic motion blur lines around the arms, detailed clothing folds. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我伸手想抱，他直接侧身。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 52, bottom panel)]: Close-up, high angle. 江迟 stands on tiptoes, eyes closed shut, pushing lips outwards upwards attempting a kiss. 陆承衍 raises one large hand extending the palm, firmly covering flat over 江迟's mouth, pushing back. 陆承衍's eyebrows knit tightly, eyes highly alert. Strong overhead light highlighting the veins on the back of 陆承衍's hand. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我垫脚想亲，他一把捂住我的嘴，表情像在防贼。'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "51", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "52", "sortOrder": 1}], "sort_order": 23}, {"id": "2051d3d7-839b-4cbc-a51a-15a489039c36", "page_id": "P25", "layout_type": "L20 垂直通栏·大-窄-大夹层", "page_purpose": "强烈落差感：曾经的纯情与如今的冷漠对比", "visual_focus": "浴巾诱惑失败与脸红回忆的交叠", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones. The page layout is L20 vertical scroll, large-narrow-large sandwich panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 53, top large panel)]: Full shot, low angle. Standing at the bathroom door. 江迟 is wearing only a pure white bath towel wrapped around the body, revealing bare shoulders and collarbones, wet dripping hair, hands placed firmly on the waist, strutting playfully. Warm yellow steam and bathroom light spilling out from behind glowing beautifully on the wet skin. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '晚上洗完澡，我裹着浴巾在他眼前晃。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 54, middle narrow panel)]: Medium shot. 陆承衍 sits on the living room sofa, holding up a paper document with both hands directly covering the face, staring totally motionless straight at the document paper, eyes completely ignoring 江迟 in the front. A reading lamp casts a shadow behind the document. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他连看都不看一眼。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 55, bottom large panel)]: Medium close-up. A soft glowing flashback scene. 陆承衍 uses one hand to firmly pinch the back of 江迟's neck, turning the head away sharply, ear tips glowing intensely red, lips slightly open breathing, eyebrows knitted in pure flustered panic. Romantic warm memory filter with soft watercolor edges. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '以前他至少会红着耳尖骂我「不知羞」。'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "53", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "54", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "55", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 24}, {"id": "f71553ab-5599-4c90-a5d2-8930b3905363", "page_id": "P26", "layout_type": "L06 上下双分·上小下大 (30%+70%)", "page_purpose": "疑惑与闭门羹带来的打击", "visual_focus": "重重关上的房门与决绝的背影", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones. The page layout is L06 top small, bottom large split layout (30% + 70%). [Panel 1 (shotId 56, top small panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 folds arms across the chest, tilts the head to the side, squinting the eyes slightly, pulling down the corners of the mouth in confusion. A giant comic question mark bubble pops up above the head. Cold white indoor light. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '现在呢？'. [Panel 2 (shotId 57, bottom large panel)]: Medium shot, tracking camera. 陆承衍 stands up abruptly, snatching a mobile phone from the coffee table with one hand, striding fast towards the study room with a cold resolute back profile. On the right edge of the panel, the heavy wooden study door is drawn slamming shut violently, generating a large comic impact action text '砰' (BANG) with vibration lines. Shadows deepen as 陆承衍 walks into the dim hallway. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他拿起手机，直接进了书房，门「砰」地一声。'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "56", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "57", "sortOrder": 1}], "sort_order": 25}, {"id": "c5b23e47-07fb-44ba-9d68-d1664b8d1c78", "page_id": "P27", "layout_type": "L19 垂直通栏·一主两窄", "page_purpose": "烘托极度失落凄凉的心理状态", "visual_focus": "掉落浴巾的孤单身影与门缝底下一丝残忍的光线", "image_prompt": "3:4 