high-contrast sharp impact lines. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '天杀的啊！'. [Panel 2 (shotId 64, bottom panel)]: Full shot. Standing in the living room corner. 江迟 extends one hand spinning a large vintage globe forcefully, placing the other hand on the hip, eyebrows locked tight together, staring dead strictly at the spinning globe. Warm side light illuminates the globe and the side profile. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '世界上那么多男人，非要抢我老公吗？'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "63", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "64", "sortOrder": 1}], "sort_order": 28}, {"id": "65f4a8d6-7d7d-4963-b878-23de73e688e2", "page_id": "P30", "layout_type": "L01 全屏格 (90%+)", "page_purpose": "定格高光时刻，以彻底的乌龙决心结束本章节", "visual_focus": "江迟绑着必胜头巾热血沸腾的坚毅面貌", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, cinematic storyboard composition. The page layout is L01 full-screen panel (90%+). [Panel 1 (shotId 65, full screen)]: Medium shot, push-in camera. 江迟 wears a white fabric headband tightly tied across the forehead with the black Chinese characters '必胜' written on it. 江迟 tightly crosses the arms across the chest, lifting the chin high up proudly, eyes glowing brightly with unyielding determination, mouth curved up into a highly confident smile. A brilliant radiant golden comic burst effect explodes directly from the background outward. Strong epic top spotlight catching bright highlights on the nose and forehead. A white speech bubble with soft shadow contains the Chinese text '我是个传统的男人，我得让我这个迷途的老公知返。'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "65", "sortOrder": 0}], "sort_order": 29}]}, {"id": "2333d518-84fe-448a-9603-0dc0d62fe4bb", "title": "抓奸反倒自投罗网", "sort_order": 1, "pages": [{"id": "254ac275-1492-4a1c-ab0d-51c9f6da44e8", "page_id": "P31", "layout_type": "L16 垂直通栏·四层匀速", "page_purpose": "展示江迟鬼祟跟踪的行为与内心丰富的脑补战斗计划", "visual_focus": "江迟夸张的肢体动作与全副武装的打扮", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L16 vertical single column with four equally spaced horizontal panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 66, top panel)]: City street scene with bright and fresh sunlight. 江迟 hides behind a thick utility pole, leaning half of his body out with his eyes widened, staring intensely ahead. Not far ahead, 陆承衍 walks steadily on the sidewalk. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '于是我开始跟踪陆承衍。' [Panel 2 (shotId 67, second panel)]: 江迟 stands behind the utility pole, both hands curled into fists and placed at his chest, his eyebrows slightly drawn together and lips pressed into a tight straight line. Behind 江迟 is an imagined comic bubble, inside which 江迟 stands with hands on hips, gesturing animatedly at a blurred human figure, surrounded by preaching text symbols. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我打算找到他外面的那个男朋友，先好好跟人讲讲道理，' [Panel 3 (shotId 68, third panel)]: Medium close-up, tilted angle. 江迟 raises his right arm forcefully to show off his bicep, the corners of his mouth turned up confidently, his eyes sharp and focused. The background behind him changes to burning red flame effects. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '要是道理讲不通，我一米八的个子还可以跟他打一架。' [Panel 4 (shotId 69, bottom panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 uses both hands to pull down the brim of a black baseball cap, while pulling up a black face mask to cover most of his face. He wears a loose hooded sweatshirt. Only his vigilant, darting eyes are visible, with light 