 effect pops up above his head. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '师傅，您怎么知道？'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "70", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "71", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "72", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 1}, {"id": "bb55c732-d3d3-4e26-9e2c-185e4a6afc3f", "page_id": "P33", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "延续幽默互动，展示江迟吃瘪的搞笑状态", "visual_focus": "司机见多识广的得瑟模样对比江迟的极度无语", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L05 top and bottom split, top takes 70%, bottom takes 30%. [Panel 1 (shotId 73, top panel)]: Medium shot. The driver looks forward at the road again, lifting one hand off the steering wheel in a casual waving gesture. The corners of his mouth turn slightly downwards, his chin slightly lifted. Dappled light and shadows flow inside the car. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the driver's mouth, contains the Chinese text '你这副表情，我拉过太多了。' [Panel 2 (shotId 74, bottom panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 slumps back in the rear seat, the corner of his eye twitching slightly, his eyebrows drooping weakly down. Several thick black vertical lines are drawn on his forehead, his chin slightly tucked in. The background is processed in grayscale. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '……'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "73", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "74", "sortOrder": 1}], "sort_order": 2}, {"id": "6884e7e0-5ffb-457f-b76d-f0305712ef4f", "page_id": "P34", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "快速推进剧情，锁定目标车辆并建立跟踪的紧张感", "visual_focus": "前方的黑色宾利与江迟紧张专注的视线", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspe