ly grabbing 陆承衍's arm and yanking him half-standing out of his chair, motion lines trailing from the chair legs on the floor. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我直直冲到窗边，一把拽住陆承衍的胳膊，把他拽起。' [Panel 2 (shotId 121, bottom left panel)]: Close-up, tilted angle. 江迟's mouth is wide open showing white teeth, his eyebrows pointing sharply down, glaring fiercely at 陆承衍. A giant jagged explosion-style speech bubble points to 江迟, containing the Chinese text '陆承衍！' [Panel 3 (shotId 122, bottom right panel)]: Medium close-up. 江迟's eyes slightly round and wide, his body rigidly holding the pulling posture. His long eyelashes tremble slightly. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '声音大得连我自己都吓一跳。'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "120", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "121", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "122", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 19}, {"id": "164c4a94-26b3-46ba-b216-36ec8da97d36", "page_id": "P51", "layout_type": "L18 垂直通栏·顶窄底宽递增", "page_purpose": "火力全开，进行正牌妻子的无理取闹式控诉", "visual_focus": "从挑衅到委屈最终贴脸宣告主权的情绪大爆发", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L18 vertical single column with three panels, narrow at the top and gradually widening towards the bottom. [Panel 1 (shotId 123, top narrow panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟's one hand still tightly grips 陆承衍's arm, while his other hand extends an index finger pointing straight at 傅时深 across the table. He lifts his chin, eyebrows raised. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '这就是你外面偷偷养的男朋友？' [Panel 2 (shotId 124, center medium panel)]: Medium close-up. 江迟's peach-blossom eyes are wide open, lips 