. Jiang Chi tightly pressing the phone to his ear, shoulders hunched high, body slightly curled up. A crystal tear hangs at the corner of Jiang Chi's eye, pupils slightly shaking, mouth slightly open, chin trembling. Soft yellow streetlamp light shining on Jiang Chi's face. Visual focus on the teardrop and trembling lips. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我拨过去，声音都在抖：「胖子，救我。」' [Bottom large panel, medium close-up]: Inside Pangzi's messy but cozy old living room. Pangzi standing next to a coffee table, holding a phone to his ear with one hand. Pangzi raising one eyebrow high, corner of his mouth curving up into a teasing smirk. Warm yellow overhead lighting hitting Pangzi's face. Visual focus on Pangzi's raised eyebrow. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '胖子阴阳怪气，「呦，江总这是把我从黑名单放出来了？'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "195", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "196", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "197", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 0}, {"id": "f6b88bfc-4d8e-4cec-810a-271194621353", "page_id": "P79", "layout_type": "L06 上下双分·上小下大 (30%+70%)", "page_purpose": "从胖子的话语中，江迟的大脑受到刺激，突然唤醒失忆期的关键记忆", "visual_focus": "江迟瞳孔骤缩、紧捂额头的剧烈反应", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere, normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features. The page layout is L06 Top and bottom split, top small and bottom large (30% + 70%). [Top small panel, medium shot]: Inside Pangzi's living room. Pangzi sitting heavily on a fabric sofa, holding a phone, tapping his other hand's fingers on the sofa armrest, eyes rolling upwards showing the whites, corners of the mouth turned down. Snack bags scattered around. Warm yellow indoor lighting illuminating Pangzi's whole body. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '不怕我说你老公坏话，破坏你们夫夫感情了？」' [Bottom large panel, close-up zooming out]: Inside the taxi back seat. Jiang Chi's eyes suddenly widened, staring straight ahead, pupils sharply contracted, one hand forcefully covering his forehead with knuckles turning white. Streetlight shadows casting diagonal lines on Jiang Chi's face. Visual focus on Jiang Chi's widened pupils and the hand covering the forehead. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我想起来了。'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "198", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "199", "sortOrder": 1}], "sort_order": 1}, {"id": "323d4d4a-ee96-4fa0-b702-e84b193a659e", "page_id": "P80", "layout_type": "L11 上1下2·下均分 (上55%, 下45%平分)", "page_purpose": "通过回忆画面的强烈反差，展示过去一个月胖子的焦急与江迟的傲娇", "visual_focus": "上方密集的未接来电，与下方胖子的急躁和江迟的理直气壮形成双重视角对比", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. The page layout is L11 Top 1 bottom 2, bottom evenly split (Top 55%, Bottom 45% evenly split). [Top large panel, wide shot]: Abstract memory space. A giant smartphone screen in the center displaying dozens of missed calls, all with the caller name '胖子' in Chinese. Halftone dot blurred background. Screen emitting a cool blue backlight. Visual focus on the dense '胖子' call logs. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '这一个月胖子给我打过很多电话的，' [Bottom left panel, medium shot]: Street in memory. Pangzi standing under a streetlamp, frantically gesturing with hands and feet, one hand holding a phone to his ear, the other waving in the air, large sweat drops on Pangzi's forehead, mouth opened wide. Cold white overhead lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '每次都跟我说陆承衍不是我老公，' [Bottom right panel, medium shot]: Jiang Chi in memory. Jiang Chi standing on a balcony, holding a phone to his ear with one hand, forcefully resting the other hand on his hip, neck stiffened, lips pouted outward, corners of the eyes slightly raised in a confident manner. Soft morning light hitting Jiang Chi's side profile. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '而我每次都说他是见不得我好，想要破坏我夫夫感情。'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "200", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "201", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "202", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 2}, {"id": "115bbbdd-3023-4ac8-bf04-c1f1f33f90c0", "page_id": "P81", "layout_type": "L18 垂直通栏·顶窄底宽递增", "page_purpose": "羞耻感层层叠加，直到失忆时极度黏人的高甜/高耻度画面爆发", "visual_focus": "江迟红透的耳朵与回忆里像树袋熊般抱住陆承衍的动作", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere, normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features. The page layout is L18 Vertical column, increasing width from top to bottom. [Top narrow panel, close-up]: Inside the taxi. Jiang Chi biting his lower lip until it turns white, one hand thrust into his hair, forcefully pulling his own hair, brows tightly knitted together. Red halos from outside traffic lights reflecting on the window. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '啧。' [Middle panel, medium shot with tilted angle]: Taxi back seat. Jiang Chi covering his bright red cheeks with both hands, body sinking deeply into the leather seat, legs curled together, exposed ears glowing bright red. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我好歹是个总啊，怎么失忆了就跟中蛊一样？' [Bottom wide panel, medium shot zooming in]: Flashback to a bright villa living room. Jiang Chi tightly wrapping both arms and legs around Lu Chengyan's arm like a koala, hanging onto Lu Chengyan's body. Jiang Chi looking up, eyes curved into crescent moons, showing white teeth in a big smile. Warm afternoon sunlight shining through floor-to-ceiling windows. Visual focus on Jiang Chi's limbs clinging to Lu Chengyan. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我怎么能抱着陆承衍喊了一个月的老公呢？'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "203", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "204", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "205", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 3}, {"id": "e151d842-8a0e-4b9f-bc07-a2267dabd611", "page_id": "P82", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "情绪从极致羞耻逐渐冷却，转为疲惫和对现实的逃避", "visual_focus": "江迟抱膝发抖的身影和失焦看着窗外的眼神", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. The page layout is L15 Vertical column, three equal vertical panels. [Top panel, medium shot]: Inside the taxi. Jiang Chi covering flush cheeks tightly with both hands, head buried deeply between pressed knees, shoulders slightly trembling, body curled up into a small ball. Dim car lighting with a sliver of cold light highlighting the edge of Jiang Chi's trembling shoulders. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '还，还……' [Middle panel, medium close-up]: Inside the taxi. Jiang Chi slowly lowering his hands from his face, letting out a long breath, previously tense shoulders relaxing and dropping down, tightly pressed lips slightly parted. Soft streetlamp light on Jiang Chi's face. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '算了。' [Bottom panel, side profile close-up]: Inside the taxi. Jiang Chi turning his head to look out the car window, eyes slightly unfocused, pupils reflecting the rapidly retreating street scenes, chin slightly lifted. Colorful neon lights from outside flashing across Jiang Chi's side profile. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '往事不可追……'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "206", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "207", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "208", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 4}, {"id": "ad0d7ec7-86cd-42b2-9524-c3f597e19239", "page_id": "P83", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "求生欲战胜了羞耻，江迟爆发极强行动力狂奔上楼求助", "visual_focus": "充满张力的咆哮求救，与狂奔砸门时狼狈急促的肢体动作", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features. The page layout is L17 Vertical column, large, medium and small staggered layout. [Top panel, medium close-up with tilted angle]: Inside the taxi. Jiang Chi turning his head back sharply, gripping the smartphone tightly with both hands, veins bulging on the back of his hands, shouting into the microphone, brows twisted together, mouth opened wide. Screen backlight illuminating the lower half of Jiang Chi's face. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the speaker's mouth, contains the Chinese text '「老子快死了，你就说救不救？我马上到你家了。」' [Middle panel, wide shot from a low angle]: Old and shabby staircase. Peeling walls and narrow stairs. Jiang Chi running wildly up the dusty stairs, bending forward using hands and feet, taking huge strides, fine sweat covering his forehead. Dim yellow motion-sensor lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '胖子住城东，老小区，六楼，没电梯。' [Bottom panel, medium shot]: In front of the door on the sixth floor. Jiang Chi standing before a rusty security door, chest heaving heavily, panting with mouth wide open, both hands curled into fists pounding forcefully on the iron door, sweat rolling down his cheeks onto his clothes. Dim overhead yellow light pulling long shadows. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我一口气爬上去，砸门。'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "209", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "210", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "211", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 5}, {"id": "ac4ae995-1f1f-4936-9289-e6a24849163b", "page_id": "P84", "layout_type": "L16 垂直通栏·四层匀速", "page_purpose": "快节奏切分，展现胖子的惊诧与江迟如临大敌般的躲避反应", "visual_focus": "胖子瞪大的眼睛，与江迟挤入门内用力反锁的背影", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, normal realistic human proportions. The page layout is L16 Vertical column, four equal horizontal layers. [Layer 1, medium shot zooming out]: At Pangzi's door. The security door is pulled open from the inside, Pangzi standing behind it wearing loose, pill-covered pajamas, holding a bag of potato chips, mouth stuffed with chips bulging like a hamster, chewing rhythmically. Bright warm white indoor light spilling out. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '胖子开门，嘴里还嚼着薯片。' [Layer 2, medium close-up]: At Pangzi's door. Pangzi's eyes suddenly widening, showing the whites, mouth slightly opened in surprise, small chip crumbs falling from the corners of his mouth, staring blankly outside. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the speaker's mouth, contains the Chinese text '「江总你还真来了，你……」' [Layer 3, medium shot tracking]: Inside Pangzi's entryway. Jiang Chi squeezing fiercely through the gap between the security door and Pangzi sideways. Jiang Chi turning his back to the room, both hands swiftly and forcefully pressing down the metal door handle to lock the deadbolt. Indoor overhead light shining on Jiang Chi's back. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我扒开门挤进去，反手把门锁死。' [Layer 4, medium close-up]: Inside Pangzi's entryway. Jiang Chi leaning his back heavily against the cold security door, knees slightly bent, panting heavily with chest heaving, a bead of sweat rolling down the tip of his nose, brows tightly knitted, staring intently forward. Warm yellow light hitting the top of Jiang Chi's head. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the speaker's mouth, contains the Chinese text '「别说了，快让我进去躲躲！」'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "212", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "213", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "214", "sortOrder": 2}, {"shotId": "215", "sortOrder": 3}], "sort_order": 6}, {"id": "f5e61f50-50db-4f5c-ba2c-755a51fa996f", "page_id": "P85", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "胖子开始清算旧账，引出失忆期间第一件社死荒唐事", "visual_focus": "胖子伸出的八根手指和闪回中江迟看陌生人一样的警惕眼神", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading. The page layout is L15 Vertical column, three equal vertical panels. [Top panel, medium shot]: Pangzi's living room. Pangzi heavily slamming the potato chip bag onto the coffee table, both hands on his hips. Pangzi's brows tightly squeezed together, corners of the mouth pulled extremely downwards, facial features scrunched up. Bright overhead light illuminating cluttered items. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '胖子把薯片袋子放下，叹了口气，表情复杂得像便秘。' [Middle panel, medium close-up zooming in]: Pangzi's living room. Pangzi leaning his body forward, extending eight fingers from both hands, shaking them forcefully right in front of Jiang Chi's eyes, eyes bulging perfectly round, staring fixedly at Jiang Chi. Indoor light casting shadows on Pangzi's shaking fingers. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the speaker's mouth, contains the Chinese text '「江迟，你失忆这一个月，我找过你八次。」' [Bottom panel, medium shot]: Flashback, villa entrance. Amnesiac Jiang Chi hiding behind a heavy mahogany door, poking only half of his head out, both hands gripping the doorframe edge tightly, eyes slightly narrowed, glancing suspiciously at Pangzi outside, chin slightly raised. Afternoon sunlight slanting in from outside. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the speaker's mouth, contains the Chinese text '「你第一次见我说：『你谁啊？我老公不让我跟陌生人说话。』」'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "216", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "217", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "218", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 7}, {"id": "729a0629-d73d-4975-a42f-4e8f08739ef3", "page_id": "P86", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "社死往事火力升级，胖子被放狗咬的画面与现实中江迟的绝望成对比", "visual_focus": "飞在半空的拖鞋、狂奔的哈士奇，以及江迟红透的后颈", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading. The page layout is L17 Vertical column, large, medium and small staggered layout. [Top panel, medium shot]: Flashback, villa courtyard. Amnesiac Jiang Ch