venly split). [Top panel, medium shot]: Pangzi's living room. Pangzi standing in the center, hands resting forcefully on his hips, body leaning forward heavily, neck stiffened, mouth opened wide shouting, tiny spittles visible under the light. Overhead light creating strong light-and-shadow contrast. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the speaker's mouth, contains the Chinese text '胖子：「我说我不是陌生人，我是你发小。' [Bottom left panel, medium close-up]: Pangzi's living room. Pangzi clutching both hands tightly over his chest, brows squeezed together, corners of the mouth pulled down, eyes squeezed shut tightly, making an exaggerated crying expression. Warm lighting enhancing the theatrical feel. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '你说你有老公了，发小算什么。」' [Bottom right panel, medium shot from high angle]: Corner of Pangzi's living room. Jiang Chi curled up tightly in the corner of a large fabric sofa, arms hugging his bent knees, face buried deeply in his arms, only showing a fluffy top of hair, shoulders slightly hunched. Overhead lighting casting shadows over Jiang Chi. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我：「……」'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "222", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "223", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "224", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 9}, {"id": "d7a3b503-a340-4ed5-b471-99741e10ae11", "page_id": "P88", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "结束社死回忆杀，江迟放下身段求饶，回归解决当前危机的正题", "visual_focus": "江迟双手合十眼带泪光的讨好表情，与盘腿按压太阳穴的思考动作", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading. The page layout is L15 Vertical column, three equal vertical panels. [Top panel, medium close-up]: Pangzi's living room. Pangzi raising both hands high in the air, palms open, rolling his eyeballs up so hard only the whites show, mouth twisted into a wavy curve. Overhead light on Pangzi's comical face. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '胖子：「我说你有真老公，叫傅时深。你说我诅咒你出轨。」' [Middle panel, medium shot zooming in]: Pangzi's living room. Jiang Chi suddenly lifting his head from his arms, pressing both palms together in front of his chest bowing up and down repeatedly, a teardrop hanging at the corner of his eye, tip of the nose flushed red, lips slightly pouting. Warm light hitting Jiang Chi's red nose. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the speaker's mouth, contains the Chinese text '我：「行了行了，兄弟，反正你让我在你这儿躲躲先。' [Bottom panel, wide shot]: Pangzi's living room. Jiang Chi sitting cross-legged on the fabric sofa without shoes, pressing the index fingers of both hands hard against his temples, brows furrowed into a deep frown, lips tightly pressed into a line, staring at the coffee table. Potato chips and a remote control scattered on the table. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我得先捋捋。'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "225", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "226", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "227", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 10}, {"id": "681b88e4-0f78-4622-807b-61972a243c0d", "page_id": "P89", "layout_type": "L16 垂直通栏·四层匀速", "page_purpose": "江迟企图逃避出国却遭到胖子关于公司破产的现实暴击", "visual_focus": "江迟翻底朝天的口袋和胖子极具压迫感直戳前方的食指", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading. The page layout is L16 Vertical column, four equal horizontal layers. [Layer 1, medium shot tracking]: Pangzi's living room.