 pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading. The page layout is L21 Equal grid, 2x2 four panels. [Top-left panel, medium shot zooming in]: On Pangzi's sofa. Jiang Chi suddenly sitting up straight, pressing both hands hard on his knees with knuckles turning white, eyes widened instantly with sharply contracted pupils, jaw slightly dropped, staring blankly at the air in front. Sharp lighting creating clear light and shadow boundaries on Jiang Chi's face. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '那过去一个月我都没去公司，怎么就没人找我？' [Top-right panel, medium close-up]: On Pangzi's sofa. Jiang Chi pointing backward at his own nose with one index finger, brows twisted tightly, eyes wide open, mouth slightly open showing white teeth. Light focusing on Jiang Chi's face with a slightly blurred background. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我没有助理？' [Bottom-left panel, medium shot]: On Pangzi's sofa. Jiang Chi throwing both hands outward with palms completely facing up, shoulders hunched up high almost touching his ears, neck tucked in, corners of his mouth pulled down into a helpless curve. Warm indoor lighting covering Jiang Chi's body. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我没有员工？' [Bottom-right panel, medium close-up]: On Pangzi's sofa. Jiang Chi lifting both hands and digging all ten fingers deeply into his hair, scratching frantically and messing his hair into a bird's nest, both cheeks puffed up high like buns, eyes squeezed shut tightly. Overhead light creating highlights on his messy hair. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '老公不找我，老公不爱我，我助理员工呢？'", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "235", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "236", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "237", "sortOrder": 2}, {"shotId": "238", "sortOrder": 3}], "sort_order": 13}, {"id"