's cheek. 江迟 has a visible red flush on the cheeks and sparkling eyes. Moonlight shines through the window onto the faces. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '趁他睡觉把门撬了，偷亲他……'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "245", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "246", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "247", "sortOrder": 2}], "sort_order": 0}, {"id": "727b71be-4512-49e7-8170-112b26ac0316", "page_id": "P95", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "强化滑稽的社死情节连续性", "visual_focus": "江迟疯狂纠缠陆承衍的夸张肢体动作", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft natural lighting, fresh and airy feel, gentle color transitions, hints of peach pink and warm beige, clean white highlights, light and cheerful mood, Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes, fashionable modern clothing. Page layout is a vertical scrolling layout, three equal consecutive panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 248, top panel)]: A memory scene in a bright living room. 陆承衍 sits on a sofa with stiff posture and slightly furrowed brows. 江迟 clings tightly to 陆承衍's arm like a koala, rubbing 江迟's cheek against 陆承衍's shoulder, eyes closed with an intoxicated smile. Warm afternoon sunlight. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '每天抱着他胳膊说「老公你身上好香」。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 249, middle panel)]: A wide tracking shot of a memory scene in a spacious corridor. 陆承衍 takes large strides forward, gaze directed to the side. Behind 陆承衍, 江迟 is running with arms waving in the air, mouth wide open shouting, with exaggerated sweat drops on 江迟's forehead. Bright indoor overhead lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他躲我，我追。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 250, bottom panel)]: A wide side-view shot of a memory scene in the c