 rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他说「我是你死对头」，我说「死对头老公别闹」。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 253, third panel)]: A close-up shot back in the real-world living room. 江迟 covers the cheeks tightly with both hands, fingers dug deeply into the hair with knuckles turning white. 江迟's ears are bright red, eyes squeezed shut, with large sweat drops on the forehead. Black vertical line effects are scattered around. Dull indoor lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '……'. [Panel 4 (shotId 254, bottom panel)]: A high-angle medium shot on the old sofa. 江迟 collapses backward limply against the sofa back, mouth slightly open, exhaling a long breath, staring blankly at the ceiling. Next to 江迟 on the table is 胖子's half-eaten bag of potato chips. Dappled natural sunlight from the window. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the speaker's mouth, contains the Chinese text '哎。'.", "image_url": "", "reference_ids": [], "shots": [{"shotId": "251", "sortOrder": 0}, {"shotId": "252", "sortOrder": 1}, {"shotId": "253", "sortOrder": 2}, {"shotId": "254", "sortOrder": 3}], "sort_order": 2}, {"id": "a568055f-e8fc-419d-ae7d-2db1e6a43cfa", "page_id": "P97", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "突发意外打破了丢脸的情绪，营造悬疑氛围", "visual_focus": "从江迟的自我折磨瞬间切换至突然响起的敲门声", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft natural lighting, fresh and airy feel, gentle color transitions, hints of peach pink and warm beige, clean white highlights, light and cheerful mood, Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes, fashionable modern clothing. Page layout is a vertical scrolling layout, staggered large, medium, and small panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 255, top large panel)]: An extreme close-up of 江迟's face tilted at an angle. 江迟's eyebrows