ba7820ed-446f-46d9-9655-87f2188887ce	0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea	generate_page_images	completed	normal	100	{"novel_id": "fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30"}	{"chapters": [{"id": "e0309eb3-8218-4498-87f8-800220241978", "title": "发现死对头老公出轨的危机感", "sort_order": 0, "pages": [{"id": "1957c97d-ac73-4804-b8b1-f435d55f7e24", "page_id": "P1", "layout_type": "L01 全屏格 (90%+)", "page_purpose": "开场悬念引出，展现主角清冷忧郁的状态", "visual_focus": "江迟捏抱枕的用力骨节与微蹙的眉头", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, romantic and youthful atmosphere, soft natural lighting, hints of peach pink and warm beige, clean white highlights. Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes, natural emotional expressions. The page layout is L01 full-screen panel (90%+). [Panel 1 (shotId 01, full screen)]: Close-up shot, fixed camera. Inside a modern apartment living room. 江迟 sits alone on a fabric sofa, with 江迟's hands tightly gripping a pillow with worn edges. 江迟's lips are pressed tightly together, eyebrows slightly pointing downwards, chin slightly raised up. In the background, there is a large floor-to-ceiling window with glowing neon signs outside. A hint of cool-toned neon light from outside hits 江迟's side face, creating a clean contrast. The visual focus is heavily on 江迟's downward-pressing eyebrows and the visible finger joints tightly squeezing the pillow. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我老公好像有男朋友了。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P1.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "01", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我老公好像有男朋友了。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，固定镜头。现代都市公寓客厅内。江迟独自坐在布艺沙发上，双手紧紧捏着一个边缘磨损的抱枕，双唇紧抿，眉头微蹙，下巴微微扬起。环境细节：背景是巨大的落地窗，窗外霓虹灯牌闪烁。光线与质感：窗外的冷色调霓虹光打在江迟侧脸，线条精致流畅，氛围清冷。漫画视觉重点：突出江迟微微下压的眉毛和用力捏抱枕的手指骨节。"}], "sort_order": 0}, {"id": "5e76a6c2-c0f5-44d7-8ff8-4dc8266abb9e", "page_id": "P2", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "情绪迅速反转，从清冷转为夸张哭闹，并引出互动对象", "visual_focus": "江迟瘫倒乱蹬的夸张动作对比陆承衍的冷峻", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, romantic and youthful atmosphere, soft natural lighting. Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes. The page layout is L05 top large, bottom small split layout (70% + 30%). [Panel 1 (shotId 02, top large panel)]: Medium shot, pull-back camera. Inside a modern apartment living room. 江迟 collapses flat on a wide sofa, legs kicking wildly in the air, hands grabbing 江迟's own soft hair, mouth wide open, a single crystal-clear teardrop squeezing out from the corner of 江迟's eye. Comic books and snack bags are scattered around the sofa. Warm soft light falls from the ceiling lamp. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '不抱我了，不亲我了，晚上节目也没有了！'. [Panel 2 (shotId 03, bottom small panel)]: Medium close-up, fixed camera. The panel is split into two halves. 陆承衍 wears a well-tailored black shirt, one hand in 陆承衍's pocket, the other hand extending an index finger pointing at 江迟. 陆承衍's eyebrows are tightly knitted, lips drawn into a straight line. 江迟 stands opposite, hands on 江迟's hips, cheeks puffed out. Modern apartment hallway setting. Bright overhead lighting falling vertically. A white speech bubble with soft shadow contains the Chinese text '还说我是他死对头，不是他老婆。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P2.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "02", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "不抱我了，不亲我了，晚上节目也没有了！", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，拉镜头。现代都市公寓客厅。江迟整个人瘫倒在宽大的沙发上，双腿胡乱蹬着半空，双手抓着自己柔软的头发，嘴巴张大，眼角挤出一滴晶莹的泪珠。环境细节：沙发周围散落着几本漫画书和零食袋。光线与质感：室内顶灯的柔光洒下，色调清透明亮。漫画视觉重点：表现江迟双腿乱蹬的动作、张大的嘴型以及眼角夸张的泪滴。"}, {"shotId": "03", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "还说我是他死对头，不是他老婆。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，固定镜头。画面一分为二的对话切割。陆承衍穿着剪裁得体的黑色衬衫，单手插兜，另一只手伸出食指指着江迟，眉头紧锁，嘴唇拉成一条直线。江迟站在他对面，双手叉腰，脸颊气得鼓起。环境细节：冷色调的现代公寓走廊。光线与质感：顶部的白炽灯光垂直落下，光影分明，线条硬朗。漫画视觉重点：陆承衍冷峻的面部线条和指着江迟的手指，以及两人紧绷的距离。"}], "sort_order": 1}, {"id": "99fc0b5c-70b3-4a32-b524-8219b9f3d91a", "page_id": "P3", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "展现江迟愤怒不甘的情绪递进", "visual_focus": "江迟脚踩茶几爆发的动作与最后紧咬的下唇", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition. The page layout is L17 vertical scroll, staggered large, medium, small panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 04, top panel)]: Extreme close-up on 江迟's face. 江迟's mouth corners curl up on one side revealing a small canine tooth, eyes half-squinted, arms crossed over 江迟's chest. Blurred background with sharp lightning bolt comic effects. Dramatic lighting hitting from below. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '呵！渣男。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 05, middle large panel)]: Full shot. 江迟 stands up abruptly from the sofa, placing one foot on the edge of the coffee table, raising 江迟's right fist high in the air, eyes wide open with two fiery flame effects burning in the pupils. A glass cup on the coffee table has ripples in the water. Warm bright indoor light, highly saturated colors. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '肯定是外面那个闹着要名分了。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 06, bottom small panel)]: Close-up, low angle. 江迟 lowers 江迟's head, bangs covering 江迟's eyes. 江迟's hands are tightly clenched into fists at 江迟's sides, nails digging deep into the palms, corners of the mouth turning downwards, teeth aggressively biting 江迟's own lower lip. Background features dark space with a few red intersecting lines. Backlit effect with sharp rim light around 江迟's face. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我偏不如他愿。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P3.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "04", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "呵！渣男。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：大特写，推镜头。江迟的脸部特写。江迟单侧嘴角向上扬起，露出一颗小虎牙，眼睛半眯，双臂在胸前交叉。环境细节：背景虚化，加入一些尖锐的闪电符号特效。光线与质感：从下方打上来的戏剧性光线，阴影覆盖大半张脸，条漫质感强烈。漫画视觉重点：江迟半眯的眼睛和上扬的嘴角，展现其不服气的神态。"}, {"shotId": "05", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "肯定是外面那个闹着要名分了。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：全景，固定镜头。江迟从沙发上猛地站起身，一只脚踩在茶几边缘，右手握拳高高举起，眼睛瞪大，眼底燃烧着两团火焰般的特效。环境细节：茶几上的玻璃杯被震得水波微荡，现代风格的客厅背景。光线与质感：明亮的室内暖光，人物身上带有高光，色彩鲜艳饱和。漫画视觉重点：江迟踩茶几的夸张肢体动作和高举的拳头，带有强烈的视觉冲击。"}, {"shotId": "06", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "我偏不如他愿。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，仰拍。江迟低下头，刘海遮住眼睛，双手用力握紧拳头放在身体两侧，指甲深深陷入掌心，嘴角微微下撇，随后又猛地咬住下唇。环境细节：背景是大面积的纯黑，只有几缕红色的线条交织。光线与质感：逆光效果，江迟的面部笼罩在阴影中，边缘有锐利的轮廓光。漫画视觉重点：江迟紧咬的下唇和用力握紧的双拳。"}], "sort_order": 2}, {"id": "980dee4a-efcb-4320-b8a6-4db64af01fb1", "page_id": "P4", "layout_type": "L04 出血格 (85%+, 元素冲破边框)", "page_purpose": "强烈的反击宣言，充满漫画式的浪漫冲动", "visual_focus": "江迟张开双臂灿烂夺目的笑容", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel. The page layout is L04 full-bleed panel with elements breaking the border (85%+). [Panel 1 (shotId 07, full screen)]: Medium shot, tracking camera. 江迟 takes a big step forward, arms spread wide open in a hugging posture, eyes sparkling brightly, corners of the mouth curved upwards into a huge, radiant smile. The background is filled with bright pink heart bubbles and twinkling star effects. 江迟 is entirely enveloped in a soft warm yellow glowing halo. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '我就要抱他，亲他，跟他回家！'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P4.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "07", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我就要抱他，亲他，跟他回家！", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，跟镜头。江迟大步向前迈出，双手大大地张开做出要拥抱的姿势，双眼亮晶晶的，嘴角大幅度上扬，露出灿烂的笑容。环境细节：画面分割，背景切换为明亮的粉色爱心气泡和闪烁的星星。光线与质感：全身笼罩在柔和的暖黄色光晕中，线条灵动流畅。漫画视觉重点：江迟张开的双臂、明亮的双眼以及灿烂夺目的笑容。"}], "sort_order": 3}, {"id": "3a38d764-0482-4030-b015-d550266b3571", "page_id": "P5", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "突发剧情转折：记忆恢复带来的震撼冲击", "visual_focus": "碎裂的记忆画面与江迟夸张震惊的表情", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, fresh and airy feel. The page layout is L05 top large, bottom small split layout (70% + 30%). [Panel 1 (shotId 08, top large panel)]: Close-up, fixed camera. A graphic glass-shattering comic effect covers the frame. 江迟's eyes suddenly widen perfectly round, pupils shrinking drastically, lips slightly parted open, a single drop of cold sweat sliding down 江迟's forehead. Pure white background with floating shattered fragments containing memory scenes. Intense white light hits from the front. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '后来我恢复了记忆。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 09, bottom small panel)]: Extreme close-up. 江迟's mouth is wide open in an 'O' shape, both hands covering 江迟's own cheeks, eyes bulging out like bells looking slightly towards the top left. The background is heavily populated with giant exclamation mark and question mark effects, vibrant colors. Flat even lighting preserving comic exaggeration. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '哦豁！'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P5.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "08", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "后来我恢复了记忆。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，固定镜头。画面突然像玻璃一样碎裂（漫画特效）。江迟双眼猛地睁大，瞳孔剧烈收缩，嘴唇微微张开，一滴冷汗顺着额头滑落。环境细节：纯白背景，四周漂浮着破碎的记忆碎片画面。光线与质感：强烈的白光从正前方打来，人物面部细节清晰，线条变得锐利。漫画视觉重点：江迟骤然收缩的瞳孔和额头滑落的冷汗。"}, {"shotId": "09", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "哦豁！", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：大特写，固定镜头。江迟的嘴巴微张，呈现出“O”型，双手捂住自己的脸颊，眼睛瞪得像铜铃，眼珠子微微向左上方看。环境细节：背景充满了大大的感叹号和问号特效，色彩对比强烈。光线与质感：均匀的平光，保留漫画式的夸张表情渲染，色调明快。漫画视觉重点：江迟双手捂脸的动作和瞪大的双眼。"}], "sort_order": 4}, {"id": "f86d2706-eb38-4eb2-aa94-5d53c4e3f314", "page_id": "P6", "layout_type": "L07 上下双分·均等 (50%+50%)", "page_purpose": "揭示真相时的自我吐槽与荒谬感", "visual_focus": "死对头的割裂感与红色结婚证的冲击", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft natural lighting. The page layout is L07 equal top and bottom split layout (50% + 50%). [Panel 1 (shotId 10, top panel)]: Medium close-up, tilted angle. The panel is split vertically. Left side: 陆承衍 stands with arms crossed over 陆承衍's chest, casting a sharp sidelong glance. Right side: 江迟 holds 江迟's head with both hands, mouth wide open, corner of the eye twitching with comic lines. A sharp crack line effect runs down the middle between the two characters. 陆承衍 is under cool blue lighting while 江迟 is under warm yellow lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我好像……还真是他死对头。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 11, bottom panel)]: Close-up, push-in camera. 江迟 places one hand on 江迟's forehead, the other hand scratching wildly in the air, eyebrows pinched tightly together, eyelids drooping downward heavily. A translucent illusion of a red marriage certificate floats in the background. Overhead lighting casting deep shadows in 江迟's eye sockets. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '更要命的是，我还真有一个老公。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P6.png", "reference_ids": ["7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7", "2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "10", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我好像……还真是他死对头。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，倾斜构图。画面一分为二，左边是陆承衍双手抱胸、眼神冷厉地斜视；右边是江迟双手抱头、嘴巴张大、眼角抽搐。环境细节：两人中间有一道清晰的裂痕特效。光线与质感：两人分别处于冷蓝和暖黄的不同光影下，色彩碰撞强烈，线条精致。漫画视觉重点：两人截然不同的面部表情和中间的分割线。"}, {"shotId": "11", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "更要命的是，我还真有一个老公。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，推镜头。江迟一只手扶着额头，另一只手在半空中胡乱抓了两下，眉头皱成一个“川”字，眼皮无力地耷拉着。环境细节：背景出现一本红色的结婚证幻影。光线与质感：顶光照射，江迟眼窝处留下深深的阴影，质感细腻。漫画视觉重点：江迟扶额的手指和紧皱的眉头。"}], "sort_order": 5}, {"id": "18890c4d-39b6-4705-989d-fdb2ccbc0187", "page_id": "P7", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "正牌老公登场，极强的修罗场压迫感", "visual_focus": "傅时深高大的背光身形与极度深邃冰冷的眼眸", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, cinematic storyboard composition. The page layout is L05 top large, bottom small split layout (70% + 30%). [Panel 1 (shotId 12, top large panel)]: Full shot, low angle. Outside a coffee shop. 傅时深 stands tall and straight, wearing a dark high-end tailored suit, hands hanging naturally at 傅时深's sides. Further back, 江迟 is tightly hugging 陆承衍's arm with both hands, while 陆承衍 looks down at 江迟. Modern city street at night with soft neon lights. 傅时深 is completely backlit by the streetlamps, 傅时深's face covered in deep shadows, exuding a heavy presence. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '而此刻，我亲老公正站在我面前，'. [Panel 2 (shotId 13, bottom small panel)]: Close-up, fixed camera. Extreme close-up on 傅时深's eyes. 傅时深's eyes are narrow, pupils pitch black without any catchlights, brow ridge pressing down low, thin lips pressed into a tight straight line, jawline rigid and tense. In the blurred background, the silhouettes of 江迟 and 陆承衍 are visible. Hard top light hits 傅时深's brow bone. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '看着我抱着死对头喊老公，眸色幽深，声音冰冷：'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P7.png", "reference_ids": ["dad0eadd-2f81-4f4d-8be7-d3c5000bd069", "2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "12", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "而此刻，我亲老公正站在我面前，", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：全景，仰拍。咖啡厅门口。傅时深身穿深色高定西装，身姿挺拔地站立，双手自然垂在身侧。江迟此时正双手紧紧抱着陆承衍的手臂，陆承衍低头看着江迟。环境细节：现代街景，路灯闪烁。光线与质感：夜晚的街灯光线，傅时深整个人背光，面部笼罩在阴影中，气场强大。漫画视觉重点：傅时深高大的身形，以及江迟紧抱陆承衍手臂的动作。"}, {"shotId": "13", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "看着我抱着死对头喊老公，眸色幽深，声音冰冷：", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，固定镜头。傅时深的眼部特写。傅时深的眼睛狭长，瞳孔深黑不带一丝反光，眉骨微微下压，薄唇紧抿成一条直线，下颌线紧绷。环境细节：背景是虚化的江迟和陆承衍的身影。光线与质感：冷硬的顶光打在傅时深的眉骨上，睫毛投下阴影，线条冷峻。漫画视觉重点：傅时深没有高光、深邃冷硬的瞳孔，以及紧绷的下颌线。"}], "sort_order": 6}, {"id": "7ab7beec-2aae-4bd8-bba9-65e5d26f00c2", "page_id": "P8", "layout_type": "L01 全屏格 (90%+)", "page_purpose": "剧情核心爆点，正牌老公的致命发问", "visual_focus": "傅时深扯领带的压迫感与冰冷的弧度", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, fresh and elegant visual feel. The page layout is L01 full-screen panel (90%+). [Panel 1 (shotId 14, full screen center)]: Medium close-up, push-in camera. 傅时深 leans forward slightly, raising 傅时深's left hand to gently pull on 傅时深's own necktie. 傅时深's eyes stare intensely straight ahead, corners of 傅时深's mouth lifting into a very faint, icy arc. The edges of the frame darken, focusing entirely on 傅时深's face. Cool-toned streetlamp light from the side traces the sharp contours of 傅时深's profile. A white speech bubble with soft shadow contains the Chinese text '「老婆，玩够了吗？」'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P8.png", "reference_ids": ["dad0eadd-2f81-4f4d-8be7-d3c5000bd069"], "shots": [{"shotId": "14", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "「老婆，玩够了吗？」", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，推镜头。傅时深微微向前倾身，左手抬起，轻轻扯了一下自己的领带，双眼死死盯着江迟，嘴角勾起一抹极淡且冰冷的弧度。环境细节：画面四周变暗，焦点完全集中在傅时深脸上。光线与质感：从侧面打来的冷色路灯光，勾勒出他锋利的侧脸轮廓，压迫感十足。漫画视觉重点：傅时深扯领带的手部微动作和冰冷微扬的嘴角。"}], "sort_order": 7}, {"id": "285d0cf2-ceb8-452e-b89a-40c6ac3335ee", "page_id": "P9", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "开启回忆杀转场，铺垫失忆期间的乌龙相处", "visual_focus": "时光回溯的寂寥背景与江迟俏皮动作的对比", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones. The page layout is L17 vertical scroll, staggered large, medium, small panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 15, top panel)]: Long shot. Exterior view of a modern apartment revealing the inside through huge floor-to-ceiling windows. 江迟 sits alone, looking tiny, in the corner of a massive sofa, holding a mobile phone. 陆承衍 walks away towards another room, turning 陆承衍's back entirely to 江迟. Starry city night view outside. Cool blue night tones outside contrasting with warm but sparse indoor lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我老公好像有男朋友了。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 16, middle panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 places an index finger over 江迟's lips in a 'hush' gesture, one eye wide open, the other eye completely closed, with a playful smile on 江迟's mouth. The background features a giant comic magnifying glass icon. Bright warm yellow light hits 江迟's face evenly. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '别问我怎么发现的。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 17, bottom panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 lunges forward with both arms wide open trying to grab. 陆承衍 swiftly slides and dodges to the right side. 江迟 misses, 江迟's hands hovering in mid-air, body leaning forward off balance. Soft carpeted apartment living room. Action speed lines emphasize 陆承衍's swift movement. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他不抱我。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P9.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "15", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我老公好像有男朋友了。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：远景，固定镜头。时光回溯转场。现代公寓外景，巨大的落地窗透出室内的灯光。江迟一个人孤零零地坐在宽大的沙发角落，手里拿着一个手机，陆承衍背对着他走向另一个房间。环境细节：城市夜景，星星点点的灯光。光线与质感：夜色笼罩，色调偏冷蓝，室内灯光呈现出暖色但不温馨，线条流畅。漫画视觉重点：江迟在偌大沙发上的渺小身影和陆承衍决绝的背影。"}, {"shotId": "16", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "别问我怎么发现的。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，固定镜头。江迟竖起一根食指放在嘴唇前，做出“嘘”的动作，一只眼睛睁开，另一只眼睛闭上，嘴角带着调皮的笑意。环境细节：背景是放大版的漫画侦探放大镜。光线与质感：明亮的暖黄光打在江迟脸上，肤色白皙透亮，漫画式的平铺光影。漫画视觉重点：江迟放在嘴唇前的食指和俏皮的单眼闭合表情。"}, {"shotId": "17", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "他不抱我。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，拉镜头。江迟张开双臂向陆承衍扑过去，陆承衍迅速向右侧身滑步躲开，江迟扑了个空，双手悬在半空，身体失去平衡前倾。环境细节：公寓客厅，铺着柔软的地毯。光线与质感：室内的明亮顶光，陆承衍动作带有速度线，画面动感十足。漫画视觉重点：江迟悬空的双手和陆承衍侧身躲避的利落动作。"}], "sort_order": 8}, {"id": "b1da82ca-667b-4f4e-9a87-ac525d67d57e", "page_id": "P10", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "连续展现江迟单方面求爱被拒的搞笑日常", "visual_focus": "捏鸭子嘴、面条泪及可怜巴巴的眼神", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones. The page layout is L15 vertical scroll, three equal horizontal panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 18, top panel)]: Medium close-up. 江迟 pushes lips outward, eyes closed tightly, cheeks flushed red, hands gripping tightly onto 陆承衍's sleeve. 陆承衍 uses 陆承衍's thumb and index finger to pinch 江迟's lips together into a duck-bill shape, 陆承衍's eyebrows slightly furrowed. Warm floor lamp lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '不亲我。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 19, middle panel)]: Close-up, low angle. 江迟 rests 江迟's chin on both palms, eyes sparkling brightly, two exaggerated thick waterfall-like comic tears streaming out from 江迟's eyes, mouth wide open. A large '22' number bubble floats in the background. Soft and fresh lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我才二十二岁啊。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 20, bottom panel)]: Medium shot, high angle. 江迟 wears silk pajamas, sitting on the edge of the bed, hands tightly gripping the edge of the blanket, staring pitifully at 陆承衍's back. 陆承衍 walks towards the door with large strides, not looking back. Spacious bedroom with a large bed. Dim warm light from the bedside lamp. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '那么美丽的年纪，晚上看着自己的老公，这不要我命吗？'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P10.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "18", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "不亲我。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，固定镜头。江迟嘟起嘴唇，闭上眼睛，脸颊微红，双手抓着陆承衍的衣袖。陆承衍用一只手的大拇指和食指捏住江迟的嘴唇，将其捏成鸭子嘴，眉头微皱。环境细节：两人距离很近，背景是客厅的电视墙。光线与质感：侧边落地灯的暖光，人物脸部的红晕渲染细腻，线条清晰。漫画视觉重点：江迟被捏成鸭子嘴的嘴唇和陆承衍修长的手指。"}, {"shotId": "19", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我才二十二岁啊。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，仰拍。江迟双手托着自己的下巴，眼睛闪闪发光，两行面条宽的眼泪从眼眶里喷涌而出（漫画夸张画法），嘴巴张得大大的。环境细节：背景出现大大的“22”数字气泡。光线与质感：柔和的面部光线，强调江迟充满胶原蛋白的脸蛋，色彩清透。漫画视觉重点：江迟夸张的面条泪和双手托腮的动作。"}, {"shotId": "20", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "那么美丽的年纪，晚上看着自己的老公，这不要我命吗？", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，俯拍。江迟穿着丝绸睡衣，坐在床边，双手紧紧揪着被角，眼巴巴地看着陆承衍的背影。陆承衍头也不回，大步向门口走去。环境细节：宽敞的卧室，大床整洁，墙上挂着现代抽象画。光线与质感：床头壁灯昏黄的光晕，色调带有忧郁的蓝紫滤镜。漫画视觉重点：江迟紧紧揪着被角的双手和可怜巴巴的眼神。"}], "sort_order": 9}, {"id": "29ce7ac4-bab3-48a3-b919-ef6e7e876ee8", "page_id": "P11", "layout_type": "L07 上下双分·均等 (50%+50%)", "page_purpose": "冷酷防备与故作委屈的对比", "visual_focus": "陆承衍反锁门的动作与江迟抱鹅盯天花板的蜷缩", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones. The page layout is L07 equal top and bottom split layout (50% + 50%). [Panel 1 (shotId 21, top panel)]: Medium shot. In the hallway. 陆承衍 stands outside the bedroom door, hand gripping the metal door handle, pulling it shut. An inserted close-up shows 陆承衍's fingers turning the lock knob. Wooden door, metal handle. Cool hallway lights reflecting off the metal hardware. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我老公他，每天晚上都反锁卧室门，防我跟防贼一样。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 22, bottom panel)]: Full shot, low angle. 江迟 curls up tightly into a ball on a single-seat sofa in the living room, arms hugging a massive white goose plush toy tightly, chin resting on the plushie, eyes wide open staring straight up at the ceiling. Ceiling lights are off, bathed in moonlight from the window. The moonlight hits half of 江迟's face leaving the other half in shadow. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我抱着枕头在沙发上，对着天花板，假装掉了一晚上眼泪。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P11.png", "reference_ids": ["7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7", "2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "21", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我老公他，每天晚上都反锁卧室门，防我跟防贼一样。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，固定镜头。走廊上。陆承衍站在卧室门外，手握门把手，用力将门带上，随后画面给到门锁的特写，陆承衍的手指拧动反锁旋钮。环境细节：木质房门，金属门把手。光线与质感：走廊冷色的灯光打在金属门把手上，反射出冰冷的光泽，线条干净利落。漫画视觉重点：陆承衍拧动门锁的手部动作和紧闭的房门。"}, {"shotId": "22", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我抱着枕头在沙发上，对着天花板，假装掉了一晚上眼泪。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：全景，仰拍。江迟整个人蜷缩在客厅的单人沙发上，双臂紧紧抱着一个巨大的白鹅抱枕，下巴抵在抱枕上，双眼睁大，直勾勾地盯着天花板。环境细节：天花板的吊灯已经关闭，只有月光从窗外洒进来。光线与质感：清冷的月光打在江迟的半张脸上，另一半隐没在阴影中，氛围感极强。漫画视觉重点：江迟抱着白鹅抱枕的蜷缩姿态和直视上方的眼睛。"}], "sort_order": 10}, {"id": "029fcde3-0f44-4031-8079-ff45056ad037", "page_id": "P12", "layout_type": "L18 垂直通栏·顶窄底宽递增", "page_purpose": "情绪从假委屈迅速升级为真愤怒爆发", "visual_focus": "从小泪珠到倒竖眉毛再到重拳出击的视觉膨胀", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones. The page layout is L18 vertical scroll, narrow top to wide bottom increasing panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 23, top panel)]: Medium close-up. Side profile of 江迟, forcing a single tear out of the corner of the eye dropping onto the pillow. On the right, a large thought bubble shows 陆承衍 sleeping soundly on a bed wearing a sleep mask. Dim ambient lighting with glossy highlights on the tear. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他都不哄我。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 24, middle panel)]: Extreme close-up. 江迟 abruptly turns head, eyebrows slanted upwards sharply, nostrils slightly flared, exhaling a puff of white comic cloud effect, teeth biting the lips tightly. The background turns into raging red flames. Strong warm red lighting from below. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '哼。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 25, bottom wide panel)]: Close-up. 江迟's hand forms a fist and heavily smashes into the sofa cushion, veins slightly bulging on the back of the hand, mouth wide open revealing sharp canine teeth. The cushion sinks deeply with impact vibration lines around it. Bright overhead light highlighting the physical impact. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '渣男！'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P12.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "23", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "他都不哄我。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，推镜头。江迟的侧脸，眼角硬生生挤出一滴泪水滑落到抱枕上。画面右侧画出一个巨大的气泡，里面是陆承衍躺在床上戴着眼罩熟睡的画面。环境细节：安静的客厅，沙发边缘。光线与质感：微弱的环境光，泪水带有高光反光，刻画细腻。漫画视觉重点：江迟眼角的泪水和气泡中熟睡的陆承衍形成的对比。"}, {"shotId": "24", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "哼。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：大特写，固定镜头。江迟猛地转过头，眉毛倒竖，鼻孔微微张大，呼出一团白气（漫画特效），嘴唇紧咬。环境细节：背景变成红色的愤怒火焰。光线与质感：强烈的暖红色光线从下方打上，凸显面部轮廓，线条粗犷。漫画视觉重点：江迟倒竖的眉毛和呼出白气的夸张神态。"}, {"shotId": "25", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "渣男！", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，固定镜头。江迟一只手握成拳头，用力砸在沙发垫上，手背青筋微凸，嘴巴张大，露出锋利的小虎牙。环境细节：沙发垫被砸出深深的凹陷，周围有震动线。光线与质感：明亮的顶光，手部力量感渲染到位，画面具有冲击力。漫画视觉重点：江迟砸在沙发上的拳头和凹陷的沙发垫。"}], "sort_order": 11}, {"id": "22f1b19b-dc25-49df-a55e-4781ff11c3e8", "page_id": "P13", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "自我洗脑后的顿悟与嫌弃", "visual_focus": "发光灯泡的悟道感与翻白眼的不屑", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones. The page layout is L05 top large, bottom small split layout (70% + 30%). [Panel 1 (shotId 26, top large panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 sits cross-legged on the sofa, palms pressed together flat in front of the chest in a prayer pose, eyes closed gently, eyebrows relaxed. A glowing lightbulb comic effect shines brightly directly above 江迟's head. Morning sunlight streams through curtain slits, bathing the room in warm orange hues. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '眼泪流干之后，我悟了。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 27, bottom small panel)]: Medium close-up. 江迟 extends the right hand outward making a swiping motion like shooing a fly, corners of the mouth pulled down in disdain, rolling eyes upwards revealing the whites. Background shows a television screen glitching with white noise static. Bright flat lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '男人的心，跟综艺排播一样，说撤就撤。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P13.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "26", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "眼泪流干之后，我悟了。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，拉镜头。江迟盘腿坐在沙发上，双手合十放在胸前，双眼闭拢，眉头舒展，头上亮起一个发光的灯泡（漫画特效）。环境细节：早晨的阳光透过窗帘缝隙照进来。光线与质感：清晨柔和的自然光，画面色调转为温暖的橘黄色，清澈通透。漫画视觉重点：江迟双手合十的动作和头顶发光的灯泡特效。"}, {"shotId": "27", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "男人的心，跟综艺排播一样，说撤就撤。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，固定镜头。江迟伸出右手，做出一个挥手像赶苍蝇一样的动作，嘴角不屑地下撇，翻了个大大的白眼。环境细节：背景出现电视机播放综艺节目被瞬间关掉的雪花屏画面。光线与质感：平光照明，人物动作流畅，色调明快。漫画视觉重点：江迟翻白眼的表情和挥手的动作。"}], "sort_order": 12}, {"id": "7c758248-eca7-4d76-94b1-2276d06d7d60", "page_id": "P14", "layout_type": "L20 垂直通栏·大-窄-大夹层", "page_purpose": "穿插失忆设定，表达不满与委屈", "visual_focus": "拍桌水花与病床失忆画面的强烈时空隔断感", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones. The page layout is L20 vertical scroll, large-narrow-large sandwich panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 28, top large panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 slams both hands forcefully onto a coffee table, body leaning forward, eyes completely widened and round, fiery reflection in the pupils, mouth slightly open. A glass cup on the table bounces upward, water splashing violently into the air. Strong side light, droplets have high reflections. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '可凭什么啊？'. [Panel 2 (shotId 29, middle narrow panel)]: Medium shot, tilted angle. 江迟 rests one hand on the waist, the other hand pointing aggressively at the empty space in front, eyebrows tightly locked, teeth biting the lower lip, shoulders visibly shaking. Sunlight hits from a window diagonally. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '凭什么他说撤就撤？'. [Panel 3 (shotId 30, bottom large panel)]: Medium close-up. A memory flashback sequence. 江迟 wears a thick white medical bandage wrapped around the head, sitting on a hospital bed. 江迟's hands anxiously grip the white bedsheets, eyes looking forward blankly and confused. Pure white hospital room setting with an IV stand. Cool pale clinical lighting. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '就因为我出车祸失忆了？'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P14.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "28", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "可凭什么啊？", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，推镜头。江迟双手猛地拍在茶几上，身体前倾，眼睛瞪圆，瞳孔倒映着怒火，嘴巴微张。环境细节：茶几上的水杯被震得跳起来，水花四溅。光线与质感：强烈的侧光打在脸庞上，水滴带有细腻的反光，条漫质感强烈。漫画视觉重点：江迟拍击桌面的双手、溅起的水花以及瞪圆的眼睛。"}, {"shotId": "29", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "凭什么他说撤就撤？", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，倾斜构图。江迟单手插在腰间，另一只手指着虚空，眉头紧锁，牙齿咬着下唇，肩膀气得微微发抖。环境细节：客厅背景，光影错落。光线与质感：光线从窗户斜射进来，形成强烈的明暗对比，表现出不安和不满。漫画视觉重点：江迟指着虚空的手指和紧咬的下唇。"}, {"shotId": "30", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "就因为我出车祸失忆了？", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，固定镜头。画面中出现江迟头上缠着一圈白色绷带的闪回画面。江迟坐在病床上，双手无措地抓着白色的被角，眼神迷茫地看着前方。环境细节：纯白的病房，点滴架。光线与质感：医院里惨白的冷光，人物肤色苍白，线条柔和。漫画视觉重点：江迟头上的绷带和紧紧抓着被角的双手。"}], "sort_order": 13}, {"id": "f3a1b259-e589-4e92-8147-984892693327", "page_id": "P15", "layout_type": "L07 上下双分·均等 (50%+50%)", "page_purpose": "脑补的受害者视角展示", "visual_focus": "飞蛾干瘪钱包与幻想中踩人的黑影小人", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones. The page layout is L07 equal top and bottom split layout (50% + 50%). [Panel 1 (shotId 31, top panel)]: Close-up, high angle. 江迟 holds up an empty, completely flat wallet with both hands, with a tiny moth flying out of the open wallet comic effect. 江迟's mouth is curved down into a deep inverted U-shape, outer corners of the eyes drooping downward. Blurred indoor background. Dramatic spot lighting emphasizing the emptiness of the wallet. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '失忆了，就可以不用养我这个老婆了？'. [Panel 2 (shotId 32, bottom panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 holds both hands in tight fists next to the cheeks, eye sockets completely filled with welling tears, teeth grinding together. In the background, a dark featureless silhouette of a person emerges with a purple glowing evil aura, stepping a foot down as if stomping on 江迟. Highly exaggerated comic shadows. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '失忆了，就可以欺负我给外面那个名分了？'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P15.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "31", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "失忆了，就可以不用养我这个老婆了？", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，俯拍。江迟双手捧着自己空荡荡的干瘪钱包（漫画夸张手法，里面飞出一只蛾子），嘴巴撇成倒U型，眼角下垂。环境细节：模糊的室内背景。光线与质感：黯淡的局部光线，突出钱包的空洞感，画面带有戏剧性的阴影。漫画视觉重点：江迟捧着的空钱包飞出蛾子，以及委屈的表情。"}, {"shotId": "32", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "失忆了，就可以欺负我给外面那个名分了？", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，固定镜头。江迟双手握拳放在脸颊两侧，眼眶里蓄满泪水，咬牙切齿。背景浮现出一个看不清脸的黑影小人（代表外面的狐狸精），江迟正想象着自己被黑影小人踩在脚下。环境细节：幻想背景。光线与质感：暗色调的背景中，黑影小人带有紫色的邪恶光环，江迟带有高光眼泪。漫画视觉重点：江迟蓄满泪水的眼眶和背景中踩人的黑影。"}], "sort_order": 14}, {"id": "d42a681d-50c6-4ecb-893f-deffed3fd136", "page_id": "P16", "layout_type": "L04 出血格 (85%+, 元素冲破边框)", "page_purpose": "重新振作，展现充满活力的死缠烂打决心", "visual_focus": "江迟叉腰仰头被阳光镀金边的自信姿态", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones. The page layout is L04 full-bleed panel with elements breaking the border (85%+). [Panel 1 (shotId 33, full screen)]: Full shot, low angle. 江迟 stands proudly in the center of the living room with legs spread wide apart, hands resting confidently on the hips, chin lifted high, eyes gleaming with energetic light, corners of the mouth curving into a confident, determined smile. Bright afternoon golden sunlight completely floods the living room from the large floor-to-ceiling windows, casting a brilliant glowing golden rim light around 江迟's entire body. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我偏不如他愿。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P16.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "33", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我偏不如他愿。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：全景，仰拍。江迟双手叉腰，双腿分开站立在客厅中央，下巴高高扬起，双眼放光，嘴角勾起一抹势在必得的笑容。环境细节：阳光洒满整个客厅。光线与质感：明亮的午后暖阳从落地窗照进来，给江迟全身镀上一层金边，充满活力。漫画视觉重点：江迟叉腰仰头的自信姿态和灿烂的笑容。"}], "sort_order": 15}, {"id": "0e4e47d1-2061-4cb1-ab2c-db876e7bbb9e", "page_id": "P17", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "失忆初期的互动拉扯展示", "visual_focus": "大喇叭喊老公与被手指抵住额头的尴尬互动", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones. The page layout is L05 top large, bottom small split layout (70% + 30%). [Panel 1 (shotId 34, top large panel)]: Medium shot, push-in camera. 江迟 follows closely behind 陆承衍, leaning forward, hands cupped around the mouth like a megaphone shouting loudly. 陆承衍 walks in front, back turned, shoulders stiffening visibly. Modern apartment hallway setting. Warm bright lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我天天喊他老公。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 35, bottom small panel)]: Medium close-up. 陆承衍 turns around facing the front, eyebrows deeply furrowed, extending one single index finger pressing firmly against the center of 江迟's forehead pushing backward, lips pressed completely shut. 江迟 relentlessly grabs onto 陆承衍's arm with both hands, leaning in persistently. Apartment entryway area with warm dim wall lamps. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他天天说不是我老公，说他是我死对头。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P17.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "34", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我天天喊他老公。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，推镜头。江迟跟在陆承衍身后，身体前倾，双手做成喇叭状放在嘴边，大声呼喊。陆承衍走在前面，肩膀微微一僵。环境细节：现代公寓走廊。光线与质感：顶灯柔和，画面清晰明亮，线条流畅。漫画视觉重点：江迟双手做喇叭状的动作和陆承衍僵住的背影。"}, {"shotId": "35", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "他天天说不是我老公，说他是我死对头。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，固定镜头。陆承衍转过身，眉头紧皱，伸出一根手指抵在江迟的额头上将他推开，嘴唇紧抿。江迟则双手扒拉着陆承衍的手臂，不依不饶地往前凑。环境细节：公寓玄关处。光线与质感：玄关处较暗的灯光，两人的互动处在光影交界线，质感细腻。漫画视觉重点：陆承衍抵在江迟额头上的手指和江迟扒拉的手。"}], "sort_order": 16}, {"id": "6df52ef5-9c32-4544-9c81-1ab90fe75ccf", "page_id": "P18", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "心理防线的逐步厚脸皮化", "visual_focus": "从枯萎蘑菇到掏耳朵翻白眼，再到狡黠响指的情绪递进", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones. The page layout is L15 vertical scroll, three equal horizontal panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 36, top panel)]: Close-up, high angle. 江迟 crouches down completely in a corner against white walls, wrapping arms tightly around the knees, chin resting on the kneecaps, shoulders slumped down, eyelids heavily lowered, resembling a dried mushroom. Faint sad lighting with shadows in the corner. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我一开始还难过。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 37, middle panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 lies flat on the sofa, using one hand to pick the ear casually, the other hand holding a mobile phone. 江迟 rolls the eyes up in boredom, with small speech bubbles filled with three dots floating out of the mouth. A half-drank juice glass sits on the table nearby. Casual flat bright lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '后来听麻了。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 38, bottom panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 rests the chin on one palm, mouth corners curving up into a sly smirk, eyes half-closed shining with cunning light, the other hand suspended in the air snapping the fingers. The background blurs out with sparkling little star effects floating around. Soft warm light highlights the playful expression. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '死对头就死对头呗。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P18.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "36", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我一开始还难过。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，俯拍。江迟蹲在墙角，双手抱着膝盖，下巴搁在膝盖上，肩膀耷拉着，双眼低垂，整个人像一朵枯萎的小蘑菇。环境细节：白色的墙壁角落。光线与质感：角落里布满阴影，只有几条黯淡的光线落在他的发丝上，氛围失落。漫画视觉重点：江迟抱膝蜷缩的动作和低垂的眼眸。"}, {"shotId": "37", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "后来听麻了。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，固定镜头。江迟躺在沙发上，一只手掏着耳朵，另一只手拿着手机，翻着白眼，嘴里吐出一个个带有省略号的无聊气泡。环境细节：沙发和茶几，旁边放着喝了一半的果汁。光线与质感：随意的日常平光，色调轻松明快。漫画视觉重点：江迟掏耳朵的动作和翻白眼的表情。"}, {"shotId": "38", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "死对头就死对头呗。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，推镜头。江迟单手托腮，嘴角微微上扬，眼睛半眯，流露出一丝狡黠的光芒，另一只手在空中随意地弹了一个响指。环境细节：背景虚化，周围出现闪烁的小星星。光线与质感：柔和的暖光打在脸庞，高光点缀在眼底，画面生动。漫画视觉重点：江迟托腮的手和打响指的动作，以及狡黠的眼神。"}], "sort_order": 17}, {"id": "09d5afce-1feb-40d2-a9c4-6f2ae2dbd3a4", "page_id": "P19", "layout_type": "L11 上1下2·下均分 (上55%, 下45%平分)", "page_purpose": "江迟的神奇脑回路论证", "visual_focus": "浪漫粉红幻想与微信置顶证据支撑起的蜜汁自信", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones, romantic atmosphere. The page layout is L11 top 1 bottom 2 layout (top 55%, bottom 45% evenly split). [Panel 1 (shotId 39, top panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 crosses both hands gently over the chest, tilting the head to one side, eyes sparkling brightly looking forward, lips slightly parted. The background is filled with romantic pink floating hearts and glowing illusions of wedding attire. Dreamy soft pink lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '死对头就不能当老公吗？'. [Panel 2 (shotId 40, bottom left panel)]: Close-up. 江迟's hand holds a mobile phone displaying a WeChat interface screen glowing brightly, with the name '陆承衍' pinned to the very top. 江迟's thumb explicitly points at the name on the screen. The bright screen light illuminates the fingertips against a darker background. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '反正我失忆了，我微信置顶是他。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 41, bottom right panel)]: Medium close-up, low angle. 江迟 pulls both hands into tight fists raised in front of the chest, eyes closed completely tight, mouth smiling widely in total self-confidence. A powerful, exaggerated comic burst of radial light shoots out from directly behind 江迟. Brilliant yellow and orange warm tones. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他肯定是我老公。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P19.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7a92a4c1-2acc-428a-8bad-29354678e07e"], "shots": [{"shotId": "39", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "死对头就不能当老公吗？", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，固定镜头。江迟双手交叠放在胸前，歪着头，眼睛亮晶晶地看着前方（想象中的陆承衍），嘴唇微微张开。环境细节：背景出现粉色的爱心和结婚礼服的幻影。光线与质感：梦幻般的粉色调光晕，线条柔软，氛围浪漫。漫画视觉重点：江迟交叠的双手和充满期待的眼神。"}, {"shotId": "40", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "反正我失忆了，我微信置顶是他。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，固定镜头。江迟的手拿着手机，屏幕亮起，显示微信界面，最上面置顶的聊天框写着“陆承衍”，江迟的拇指正指着那个名字。环境细节：手机屏幕发出的微光。光线与质感：手机屏幕的冷光照亮了江迟的指尖，背景暗化，重点突出屏幕内容。漫画视觉重点：手机屏幕上的“置顶”标志和江迟的手指。"}, {"shotId": "41", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "他肯定是我老公。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，仰拍。江迟双手握拳，举到胸前，双眼紧闭，嘴角上扬，一副深信不疑的表情，身后爆发出耀眼的放射状光芒。环境细节：完全脱离现实的夸张背景。光线与质感：强烈的中心光线向四周辐射，色彩鲜艳，具有强烈的视觉冲击。漫画视觉重点：江迟紧握的双拳和自信的表情。"}], "sort_order": 18}, {"id": "c3843f81-573d-4bcc-8956-62e9f950a13b", "page_id": "P20", "layout_type": "L07 上下双分·均等 (50%+50%)", "page_purpose": "锁定假想敌，激发斗志", "visual_focus": "背景雷电假想敌与燃烧小火苗的重锤手势", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones. The page layout is L07 equal top and bottom split layout (50% + 50%). [Panel 1 (shotId 42, top panel)]: Medium shot, tilted angle. 江迟 crosses arms tightly over the chest, eyebrows sharply slanted upwards, teeth grinding together. In the imaginary background, a blurry seductive silhouette of a person links arms with 陆承衍. Dark purple comic thunderbolts strike in the background. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '不让我叫老公，一定是外面那个臭不要脸的跟他做的局。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 43, bottom panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 heavily smashes one clenched fist directly into the open palm of the other hand, eyes wide and completely round, with small bright fire flame effects burning inside the pupils. Flat, vibrant warm color lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '那我偏要叫。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P20.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "42", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "不让我叫老公，一定是外面那个臭不要脸的跟他做的局。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，倾斜构图。江迟双手抱胸，眉头倒竖，咬着牙，背景里出现一个模糊的妖娆背影（假想敌）正挽着陆承衍的手臂。环境细节：脑内剧场，背景有黑色的雷电。光线与质感：阴暗的紫色调光线，表现出强烈的敌意，线条锐利。漫画视觉重点：江迟抱胸的防御姿态和倒竖的眉毛。"}, {"shotId": "43", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "那我偏要叫。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，固定镜头。江迟单手握拳重重地捶在自己的另一只手掌上，眼睛圆睁，眼底燃起两团小火苗。环境细节：纯色背景。光线与质感：暖色调平光，人物轮廓清晰，动作力度感强。漫画视觉重点：江迟拳掌相击的动作和眼底的火苗特效。"}], "sort_order": 19}, {"id": "a5d487b1-85c5-4122-9d8c-fbc4305fb88d", "page_id": "P21", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "魔音灌脑式的老公日常攻击", "visual_focus": "早晚全方位无死角贴身骚扰陆承衍", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, fresh and elegant visual feel. The page layout is L15 vertical scroll, three equal horizontal panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 44, top panel)]: Full shot. Morning dining room with bright sunlight through the window. 江迟 wears an apron, holding a plate with both hands, leaning heavily forward over the dining table, shouting loudly with mouth wide open towards 陆承衍. 陆承衍 sits at the table holding a coffee cup, freezing mid-motion. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '「死对头老公，早上好。」'. [Panel 2 (shotId 45, middle panel)]: Medium shot. Nighttime apartment entryway with warm yellow wall lights. 陆承衍 bends down changing shoes. 江迟 pops half of the body out from behind the wall corner, both hands gripping the edge of the wall, smiling brightly with curved eyes, waving one hand at 陆承衍. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '「死对头老公，晚上见。」'. [Panel 3 (shotId 46, bottom panel)]: Medium close-up. In the hallway. 江迟 entirely glues to 陆承衍's back, wrapping both arms tightly around 陆承衍's waist, pressing the cheek lovingly against 陆承衍's back, eyes closed rubbing the face. 陆承衍 stands frozen completely stiff. Clear overhead lighting. A white speech bubble contains the Chinese text '「死对头老公，今天节目安排一下？」'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P21.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "44", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "「死对头老公，早上好。」", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：全景，固定镜头。清晨，餐桌旁。江迟穿着围裙，双手端着一个盘子，身体前倾，冲着坐在餐桌前的陆承衍大声喊，嘴巴张得大大的。陆承衍手里的咖啡杯顿住。环境细节：餐桌上有早餐，窗外阳光明媚。光线与质感：清晨柔和的阳光洒在餐桌上，色彩清新温暖。漫画视觉重点：江迟端着盘子前倾的动作和张大的嘴巴。"}, {"shotId": "45", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "「死对头老公，晚上见。」", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，拉镜头。夜晚玄关处。陆承衍正在换鞋，江迟从墙角探出半个身子，双手扒着墙壁，笑眯眯地看着陆承衍，挥动着一只手。环境细节：玄关的鞋柜和暖色壁灯。光线与质感：温馨的室内黄光，氛围轻松。漫画视觉重点：江迟扒着墙壁探出头挥手的动作。"}, {"shotId": "46", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "「死对头老公，今天节目安排一下？」", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，跟镜头。江迟整个人贴在陆承衍背后，双手环抱住陆承衍的腰，脸颊贴在陆承衍的背上，闭着眼睛蹭了蹭。陆承衍浑身僵硬。环境细节：走廊。光线与质感：走廊的顶光，两人的身体轮廓分明。漫画视觉重点：江迟环抱陆承衍腰部的手和贴在背上的侧脸。"}], "sort_order": 20}, {"id": "11eb6747-7e87-4415-9e07-921f3dce5236", "page_id": "P22", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "死对头的纯情破防瞬间放大", "visual_focus": "陆承衍通红的耳尖与躲避的视线", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones. The page layout is L05 top large, bottom small split layout (70% + 30%). [Panel 1 (shotId 47, top large panel)]: Close-up on 陆承衍's side profile. 陆承衍's eyes look away to the side in a flustered manner, lips pressed extremely tight, the tips of the ears visibly flushed with a bright pink and red watercolor blush spreading down to the neck. Blurred out background. Soft side lighting emphasizing the reddened ears. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他被我气得脸红了，耳朵也红的很……'. [Panel 2 (shotId 47_INSERT, bottom small panel)]: Blank space transitioning seamlessly, maintaining the bright warm pastel color palette, soft peach pink hues, clean white highlights, romantic atmosphere.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P22.png", "reference_ids": ["7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "47", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "他被我气得脸红了，耳朵也红的很……", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，固定镜头。陆承衍的侧脸特写。他的视线慌乱地看向别处，嘴唇紧抿，耳尖泛起明显的红晕，连带着脖子都红了。环境细节：背景虚化。光线与质感：侧光打在陆承衍脸上，耳尖的红色使用水彩质感的晕染，十分细腻。漫画视觉重点：陆承衍泛红的耳尖和躲闪的视线。"}, {"shotId": "47_INSERT", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "", "storyboardDetails": ""}], "sort_order": 21}, {"id": "efa3386f-9c40-435b-ba75-e142ff3557ce", "page_id": "P23", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "画风突转，近期躲避行为展示", "visual_focus": "两人在客厅一追一逃的夸张距离感", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones. The page layout is L17 vertical scroll, staggered large, medium, small panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 48, top panel)]: Medium shot. 陆承衍 puts both hands in pockets, walking away fast with back turned, eyebrows locked together, lips sealed tight. 江迟 reaches one hand forward from behind trying to grab. Apartment living room setting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '但最近，他连「死对头」都不乐意说了。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 49, middle large panel)]: Full shot, tracking camera. 江迟 runs chasing from behind, arms spread wide open. 陆承衍 strides rapidly away in the front, breaking into a slight jog, turning the head back glancing with sharp vigilant eyes. Circling around the living room sofa. Horizontal comic speed lines emphasize the running motion. Bright indoor lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他开始躲我。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 50, bottom small panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 steps one big foot forward landing firmly on the tiled floor. 陆承衍 instantly steps back two paces in response, crossing both arms tightly across the chest in a defensive guard pose. Flat lighting focusing on the legs and body language. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我走近一步，他退两步。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P23.png", "reference_ids": ["7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7", "2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "48", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "但最近，他连「死对头」都不乐意说了。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，固定镜头。陆承衍双手插兜，背对着江迟快步走开，眉头紧锁，嘴唇紧闭成一条线。江迟在后面伸出一只手想要挽留。环境细节：公寓客厅，两人拉开距离。光线与质感：冷色调的灯光，气氛有些疏离。漫画视觉重点：陆承衍快速离开的背影和紧锁的眉头。"}, {"shotId": "49", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "他开始躲我。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：全景，跟镜头。江迟在前面追，双手张开，陆承衍在前面大步流星地走，甚至小跑起来，时不时回头看一眼，眼神警惕。环境细节：宽敞的客厅绕着沙发转圈。光线与质感：明亮的室内光，加入速度线强调动作的急促。漫画视觉重点：两人一追一逃的夸张肢体动作。"}, {"shotId": "50", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "我走近一步，他退两步。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，推镜头。江迟向前迈出一大步，一只脚落地。对面的陆承衍立刻向后连退两步，双臂交叉在胸前做出防御姿态。环境细节：地板上的瓷砖线条辅助表现距离拉大。光线与质感：平光，聚焦两人的脚步和肢体动作。漫画视觉重点：江迟迈出的脚和陆承衍交叉双臂的防御动作。"}], "sort_order": 22}, {"id": "315c8da5-ea64-4ed9-808a-d8ea44d0ffca", "page_id": "P24", "layout_type": "L07 上下双分·均等 (50%+50%)", "page_purpose": "极限防守的动作分解", "visual_focus": "悬空的双手与防贼一般捂嘴的大手", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones. The page layout is L07 equal top and bottom split layout (50% + 50%). [Panel 1 (shotId 51, top panel)]: Medium close-up. 江迟 stretches both arms straight forward, fingers open wide ready to hug. 陆承衍 sharply twists the upper body rightwards, dodging the arms completely, letting 江迟's hands barely graze past the fabric of the shirt. Dynamic motion blur lines around the arms, detailed clothing folds. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我伸手想抱，他直接侧身。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 52, bottom panel)]: Close-up, high angle. 江迟 stands on tiptoes, eyes closed shut, pushing lips outwards upwards attempting a kiss. 陆承衍 raises one large hand extending the palm, firmly covering flat over 江迟's mouth, pushing back. 陆承衍's eyebrows knit tightly, eyes highly alert. Strong overhead light highlighting the veins on the back of 陆承衍's hand. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我垫脚想亲，他一把捂住我的嘴，表情像在防贼。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P24.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "51", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我伸手想抱，他直接侧身。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，固定镜头。江迟双手向前伸出，手指张开，呈拥抱状。陆承衍猛地向右侧身，肩膀一侧，江迟的双手擦着陆承衍的衣服布料划过。环境细节：局部特写两人手臂和身体的交错。光线与质感：动感模糊的线条，衣服布料的褶皱刻画细腻。漫画视觉重点：江迟悬空的双手和陆承衍侧身躲避的瞬间。"}, {"shotId": "52", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我垫脚想亲，他一把捂住我的嘴，表情像在防贼。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，俯拍。江迟踮起脚尖，闭着眼睛，嘟起嘴唇向上凑。陆承衍伸出一只宽大的手掌，死死捂住江迟的嘴巴，陆承衍眉头紧皱，眼神警觉。环境细节：两人身体紧贴，背景是模糊的墙壁。光线与质感：顶光打下，陆承衍的手背青筋凸起，质感强烈。漫画视觉重点：江迟嘟起的嘴唇和陆承衍捂嘴的手。"}], "sort_order": 23}, {"id": "2051d3d7-839b-4cbc-a51a-15a489039c36", "page_id": "P25", "layout_type": "L20 垂直通栏·大-窄-大夹层", "page_purpose": "强烈落差感：曾经的纯情与如今的冷漠对比", "visual_focus": "浴巾诱惑失败与脸红回忆的交叠", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, soft pastel tones. The page layout is L20 vertical scroll, large-narrow-large sandwich panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 53, top large panel)]: Full shot, low angle. Standing at the bathroom door. 江迟 is wearing only a pure white bath towel wrapped around the body, revealing bare shoulders and collarbones, wet dripping hair, hands placed firmly on the waist, strutting playfully. Warm yellow steam and bathroom light spilling out from behind glowing beautifully on the wet skin. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '晚上洗完澡，我裹着浴巾在他眼前晃。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 54, middle narrow panel)]: Medium shot. 陆承衍 sits on the living room sofa, holding up a paper document with both hands directly covering the face, staring totally motionless straight at the document paper, eyes completely ignoring 江迟 in the front. A reading lamp casts a shadow behind the document. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他连看都不看一眼。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 55, bottom large panel)]: Medium close-up. A soft glowing flashback scene. 陆承衍 uses one hand to firmly pinch the back of 江迟's neck, turning the head away sharply, ear tips glowing intensely red, lips slightly open breathing, eyebrows knitted in pure flustered panic. Romantic warm memory filter with soft watercolor edges. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '以前他至少会红着耳尖骂我「不知羞」。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P25.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "53", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "晚上洗完澡，我裹着浴巾在他眼前晃。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：全景，仰拍。浴室门口。江迟只裹着一条白色的浴巾，露出白皙的肩膀和锁骨，头发湿漉漉地滴着水，双手掐腰，在陆承衍面前晃来晃去。环境细节：浴室门半开，里面透出水蒸气。光线与质感：浴室里暖黄色的灯光透过水雾打在江迟身上，皮肤泛着莹润的光泽。漫画视觉重点：江迟湿漉漉的头发、裹着的浴巾以及掐腰的动作。"}, {"shotId": "54", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "他连看都不看一眼。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，固定镜头。陆承衍坐在沙发上，双手拿着一份文件挡在脸前，双眼直视着文件，眼珠一动不动，完全不看前面的江迟。环境细节：客厅沙发。光线与质感：冷色的阅读灯打在文件上，陆承衍的半张脸隐藏在文件后的阴影里。漫画视觉重点：陆承衍挡在脸前的文件和僵直的眼神。"}, {"shotId": "55", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "以前他至少会红着耳尖骂我「不知羞」。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，固定镜头。闪回画面。陆承衍一只手捏着江迟的后颈，偏过头去，耳尖通红，嘴唇微张，眉头微微皱起，一副气急败坏的样子。环境细节：柔和的回忆滤镜边缘。光线与质感：暖色调的光晕，耳尖的红晕刻画明显。漫画视觉重点：陆承衍捏着江迟后颈的手和通红的耳尖。"}], "sort_order": 24}, {"id": "f71553ab-5599-4c90-a5d2-8930b3905363", "page_id": "P26", "layout_type": "L06 上下双分·上小下大 (30%+70%)", "page_purpose": "疑惑与闭门羹带来的打击", "visual_focus": "重重关上的房门与决绝的背影", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones. The page layout is L06 top small, bottom large split layout (30% + 70%). [Panel 1 (shotId 56, top small panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 folds arms across the chest, tilts the head to the side, squinting the eyes slightly, pulling down the corners of the mouth in confusion. A giant comic question mark bubble pops up above the head. Cold white indoor light. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '现在呢？'. [Panel 2 (shotId 57, bottom large panel)]: Medium shot, tracking camera. 陆承衍 stands up abruptly, snatching a mobile phone from the coffee table with one hand, striding fast towards the study room with a cold resolute back profile. On the right edge of the panel, the heavy wooden study door is drawn slamming shut violently, generating a large comic impact action text '砰' (BANG) with vibration lines. Shadows deepen as 陆承衍 walks into the dim hallway. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他拿起手机，直接进了书房，门「砰」地一声。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P26.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "56", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "现在呢？", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，固定镜头。回到现实。江迟双手抱胸，歪着头，眼睛微微眯起，嘴角向下撇，头上冒出一个大大的问号气泡。环境细节：客厅环境。光线与质感：冷白光，情绪转为疑惑。漫画视觉重点：江迟抱胸的动作和头顶的问号。"}, {"shotId": "57", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "他拿起手机，直接进了书房，门「砰」地一声。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，跟镜头。陆承衍猛地站起身，一把抓起茶几上的手机，大步流星走向书房。画面右侧画出书房门被重重关上，门板震动发出“砰”的特效字。环境细节：书房门和走廊。光线与质感：陆承衍走入昏暗的走廊，背影显得冷峻绝情。漫画视觉重点：陆承衍抓手机的手和重重关上的房门。"}], "sort_order": 25}, {"id": "c5b23e47-07fb-44ba-9d68-d1664b8d1c78", "page_id": "P27", "layout_type": "L19 垂直通栏·一主两窄", "page_purpose": "烘托极度失落凄凉的心理状态", "visual_focus": "掉落浴巾的孤单身影与门缝底下一丝残忍的光线", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art. The page layout is L19 vertical scroll, one main and two narrow panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 58, top main panel)]: Full shot, high angle looking down. In the center of a huge, empty living room, 江迟 stands frozen alone. The white bath towel has completely dropped down gathering at the ankles. 江迟 frantically covers the chest with both hands in shock, eyes widened, mouth slightly open. An overhead spotlight casts a lonely circular shadow right under the feet. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我站在客厅，浴巾都掉了。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 59, middle narrow panel)]: Close-up. A tightly shut wooden study door, with a single sharp, piercing thin beam of bright light leaking out from under the bottom door crack into the dark hallway. Beside the door frame, one of 江迟's hands hangs weakly and limply downwards. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他也没回头。'. [Panel 3 (shotId 60, bottom narrow panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 heavily drops the shoulders, closing the eyes completely, exhaling a large white sighing cloud effect out of the mouth. The background is completely black around the character, with sad cool blue and purple lighting on the face. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '哎。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P27.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "58", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我站在客厅，浴巾都掉了。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：全景，俯拍。空荡荡的客厅里，江迟孤零零地站在原地，身上的浴巾滑落在脚踝处，双手惊慌地捂在胸前，眼睛瞪大，嘴巴微张。环境细节：巨大的客厅显得江迟十分弱小。光线与质感：顶灯在江迟脚下投下一圈孤寂的阴影，氛围凄凉。漫画视觉重点：滑落到脚踝的浴巾和江迟捂胸的动作。"}, {"shotId": "59", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "他也没回头。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，固定镜头。书房门紧闭，门缝底下透出一丝微弱的灯光。江迟的一只手无力地垂在身侧。环境细节：紧闭的木制门。光线与质感：走廊光线昏暗，门缝底下的光线刺眼，对比强烈。漫画视觉重点：紧闭的房门和门底的光线。"}, {"shotId": "60", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "哎。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：特写，推镜头。江迟深深地叹了一口气，肩膀耷拉下来，闭上眼睛，嘴里呼出一团白色的叹气气泡。环境细节：背景变黑，只有江迟的半身。光线与质感：忧郁的蓝紫色调，表现出人物的失落感。漫画视觉重点：江迟耷拉的肩膀和呼出的气泡。"}], "sort_order": 26}, {"id": "b1a1da92-090f-43ec-8777-a233b45ced4f", "page_id": "P28", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "绝地反弹，由悲伤转为狂暴怒火", "visual_focus": "燃烧斗志的脸与满眼红血丝抓狂崩溃的强烈反差", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, vibrant contrasting colors. The page layout is L05 top large, bottom small split layout (70% + 30%). [Panel 1 (shotId 61, top large panel)]: Medium shot, low angle. 江迟 balls both hands into tight fists placed in front of the chest, eyes turning extremely determined, eyebrows locked tight, teeth biting down heavily on the lower lip. In the blurry background, a faint imaginary silhouette of two people holding hands appears, completely engulfed in massive roaring fiery red comic flames of pure motivation. Hard dramatic red lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '看来我老公外面的那个人，已经等不急了。'. [Panel 2 (shotId 62, bottom small panel)]: Medium close-up, tilted angle. 江迟 uses both hands to aggressively rub and grab 江迟's own hair, messing it up completely into a bird's nest shape. The eyes are exaggeratedly covered in red blood vessel lines, mouth wide open screaming. The background flashes with chaotic shadows of multiple fluffy fox tails. Frenzied, highly saturated chaotic lighting. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '到底是哪个狐狸精啊，怎么把我老公哄的不要我了？'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P28.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "61", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "看来我老公外面的那个人，已经等不急了。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，仰拍。江迟双手握拳放在胸前，眼神变得坚定，眉头紧锁，牙齿咬紧下唇，脑海中浮现出一个模糊的两个人影牵手的画面（想象中的狐狸精和陆承衍）。环境细节：背景燃烧起熊熊的斗志火焰。光线与质感：火红色的光线照亮江迟的脸庞，线条硬朗。漫画视觉重点：江迟坚定的眼神和紧握的双拳。"}, {"shotId": "62", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "到底是哪个狐狸精啊，怎么把我老公哄的不要我了？", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中近景，倾斜构图。江迟双手用力抓着自己的头发，把头发揉得像鸡窝一样，眼睛布满红血丝（漫画夸张），张大嘴巴大吼。环境细节：背景出现各种狐狸的尾巴幻影。光线与质感：混乱的光影，色彩对比强烈，表现内心的抓狂。漫画视觉重点：江迟揉乱头发的双手和布满红血丝的眼睛。"}], "sort_order": 27}, {"id": "b08b47f1-bb3b-40b9-ad19-0d1f0a9bef03", "page_id": "P29", "layout_type": "L07 上下双分·均等 (50%+50%)", "page_purpose": "夸张咆哮与无厘头的怨妇逻辑", "visual_focus": "向天流下面条泪与用力转动地球仪的不甘", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones. The page layout is L07 equal top and bottom split layout (50% + 50%). [Panel 1 (shotId 63, top panel)]: Extreme close-up. 江迟 tilts the head all the way back facing upwards to the sky, throwing both hands up high. Exaggerated massive waterfall-like tears pour heavily down the cheeks, the mouth stretched open into a perfect giant square shape screaming. Background features high-contrast sharp impact lines. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '天杀的啊！'. [Panel 2 (shotId 64, bottom panel)]: Full shot. Standing in the living room corner. 江迟 extends one hand spinning a large vintage globe forcefully, placing the other hand on the hip, eyebrows locked tight together, staring dead strictly at the spinning globe. Warm side light illuminates the globe and the side profile. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '世界上那么多男人，非要抢我老公吗？'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P29.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "63", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "天杀的啊！", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：大特写，固定镜头。江迟仰起头，双手举向天空，眼泪像两条宽阔的瀑布一样流下来，嘴巴张成一个大大的方形。环境细节：黑白线条背景，增加戏剧冲击力。光线与质感：纯漫画风格的高对比度，没有多余环境光，集中在夸张表情。漫画视觉重点：江迟举向天空的双手和夸张的方形嘴巴。"}, {"shotId": "64", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "世界上那么多男人，非要抢我老公吗？", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：全景，固定镜头。江迟站在地球仪旁边，伸出一只手用力转动地球仪，另一只手叉腰，眉头紧锁，死死盯着转动的地球仪。环境细节：客厅的角落，放着一个巨大的复古地球仪。光线与质感：侧光照亮地球仪和江迟的侧脸，动静结合。漫画视觉重点：江迟转动地球仪的手和严肃的神态。"}], "sort_order": 28}, {"id": "65f4a8d6-7d7d-4963-b878-23de73e688e2", "page_id": "P30", "layout_type": "L01 全屏格 (90%+)", "page_purpose": "定格高光时刻，以彻底的乌龙决心结束本章节", "visual_focus": "江迟绑着必胜头巾热血沸腾的坚毅面貌", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright warm tones, cinematic storyboard composition. The page layout is L01 full-screen panel (90%+). [Panel 1 (shotId 65, full screen)]: Medium shot, push-in camera. 江迟 wears a white fabric headband tightly tied across the forehead with the black Chinese characters '必胜' written on it. 江迟 tightly crosses the arms across the chest, lifting the chin high up proudly, eyes glowing brightly with unyielding determination, mouth curved up into a highly confident smile. A brilliant radiant golden comic burst effect explodes directly from the background outward. Strong epic top spotlight catching bright highlights on the nose and forehead. A white speech bubble with soft shadow contains the Chinese text '我是个传统的男人，我得让我这个迷途的老公知返。'.", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P30.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "65", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我是个传统的男人，我得让我这个迷途的老公知返。", "storyboardDetails": "景别+镜头运动：中景，推镜头。江迟不知从哪找来一条白色的头巾绑在额头上，上面写着“必胜”两个字。他双手抱胸，下巴高抬，眼睛里闪烁着坚毅的光芒，嘴角勾起自信的笑。环境细节：背景放射出耀眼的光芒。光线与质感：极具热血漫质感的顶光，高光打在额头和鼻尖上。漫画视觉重点：江迟额头上的“必胜”头巾和抱胸的动作。"}], "sort_order": 29}]}, {"id": "2333d518-84fe-448a-9603-0dc0d62fe4bb", "title": "抓奸反倒自投罗网", "sort_order": 1, "pages": [{"id": "254ac275-1492-4a1c-ab0d-51c9f6da44e8", "page_id": "P31", "layout_type": "L16 垂直通栏·四层匀速", "page_purpose": "展示江迟鬼祟跟踪的行为与内心丰富的脑补战斗计划", "visual_focus": "江迟夸张的肢体动作与全副武装的打扮", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L16 vertical single column with four equally spaced horizontal panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 66, top panel)]: City street scene with bright and fresh sunlight. 江迟 hides behind a thick utility pole, leaning half of his body out with his eyes widened, staring intensely ahead. Not far ahead, 陆承衍 walks steadily on the sidewalk. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '于是我开始跟踪陆承衍。' [Panel 2 (shotId 67, second panel)]: 江迟 stands behind the utility pole, both hands curled into fists and placed at his chest, his eyebrows slightly drawn together and lips pressed into a tight straight line. Behind 江迟 is an imagined comic bubble, inside which 江迟 stands with hands on hips, gesturing animatedly at a blurred human figure, surrounded by preaching text symbols. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我打算找到他外面的那个男朋友，先好好跟人讲讲道理，' [Panel 3 (shotId 68, third panel)]: Medium close-up, tilted angle. 江迟 raises his right arm forcefully to show off his bicep, the corners of his mouth turned up confidently, his eyes sharp and focused. The background behind him changes to burning red flame effects. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '要是道理讲不通，我一米八的个子还可以跟他打一架。' [Panel 4 (shotId 69, bottom panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 uses both hands to pull down the brim of a black baseball cap, while pulling up a black face mask to cover most of his face. He wears a loose hooded sweatshirt. Only his vigilant, darting eyes are visible, with light focused on his eye area. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '卫衣、口罩、鸭舌帽，全副武装。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P31.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7", "d46571da-c4cd-4ff7-90d1-1a3c967538fc"], "shots": [{"shotId": "66", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "于是我开始跟踪陆承衍。", "storyboardDetails": "全景+固定镜头：城市街道场景。江迟躲在一根粗大的电线杆后面，小心翼翼地探出半个身子，眼睛睁大紧紧盯着前方。前方不远处，陆承衍正步伐平稳地走在人行道上。阳光洒在街道上，色彩明亮清新，突出江迟鬼鬼祟祟的跟踪动作。"}, {"shotId": "67", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我打算找到他外面的那个男朋友，先好好跟人讲讲道理，", "storyboardDetails": "中景+推镜头：江迟站在电线杆后，双手握紧拳头放在胸前，眉头微皱，嘴唇紧紧抿成一条直线。他的身后出现一个脑补的漫画气泡，气泡中江迟正双手叉腰，对着一个模糊的人影手舞足蹈地说话，周围有表示说教的文字符号，画面色调活泼。"}, {"shotId": "68", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "要是道理讲不通，我一米八的个子还可以跟他打一架。", "storyboardDetails": "中近景+倾斜构图：江迟用力举起右臂，展示自己的肱二头肌，嘴角自信地上扬，眼神锐利充满斗志。他的背景变成了燃烧的红色火焰特效，象征着他的战斗欲。线条粗犷有力，凸显商业条漫中的夸张搞笑元素，视觉重点在江迟自信的表情和拳头。"}, {"shotId": "69", "sortOrder": 3, "content": "卫衣、口罩、鸭舌帽，全副武装。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：江迟双手将黑色的鸭舌帽帽檐往下压，接着拉起黑色的口罩遮住大半张脸，身上穿着一件宽大的连帽卫衣。画面只露出他一双警惕且滴溜溜转动的眼睛，光线集中在他的眼部，营造出一种“全副武装”的潜伏氛围。"}], "sort_order": 0}, {"id": "cef1e18c-fbc4-4627-8707-e62587dd160a", "page_id": "P32", "layout_type": "L11 上1下2·下均分 (上55%, 下45%平分)", "page_purpose": "通过路人视角点破‘抓奸’意图，引出江迟的震惊反应", "visual_focus": "司机八卦的眼神与江迟瞬间放大的惊恐眼瞳", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L11 top and bottom split, top takes 55%, bottom takes 45% and is evenly split horizontally. [Panel 1 (shotId 70, top panel)]: Close-up. Inside a taxi, the rearview mirror reflects the taxi driver's eyes glancing toward the back seat. The driver's eyebrows are slightly raised. The lighting inside the car is slightly dim, with blurred moving street scenery at the mirror's edges. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '出租车司机从后视镜瞄我一眼。' [Panel 2 (shotId 71, bottom left panel)]: Medium shot. The driver holds the steering wheel with one hand and turns his head to look at the back row, his mouth wide open in a bright smile. Bright sunlight shines through the window onto the driver's face. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the driver's mouth, contains the Chinese text '小伙子，抓奸啊？' [Panel 3 (shotId 72, bottom right panel)]: Medium close-up, zooming in. 江迟 sits in the back seat, leaning forward suddenly with both hands tightly gripping the backrest of the front seat. His eyes above the face mask are instantly widened, pupils contracted, eyelashes clearly defined. A giant exclamation mark effect pops up above his head. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '师傅，您怎么知道？'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P32.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "d46571da-c4cd-4ff7-90d1-1a3c967538fc"], "shots": [{"shotId": "70", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "出租车司机从后视镜瞄我一眼。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：出租车内的车内后视镜。镜面反射出出租车司机向后座瞥去的双眼，司机的眉毛微微挑起，眼角带着一丝探究的意味。车内光线稍暗，窗外掠过的街景在镜子边缘形成动态虚影，视觉重点是镜中司机充满八卦的眼神。"}, {"shotId": "71", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "「小伙子，抓奸啊？」", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：出租车前排。司机单手扶着方向盘，转过头看向后排，嘴角咧开，带着明显的八卦笑容。阳光透过车窗打在司机的脸上，画面明亮，线条轻松流畅，突出司机看热闹不嫌事大的轻松状态。"}, {"shotId": "72", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "我：「师傅，您怎么知道？」", "storyboardDetails": "中近景+拉镜头：坐在后排的江迟身体猛地向前倾，双手紧紧抓着前排座椅的靠背。他口罩上方的双眼瞬间瞪大，瞳孔收缩，睫毛根根分明，头顶冒出一个巨大的惊叹号特效，表现出被看穿后的震惊状态。"}], "sort_order": 1}, {"id": "bb55c732-d3d3-4e26-9e2c-185e4a6afc3f", "page_id": "P33", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "延续幽默互动，展示江迟吃瘪的搞笑状态", "visual_focus": "司机见多识广的得瑟模样对比江迟的极度无语", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L05 top and bottom split, top takes 70%, bottom takes 30%. [Panel 1 (shotId 73, top panel)]: Medium shot. The driver looks forward at the road again, lifting one hand off the steering wheel in a casual waving gesture. The corners of his mouth turn slightly downwards, his chin slightly lifted. Dappled light and shadows flow inside the car. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the driver's mouth, contains the Chinese text '你这副表情，我拉过太多了。' [Panel 2 (shotId 74, bottom panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 slumps back in the rear seat, the corner of his eye twitching slightly, his eyebrows drooping weakly down. Several thick black vertical lines are drawn on his forehead, his chin slightly tucked in. The background is processed in grayscale. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '……'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P33.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "d46571da-c4cd-4ff7-90d1-1a3c967538fc"], "shots": [{"shotId": "73", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "司机：「你这副表情，我拉过太多了。」", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：司机重新看向前方的路况，一只手离开方向盘随意地摆了摆。他嘴角微微撇着，下巴微扬，做出一副见多识广的表情。车外斑驳的光影在车厢内流转，营造出日常闲聊的轻松氛围，视觉重点是司机的肢体动作。"}, {"shotId": "74", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我：「……」", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：江迟瘫坐在后座上，眼角微微抽搐，眉毛无力地耷拉下来。他的额头画着几条粗重的黑色竖线，下巴微收，整个人陷入一种无语的僵硬状态。画面背景做灰度处理，突出他此刻吃瘪的幽默感。"}], "sort_order": 2}, {"id": "6884e7e0-5ffb-457f-b76d-f0305712ef4f", "page_id": "P34", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "快速推进剧情，锁定目标车辆并建立跟踪的紧张感", "visual_focus": "前方的黑色宾利与江迟紧张专注的视线", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L15 vertical single column with three equally sized horizontal panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 75, top panel)]: Over-the-shoulder shot from the driver's perspective. The driver extends one finger pointing at the front windshield. Through the glass, a black Bentley car is seen driving steadily ahead, its body reflecting expensive metallic gloss under the bright sunlight. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the driver's mouth, contains the Chinese text '跟前面那辆宾利？' [Panel 2 (shotId 76, center panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 leans forward again, gripping the driver's seat backrest. He extends one index finger vertically in front of his face mask in a shushing gesture. His eyes stare intensely at the Bentley ahead. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '对，别让他发现。' [Panel 3 (shotId 77, bottom panel)]: Medium shot. The driver holds the steering wheel with one hand and pats his chest forcefully with the other. He lifts his chin, showing an extremely confident and bright smile, with sparkling star effects in the background. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to the driver's mouth, contains the Chinese text '放心，这活儿我熟。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P34.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "d46571da-c4cd-4ff7-90d1-1a3c967538fc", "143e5b21-9df8-4616-891c-1480acbd2ed2"], "shots": [{"shotId": "75", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "司机：「跟前面那辆宾利？」", "storyboardDetails": "主观视角（过肩镜头）：从司机的肩膀上方看去，司机伸出一根手指指着前方的挡风玻璃。透过挡风玻璃，清晰地看到一辆黑色的宾利车正在前方平稳行驶，车身在阳光下闪烁着昂贵的金属光泽。"}, {"shotId": "76", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我：「对，别让他发现。」", "storyboardDetails": "中景+推镜头：江迟再次身体前倾，双手扒着驾驶座的靠背。他伸出一根食指竖在口罩外面，做出“噤声”的动作。双眼死死盯着前方的宾利车，眼神专注且紧张，窗外的光线飞速后退，增强了跟踪的紧张感。"}, {"shotId": "77", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "司机：「放心，这活儿我熟。」", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：司机单手握着方向盘，另一只手用力地拍了拍自己的胸口。他扬起下巴，露出一个极其自信的灿烂笑容，背景出现闪亮的星星特效，表现出他作为老司机的绝对专业和自豪感。"}], "sort_order": 3}, {"id": "d40bc247-6b6d-405b-a482-dbbfa155ad86", "page_id": "P35", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "镜头转场至目的地，展示陆承衍等人接头的环境", "visual_focus": "繁华的咖啡店全景与陆承衍沉稳等待的侧影", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L17 vertical single column with three panels of large, medium, and small sizes from top to bottom. [Panel 1 (shotId 78, top large panel)]: Wide shot. A bustling city center street with bright sunshine. The black Bentley is parked smoothly in front of a beautifully decorated coffee shop with huge floor-to-ceiling glass windows reflecting golden sunlight. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '陆承衍的车停在市中心一家咖啡店门口。' [Panel 2 (shotId 79, center medium panel)]: Full shot. 陆承衍, wearing a well-tailored casual suit, stands straight on the steps in front of the coffee shop with his legs slightly apart. Sunlight hits his shoulders. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他没进去。' [Panel 3 (shotId 80, bottom small panel)]: Medium shot. 陆承衍 slightly lowers his head, holding a phone with one hand, his long thumb swiping on the screen. The faint light from the screen illuminates the lower half of his face, his eyelashes casting soft shadows. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '站在门口看手机。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P35.png", "reference_ids": ["7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7", "143e5b21-9df8-4616-891c-1480acbd2ed2", "4053d16d-2f7d-4de7-ba8b-63f142321ee4"], "shots": [{"shotId": "78", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "陆承衍的车停在市中心一家咖啡店门口。", "storyboardDetails": "远景+固定镜头：繁华的市中心街道。阳光明媚，那辆黑色的宾利平稳地停在一家装修精致、有着巨大落地玻璃窗的咖啡店门口。玻璃窗反射着金色的阳光，街道两旁有行人和绿植，画面清透，呈现出现代都市的商业质感。"}, {"shotId": "79", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "他没进去。", "storyboardDetails": "全景+固定镜头：陆承衍身穿剪裁得体的休闲西装，身姿挺拔地站在咖啡店门口的台阶上。他并没有去推门，而是静静地站在原地，双腿微微分开，阳光打在他的肩膀上，勾勒出他修长的身形轮廓。"}, {"shotId": "80", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "站在门口看手机。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+拉镜头：陆承衍微微低着头，单手拿着手机，修长的拇指在屏幕上滑动。手机屏幕的微光映在他的下半张脸上，他的眼神专注地看着屏幕，长长的睫毛在眼睑投下淡淡的阴影，氛围安静沉稳。"}], "sort_order": 4}, {"id": "e6f84256-2fa7-4651-b692-cb923d3ed2cc", "page_id": "P36", "layout_type": "L06 上下双分·上小下大 (30%+70%)", "page_purpose": "揭晓‘外面的男人’的真面目，制造颜值冲击力", "visual_focus": "傅时深出场的强大气场与完美侧脸特写", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L06 top and bottom split, top takes 30%, bottom takes 70%. [Panel 1 (shotId 81, top small panel)]: Full shot. The glass door of the coffee shop is pushed open, and 傅时深 walks out with long legs. He stands tall, stepping steadily. Sunlight shines from behind him, creating a slight backlight effect. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '接着咖啡店里走出来一个男人。' [Panel 2 (shotId 82, bottom large panel)]: Close-up. 傅时深's face and shoulders. He wears an exquisite black suit. The side angle captures his sharply defined jawline and high bridge of the nose, with deep eyes. Sparkling highlight effects surround him. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '黑色西装，宽肩长腿，侧脸线条跟画出来的似的。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P36.png", "reference_ids": ["dad0eadd-2f81-4f4d-8be7-d3c5000bd069", "4053d16d-2f7d-4de7-ba8b-63f142321ee4"], "shots": [{"shotId": "81", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "接着咖啡店里走出来一个男人。", "storyboardDetails": "全景+推镜头：咖啡店的玻璃门被一双手推开，傅时深迈着长腿从店内走出。他身姿挺拔，步伐沉稳，推门的动作干净利落。阳光从他身后照射过来，形成轻微的逆光效果，为他的出场增添了气场。"}, {"shotId": "82", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "黑色西装，宽肩长腿，侧脸线条跟画出来的似的。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：傅时深的面部及肩部特写。他身穿考究的黑色西装，宽阔的肩膀撑起笔挺的布料。镜头侧方捕捉他棱角分明的下颌线和高挺的鼻梁，肌肤质感细腻，眼神深邃，画面周围有表示惊艳的高光闪烁特效。"}], "sort_order": 5}, {"id": "74ea44ed-8d9d-49f5-ae05-5b365df52ad1", "page_id": "P37", "layout_type": "L21 均等网格·2×2四格", "page_purpose": "快速展现江迟在看清情敌后的自我否决和秒变怂的心理过程", "visual_focus": "江迟夸张的表情包与Q版身高对比", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L21 equal grid with 2x2 four panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 83, top left panel)]: Medium close-up, tilted angle. 江迟 hides behind the taxi window, tightly gripping the edge of the window. His eyes are wide open like circles, pupils instantly shrunk to tiny dots, a giant sweat drop hanging on his forehead, his mouth slightly open. The background shatters into dark gray cracks. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '完蛋。' [Panel 2 (shotId 84, top right panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 bites his lower lip hard, his eyebrows locked tightly together. He stares straight out the window at 傅时深, his fingers unconsciously scratching hard on the glass window, fingertips turning white. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我老公外面的人那么帅？' [Panel 3 (shotId 85, bottom left panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 holds his chin with both hands. A giant thought bubble floats above his head. Inside the bubble is a chibi-style height comparison between 江迟 and 傅时深. Chibi 江迟 has to look up at the tall 傅时深, with a sweat drop on Chibi 江迟's head. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '还比我高，我跟他打架的话能打赢吗？' [Panel 4 (shotId 86, bottom right panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 sits in the back seat, crossing and waving his hands vigorously in front of his chest, shaking his head frantically like a rattle drum. His eyes are tightly shut, eyebrows squeezed together, surrounded by dynamic action lines of denial. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '不行不行。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P37.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "dad0eadd-2f81-4f4d-8be7-d3c5000bd069"], "shots": [{"shotId": "83", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "完蛋。", "storyboardDetails": "中近景+倾斜构图：江迟躲在出租车的车窗后，双手紧紧扒着车窗边缘。他的双眼睁得滚圆，瞳孔瞬间收缩成一个小点，额头挂着一滴巨大的冷汗，嘴巴微张，背景变成灰暗的破裂状，表现出他受到强烈冲击的状态。"}, {"shotId": "84", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我老公外面的人那么帅？", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：江迟用力咬着自己的下唇，眉头紧紧锁在一起。他的双眼直勾勾地盯着窗外的傅时深，手指无意识地在车窗玻璃上用力抠抓，指尖泛白。眼部细节被放大，展现出强烈的嫉妒与不可置信。"}, {"shotId": "85", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "还比我高，我跟他打架的话能打赢吗？", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：江迟双手托着下巴，眼神飘忽不定。他的头顶浮现出一个巨大的思考气泡。气泡内是Q版的江迟和傅时深身高对比图，江迟需要仰着头看高大的傅时深，Q版江迟头上顶着冷汗，画面充满喜剧感。"}, {"shotId": "86", "sortOrder": 3, "content": "不行不行。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：江迟在车后座上，双手在胸前用力且快速地交叉摆动，脑袋像拨浪鼓一样疯狂摇晃。他的眼睛紧紧闭着，眉头挤成一团，周围画满了表示否定的动作线，动感十足。"}], "sort_order": 6}, {"id": "8faa2682-1fec-40a0-84fb-a4bcee3c3e55", "page_id": "P38", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "江迟转变策略，产生荒诞离谱的‘勾引情敌’计划", "visual_focus": "江迟眼中闪烁的兴奋星光与粉色特效", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L05 top and bottom split, top takes 70%, bottom takes 30%. [Panel 1 (shotId 87, top large panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 pinches his chin with his right index finger and thumb, eyes half-squinted, rolling his eyeballs upwards. The corners of his mouth are slightly tense. Light hits the side of his face. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '得想个别的法子。' [Panel 2 (shotId 88, bottom small panel)]: Medium close-up. The corners of 江迟's mouth suddenly split into a wide, cunning smile. He presses his hands together in front of his chest, two sparkling star highlights shining in his eyes. The background turns into romantic pink bubbles and glitter effects. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '要不，我把这男人勾过来？'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P38.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "87", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "得想个别的法子。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：江迟用右手食指和拇指捏住自己的下巴，眼睛半眯起来，眼珠向上方转动。嘴角微微紧绷，处于极度专注的思考状态。光影打在他的侧脸上，凸显出他五官的立体精致。"}, {"shotId": "88", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "要不，我把这男人勾过来？", "storyboardDetails": "中近景+推镜头：江迟的嘴角突然咧开，露出一抹极其狡黠的笑容。双手在胸前合十，眼睛里亮起两颗闪亮的小星星高光，背景变成了充满粉色泡泡和闪粉的浪漫特效，整个人散发出一种“计划通”的兴奋感。"}], "sort_order": 7}, {"id": "e9d7366a-fb1c-4217-8802-d10a4d6000a1", "page_id": "P39", "layout_type": "L18 垂直通栏·顶窄底宽递增", "page_purpose": "情绪与决心层层递进，直至燃烧起斗志的特写", "visual_focus": "江迟自信的姿态与瞳孔中燃烧的斗志火焰", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L18 vertical single column with three panels, narrow at the top and gradually widening towards the bottom. [Panel 1 (shotId 89, top narrow panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 holds one hand in a fist and punches it firmly into his other palm. His eyes are shining, corners of his mouth lifted high, chin tilted up confidently. Bright vivid colors in the background. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '这样他就不会喜欢我老公了？' [Panel 2 (shotId 90, center medium panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 nods firmly once, hands resting on his hips. His chin is slightly raised, his gaze extremely determined, lips pursed into a confident curve. A cartoonish 'ding' sound effect text appears next to him. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '嗯。' [Panel 3 (shotId 91, bottom wide panel)]: Extreme close-up of 江迟's eyes. The corners of his eyes are slightly tilted up, his gaze sharp as a knife, with two tiny burning fire effects inside his pupils. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '可行。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P39.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "89", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "这样他就不会喜欢我老公了？", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：江迟单手握拳，用力敲在另一只手的手心里。双眼放光，嘴角高高上扬，下巴自信地抬起。身上仿佛散发着自信的光芒，完全沉浸在自己的完美计划中，画面色彩明快鲜艳。"}, {"shotId": "90", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "嗯。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：江迟用力地点了一下头，双手叉在腰间。他的下巴微微扬起，眼神变得异常坚定，嘴唇抿出自信的弧度，配合画面中夸张的“叮”字特效，展现出他下定决心的状态。"}, {"shotId": "91", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "可行。", "storyboardDetails": "大特写+拉镜头：极近距离特写江迟的双眼。他的眼角微微上挑，眼神锐利如刀，瞳孔中燃烧着两团小小的火焰特效。睫毛细致分明，眼神中充满了斗志和誓在必得的决绝，视觉冲击力极强。"}], "sort_order": 8}, {"id": "f92f3829-f464-4756-b890-8fca47628af3", "page_id": "P40", "layout_type": "L16 垂直通栏·四层匀速", "page_purpose": "监视两人互动，画师营造出两人般配的海报感作为反差对比", "visual_focus": "陆承衍与傅时深极度登对的同框画面", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L16 vertical single column with four equally spaced horizontal panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 92, top panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 grips the car window again, pulling down his hat brim. His eyes lock onto 傅时深 in the distance like radar. The composition extends from the dark car interior to the bright exterior. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '想着，我死死盯着那男人。' [Panel 2 (shotId 93, second panel)]: Wide shot. 傅时深 walks up to 陆承衍, keeping a polite distance. 傅时深 slightly lowers his eyelids and nods his chin lightly. Sunlight falls on them. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '那男人朝我老公点了点头。' [Panel 3 (shotId 94, third panel)]: Medium shot. 陆承衍 puts his phone in his pocket and looks up at 傅时深. He also nods slightly. Side lighting outlines his nose and neck. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '陆承衍也朝他点了点头。' [Panel 4 (shotId 95, bottom panel)]: Full shot. 陆承衍 and 傅时深 stand side by side under the sunlight in front of the coffee shop, both wearing crisp suits. Sparkling dreamy filters and falling petal effects surround them. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '还别说，他们两站一起，倒真是配的一脸。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P40.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "dad0eadd-2f81-4f4d-8be7-d3c5000bd069", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7", "4053d16d-2f7d-4de7-ba8b-63f142321ee4"], "shots": [{"shotId": "92", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "想着，我死死盯着那男人。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：江迟重新扒在车窗上，将帽檐往下压了压。双眼如同雷达一般，死死锁定远处的傅时深，目光灼灼，仿佛要把对方身上看穿一个洞。画面构图从暗处的车厢向明亮的车外延伸。"}, {"shotId": "93", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "那男人朝我老公点了点头。", "storyboardDetails": "远景+固定镜头：傅时深走到陆承衍面前，两人保持着礼貌的距离。傅时深微微垂下眼睑，下巴轻轻点动，表情平静淡漠。阳光落在他们身上，画面构图工整，展现出两人之间成熟的气场。"}, {"shotId": "94", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "陆承衍也朝他点了点头。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：陆承衍将手机收进口袋，抬起头看着傅时深。他也同样微微颔首，面部表情放松，两人之间的互动自然流畅。侧光勾勒出陆承衍高挺的鼻梁和修长的脖颈线条。"}, {"shotId": "95", "sortOrder": 3, "content": "还别说，他们两站一起，倒真是配的一脸。", "storyboardDetails": "全景+推镜头：陆承衍和傅时深并肩站在咖啡店门口的阳光下。两人都身穿笔挺的西装，身形修长，气质出众。画师特意在两人周围加上了闪闪发光的梦幻滤镜和花瓣特效，宛如一幅赏心悦目的双男主海报。"}], "sort_order": 9}, {"id": "5e161308-471c-4b54-a5c6-5ae959675d01", "page_id": "P41", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "打脸脑补画面，强烈的占有欲爆发", "visual_focus": "江迟夸张的愤怒表情与拍脸甩开杂念的动作", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L15 vertical single column with three equally sized horizontal panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 96, top panel)]: Close-up. 江迟 sits in the car, his eyebrows pointing sharply downwards, corners of his mouth pulled down hard. He makes an exaggerated spitting motion into the air, his cheeks puffed out. Popping vein symbols are drawn next to him. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '呸。' [Panel 2 (shotId 97, center panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 raises his hands, slapping his own cheeks hard. His eyes are tightly shut, shaking his head violently twice. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '不对。' [Panel 3 (shotId 98, bottom panel)]: Medium close-up. 江迟 tightly clenches his fists protectively in front of his chest, blazing fire effects erupting from his eyes. He pouts his lips high, staring out the window with a red flush on his face. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我老公只能跟我配。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P41.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "96", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "呸。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：江迟坐在车里，眉头倒竖，嘴角用力往下撇。他朝着空气用力地“啐”了一口，脸颊鼓起，画面旁边配上夸张的十字路口青筋特效，将嫉妒与不满的表情展现得淋漓尽致。"}, {"shotId": "97", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "不对。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：江迟双手举起，用力拍打自己的双颊。他的眼睛紧紧闭着，脑袋猛地摇晃了两下，试图将刚才脑海中觉得两人般配的画面甩出去，动作幅度很大，带有喜剧色彩。"}, {"shotId": "98", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "我老公只能跟我配。", "storyboardDetails": "中近景+固定镜头：江迟双手紧紧握拳护在胸前，眼睛里冒出熊熊烈火特效。他高高撅起嘴巴，满脸不服气地盯着窗外，整张脸因激动而微微泛红，强烈的占有欲通过肢体和表情完全具象化。"}], "sort_order": 10}, {"id": "63cbd2b9-14da-4f65-aedc-7fcc59434599", "page_id": "P42", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "两人进入室内，场景转移，构筑静谧氛围", "visual_focus": "通透光影下的咖啡店环境与两人对坐的和谐构图", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L17 vertical single column with three panels of large, medium, and small sizes from top to bottom. [Panel 1 (shotId 99, top large panel)]: Full shot from behind. 陆承衍 and 傅时深 push open the coffee shop's glass door one after another, the bells on the door frame swinging slightly. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '接着两个人一前一后进去了。' [Panel 2 (shotId 100, center medium panel)]: Wide shot. Seen through the large floor-to-ceiling glass window, empty seats by the window inside the coffee shop are bathed in sunlight. Vases and water glasses on the table refract light spots. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '靠窗的位置。' [Panel 3 (shotId 101, bottom small panel)]: Medium shot. 陆承衍 and 傅时深 sit across from each other at a small round table by the window. Sunlight hits them through the glass, outlining them with a golden edge. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '面对面坐下。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P42.png", "reference_ids": ["7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7", "dad0eadd-2f81-4f4d-8be7-d3c5000bd069", "4053d16d-2f7d-4de7-ba8b-63f142321ee4"], "shots": [{"shotId": "99", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "接着两个人一前一后进去了。", "storyboardDetails": "全景+固定镜头：陆承衍和傅时深一前一后推开咖啡店的玻璃门走进去。镜头从他们的背后拍摄，捕捉他们宽阔的背影和西装下摆随着动作轻微晃动的褶皱，门框上的铃铛轻轻摇摆。"}, {"shotId": "100", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "靠窗的位置。", "storyboardDetails": "远景+固定镜头：透过咖啡店巨大的落地玻璃窗，可以清晰地看到店内温馨的布置。阳光倾洒在靠窗的空座位上，桌面上的花瓶和水杯在阳光下折射出光斑，环境静谧优雅，光影通透。"}, {"shotId": "101", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "面对面坐下。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：陆承衍和傅时深在靠窗的小圆桌两边相对而坐。阳光透过玻璃窗打在两人身上，为他们的轮廓镀上一层金边。两人的姿态都很放松，画面构图对称，展现出商务交流的氛围。"}], "sort_order": 11}, {"id": "bd62d53e-ae1d-425c-b355-b615a55d7391", "page_id": "P43", "layout_type": "L18 垂直通栏·顶窄底宽递增", "page_purpose": "展现导致江迟彻底破防的关键行为：看手机与笑容", "visual_focus": "被逐渐放大的温柔笑容，氛围变得极其梦幻刺眼", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L18 vertical single column with three panels, narrow at the top and gradually widening towards the bottom. [Panel 1 (shotId 102, top narrow panel)]: Close-up. 陆承衍's long fingers gently press the edge of a phone with its screen lit up, slowly pushing it across the smooth table towards 傅时深 sitting opposite. Blurred background. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '陆承衍把手机推到那男人面前。' [Panel 2 (shotId 103, center medium panel)]: Close-up. 傅时深 looks down at the phone screen on the table. The corners of his mouth turn up slightly into a very small smile, the light from the screen reflecting in his eyes. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '那男人笑了。' [Panel 3 (shotId 104, bottom wide panel)]: Medium close-up. 傅时深's side profile illuminated by sunlight. His smile widens slightly, his eyebrows relaxed. Dreamy soft glow and falling light spot effects surround him. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '笑得……很好看。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P43.png", "reference_ids": ["7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7", "dad0eadd-2f81-4f4d-8be7-d3c5000bd069", "9b263ee4-3b56-40c0-bf00-5cd332520a7a"], "shots": [{"shotId": "102", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "陆承衍把手机推到那男人面前。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+拉镜头：陆承衍修长的手指轻轻按着手机边缘，将亮着屏幕的手机沿着光滑的桌面，缓缓推向对面的傅时深。镜头聚焦在手指和手机上，背景虚化，突出这个分享信息的关键动作。"}, {"shotId": "103", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "那男人笑了。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：傅时深低下头看着桌面上推过来的手机屏幕。他的嘴角微微向上牵起一个极小的弧度，原本冰冷的眼神变得柔和，眼中倒映着手机屏幕的光芒，微表情的变化非常细腻细腻。"}, {"shotId": "104", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "笑得……很好看。", "storyboardDetails": "中近景+推镜头：傅时深的面部特写，阳光恰好打在他的侧脸上。他舒展眉眼，笑容微微放大，整个人散发出一种温柔的魅力。周围加上梦幻的柔光渲染和飘落的光斑特效，强化他笑起来的视觉冲击力。"}], "sort_order": 12}, {"id": "285207a2-d1f5-414c-88f8-2ac68d73a8d4", "page_id": "P44", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "嫉妒具象化，江迟情绪迅速黑化", "visual_focus": "抠广告牌的青筋特写与黑化冷笑", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L15 vertical single column with three equally sized horizontal panels. [Panel 1 (shotId 105, top panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 hides behind a billboard across the street, using the back of his hand to block the front of his eyes. He closes one eye tightly and squints the other, his eyebrows furrowed. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '好看到我隔着一条马路都觉得刺眼。' [Panel 2 (shotId 106, center panel)]: Close-up. 江迟's fingers dig tightly into the edge of the billboard, nails almost sinking into the metal. His cheeks are bulging, his back teeth tightly clenched together, red sparks shooting from his eyes. Dark stormy effects in the background. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我躲在广告牌后面，牙齿咬得咯吱响。' [Panel 3 (shotId 107, bottom panel)]: Close-up. The corners of 江迟's mouth pull up steeply into a cold smile. His eyes are icy, chin slightly lifted. The overall color tone of the frame instantly darkens. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '呵。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P44.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "105", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "好看到我隔着一条马路都觉得刺眼。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：江迟躲在马路对面的广告牌后，用一只手背挡在眼睛前方。他紧紧闭上一只眼，另一只眼眯着，眉头皱起，仿佛被对面傅时深的笑容释放出的“强光”刺伤了眼睛，画面搞笑夸张。"}, {"shotId": "106", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我躲在广告牌后面，牙齿咬得咯吱响。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：江迟双手死死抠住广告牌的边缘，指甲几乎要陷入金属中。他的腮帮子高高鼓起，后槽牙紧紧咬合在一起，眼睛里冒着红色的火星，背景是灰暗的风暴特效，嫉妒心达到了顶点。"}, {"shotId": "107", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "呵。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：江迟的嘴角极度斜向上挑起，露出一抹充满冷意的笑容。他的眼神冰冷且充满不屑，下巴微扬，眼底闪过一丝危险的光芒，整个画面的色调瞬间变暗，凸显他即将爆发的情绪。"}], "sort_order": 13}, {"id": "b76a4af0-a467-4f01-93c2-fce8e84aa5f5", "page_id": "P45", "layout_type": "L07 上下双分·均等 (50%+50%)", "page_purpose": "将眼前的和谐景象与自己受到的冷遇进行对比，引发委屈感", "visual_focus": "现实中落寞的江迟与回忆中无情关门的陆承衍", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L07 top and bottom split evenly (50%+50%). [Panel 1 (shotId 108, top panel)]: Medium close-up, high angle shot. 江迟 lowers his head, shoulders weakly dropping. His fingers absentmindedly scratch the rough edge of the billboard, corners of his mouth pulled down into a grieved curve. A ring of gloomy blue shadow lines surrounds him. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '陆承衍都没对我笑过。' [Panel 2 (shotId 109, bottom panel)]: Full shot, cool color tone. 陆承衍 turns his back to 江迟, quickly walking into the bedroom, accompanied by a giant 'Bang' text effect as the door shuts heavily. A 'click' locking sound effect symbol appears at the doorknob. Outside the door, 江迟 reaches one hand out, stopping in mid-air with a grieved expression. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他只会躲我，反锁卧室门。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P45.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "108", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "陆承衍都没对我笑过。", "storyboardDetails": "中近景+俯拍：江迟低下头，肩膀无力地微微下垂。手指无意识地抠着广告牌粗糙的边缘，嘴角向下撇出一个委屈的弧度，眼神失落，周身笼罩着一圈阴郁的蓝色阴影线条。"}, {"shotId": "109", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "他只会躲我，反锁卧室门。", "storyboardDetails": "全景+固定镜头（脑补画面）：冷色调。陆承衍背对着江迟，快速走进卧室，伴随着巨大的“砰”字特效，门被重重关上。紧接着门把手处画出“咔哒”反锁的音效符号。门外，江迟伸出一只手停在半空，表情委屈。"}], "sort_order": 14}, {"id": "fe9444b6-dd8e-4273-ac04-bec197f2eb1f", "page_id": "P46", "layout_type": "L13 上2下1·上均分 (上45%平分, 下55%)", "page_purpose": "情绪汇聚，委屈转化为极端抓狂", "visual_focus": "上方双视角对比引出底部大格中江迟崩溃抓头发的狂躁", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L13 top and bottom split, top takes 45% and is evenly split horizontally, bottom takes 55%. [Panel 1 (shotId 110, top left panel)]: Close-up, low angle. 江迟 violently jerks his head up from the shadows, eyes widened extremely with red blood vessels showing in the whites. His eyebrows are tightly knitted together, fists clenched hard by his sides with veins bulging on the back of his hands. Strong contrast lighting on his face. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '现在呢？' [Panel 2 (shotId 111, top right panel)]: Wide shot from 江迟's perspective. Through the bright glass window, 陆承衍 leans forward slightly, looking at 傅时深 opposite him. 陆承衍's facial expression is extremely relaxed and gentle, with a hazy soft-focus filter around the edges. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '跟别人喝咖啡，笑得那么温柔。' [Panel 3 (shotId 112, bottom large panel)]: Medium shot, tilted angle. 江迟 grabs and violently rubs his own hair with both hands. His mouth is wide open, sparkling teardrops forming at the corners of his eyes, his teeth biting his lower lip. Messy black lines cover the background. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '还给别人看手机，我都没看过他手机。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P46.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7", "dad0eadd-2f81-4f4d-8be7-d3c5000bd069"], "shots": [{"shotId": "110", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "现在呢？", "storyboardDetails": "特写+仰拍：江迟猛地从阴影中抬起头，双眼因为愤怒和嫉妒而瞪得极大，眼白布满红血丝。眉头紧紧皱成川字，双拳在身体两侧用力握紧，手背上青筋凸起，强烈的对比光影打在他的脸上。"}, {"shotId": "111", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "跟别人喝咖啡，笑得那么温柔。", "storyboardDetails": "远景（主观视线）：从江迟的视角望去，透过阳光明媚的玻璃窗，陆承衍正身体微微前倾，看着对面的傅时深。陆承衍的面部表情极为放松柔和，两人似乎在愉快交谈，画面外围有一层朦胧的柔光滤镜。"}, {"shotId": "112", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "还给别人看手机，我都没看过他手机。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+倾斜构图：江迟双手抓着自己头发，用力揉弄。他的嘴巴张大，眼角泛起闪烁的委屈泪花，牙齿咬着下唇，呈现出一种抓狂、委屈又嫉妒的混合状态，背景布满杂乱的黑色线条。"}], "sort_order": 15}, {"id": "a1041fc4-5158-4dbd-bb26-23d9c33f593a", "page_id": "P47", "layout_type": "L18 垂直通栏·顶窄底宽递增", "page_purpose": "展现决定杀入战场的一拍即合感，积蓄的怒火化为行动力", "visual_focus": "由燃烧烈火的决心跨出极具攻击性的步伐", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L18 vertical single column with three panels, narrow at the top and gradually widening towards the bottom. [Panel 1 (shotId 113, top narrow panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 holds his clenched fists high in front of his chest, raging fire burning in his eyes. The background instantly shifts to an erupting volcano with red flame effects, his hair blown up by the airflow. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '这我能忍吗？' [Panel 2 (shotId 114, bottom wide panel)]: Full shot. 江迟 violently strides out from behind the billboard. His back is straight, chin lifted, eyes firm. The hem of his jacket swings back sharply in the air. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '不能。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P47.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0"], "shots": [{"shotId": "113", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "这我能忍吗？", "storyboardDetails": "中景+推镜头：江迟将紧握的双拳高高举在胸前，双眼燃烧着熊熊烈火。背景瞬间从街道变成了喷发的火山和红色的火焰特效，他的头发仿佛都被气流吹起，气势爆棚。"}, {"shotId": "114", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "不能。", "storyboardDetails": "全景+固定镜头：江迟猛地从广告牌后大步跨出。他脊背挺直，下巴扬起，眼神坚定且充满攻击性，外套的下摆随着他的动作在空中甩出一个凌厉的弧度，宛如即将上战场的战士。"}, {"shotId": "114_INSERT", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "", "storyboardDetails": ""}], "sort_order": 16}, {"id": "e8360afa-de2a-4b47-b33b-1ab9e20c8665", "page_id": "P48", "layout_type": "L18 垂直通栏·顶窄底宽递增", "page_purpose": "快节奏动作连贯展示，用铃铛的巨响将情绪推至顶峰", "visual_focus": "动感极强的冲锋与震耳欲聋的推门声效", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L18 vertical single column with three panels, narrow at the top and gradually widening towards the bottom. [Panel 1 (shotId 115, top narrow panel)]: Full shot. 江迟 strides across the zebra crossing with his long legs. The surrounding cars and pedestrians turn into blurred dynamic speed lines, his hooded sweatshirt flapping backwards in the wind. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我冲过马路。' [Panel 2 (shotId 116, center medium panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 rushes to the front of the coffee shop, extending both arms with muscles tense, forcefully pushing open the heavy glass doors. Sunlight pours in through the door gap, shining on his face. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '推开咖啡店的门。' [Panel 3 (shotId 117, bottom wide panel)]: Close-up. The brass bell at the top of the door shakes violently. Thick black lines trace the bell's swinging trajectory, surrounded by a giant 'DING' sound effect text with soundwave lines expanding outward. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '铃铛「叮」的一声。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P48.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "4053d16d-2f7d-4de7-ba8b-63f142321ee4"], "shots": [{"shotId": "115", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我冲过马路。", "storyboardDetails": "全景+跟镜头：江迟迈开长腿，不顾一切地穿过斑马线。镜头跟随他的步伐移动，周围的车辆和行人都变成了模糊的动态线条，他的连帽卫衣在风中向后翻飞，动感极强。"}, {"shotId": "116", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "推开咖啡店的门。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：江迟冲到咖啡店门前，双手伸直，手臂肌肉紧绷，用力推开咖啡店沉重的玻璃大门。阳光顺着推开的门缝倾泻而入，打在他满是怒火的脸上。"}, {"shotId": "117", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "铃铛「叮」的一声。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：门顶部的黄铜铃铛因为猛烈的撞击力而剧烈摇晃。画师用粗黑的线条画出铃铛摇晃的轨迹，周围爆发出巨大的“叮”字拟声词特效，声波线条向外扩散。"}], "sort_order": 17}, {"id": "355d168c-c998-4b9c-be3a-c9f2d7c7bd24", "page_id": "P49", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "突发事件的静止定格对比江迟旁若无人的傲慢气场", "visual_focus": "众人的惊愕与江迟大步流星、色彩鲜明的身影", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L05 top and bottom split, top takes 70%, bottom takes 30%. [Panel 1 (shotId 118, top large panel)]: Wide shot. Inside the coffee shop. All customers and a staff member wiping a table stop their actions. Dozens of eyes turn in unison toward the door, everyone's face showing surprise and shock. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '全店的人都抬头看我。' [Panel 2 (shotId 119, bottom small panel)]: Full shot. 江迟 walks into the shop with his head held high and long strides, his chin lifted high. He completely ignores the surrounding stares. The surrounding customers are drawn as gray background figures, while only 江迟 is in bright, vivid colors. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我不管。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P49.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "4053d16d-2f7d-4de7-ba8b-63f142321ee4"], "shots": [{"shotId": "118", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "全店的人都抬头看我。", "storyboardDetails": "全景+拉镜头：咖啡店内的全景。所有的顾客和正在擦桌子的店员都停下了手中的动作。数十双眼睛齐刷刷地转头看向门口的方向，每个人的脸上都带着惊讶、错愕的表情，画面瞬间定格。"}, {"shotId": "119", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我不管。", "storyboardDetails": "全景+固定镜头：江迟昂首挺胸，大步流星地走进店内。他目不斜视，下巴高高抬起，对周围聚集过来的目光完全视若无睹，周围的顾客被画成灰色的背景板，唯有江迟色彩鲜明。"}], "sort_order": 18}, {"id": "7b32a922-49a7-4d74-b66e-98a64b0125b2", "page_id": "P50", "layout_type": "L12 上1下2·下不等分 (上65%, 下35%按4:6分)", "page_purpose": "完成‘抓奸’肢体冲突，并展现吼完后的本能心虚", "visual_focus": "拽起陆承衍的大动作与咆哮框", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L12 top and bottom split, top takes 65%, bottom takes 35% and is split vertically in a 4:6 ratio. [Panel 1 (shotId 120, top large panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 rushes to the table by the window like a gust of wind. He extends both hands, tightly grabbing 陆承衍's arm and yanking him half-standing out of his chair, motion lines trailing from the chair legs on the floor. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我直直冲到窗边，一把拽住陆承衍的胳膊，把他拽起。' [Panel 2 (shotId 121, bottom left panel)]: Close-up, tilted angle. 江迟's mouth is wide open showing white teeth, his eyebrows pointing sharply down, glaring fiercely at 陆承衍. A giant jagged explosion-style speech bubble points to 江迟, containing the Chinese text '陆承衍！' [Panel 3 (shotId 122, bottom right panel)]: Medium close-up. 江迟's eyes slightly round and wide, his body rigidly holding the pulling posture. His long eyelashes tremble slightly. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '声音大得连我自己都吓一跳。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P50.png", "reference_ids": ["2976068e-d8d6-4374-b2d0-690cbe1189c0", "7705e1b4-1ea1-47b0-8e70-c099fc6e57b7"], "shots": [{"shotId": "120", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我直直冲到窗边，一把拽住陆承衍的胳膊，把他拽起。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+推镜头：江迟一阵风似地冲到靠窗的桌前。他伸出双手，一把紧紧死拽住陆承衍的手臂。凭借着冲力，将陆承衍从椅子上拽得半站起身，椅子腿在地板上划出动势线。"}, {"shotId": "121", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "「陆承衍！」", "storyboardDetails": "特写+倾斜构图：江迟嘴巴大张，露出洁白的牙齿，眉头倒竖。他双眼冒火地怒视着陆承衍，四周布满表示极大音量的爆炸状气泡框，里面写着巨大的文字，震撼力十足。"}, {"shotId": "122", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "声音大得连我自己都吓一跳。", "storyboardDetails": "中近景+固定镜头：江迟吼完之后，自己似乎也被音量震到了。他的眼睛微微睁圆，身体保持着拽人的动作有一瞬间的僵硬僵直，长长的睫毛轻轻颤抖了一下，表情有一丝呆萌的空白。"}], "sort_order": 19}, {"id": "164c4a94-26b3-46ba-b216-36ec8da97d36", "page_id": "P51", "layout_type": "L18 垂直通栏·顶窄底宽递增", "page_purpose": "火力全开，进行正牌妻子的无理取闹式控诉", "visual_focus": "从挑衅到委屈最终贴脸宣告主权的情绪大爆发", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L18 vertical single column with three panels, narrow at the top and gradually widening towards the bottom. [Panel 1 (shotId 123, top narrow panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟's one hand still tightly grips 陆承衍's arm, while his other hand extends an index finger pointing straight at 傅时深 across the table. He lifts his chin, eyebrows raised. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '这就是你外面偷偷养的男朋友？' [Panel 2 (shotId 124, center medium panel)]: Medium close-up. 江迟's peach-blossom eyes are wide open, lips moving quickly. His fingers gesture back and forth between himself and 傅时深, the rims of his eyes slightly red from excitement. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '你太过分了，他不就比我高那半个头吗？他不就比我长的好点吗？' [Panel 3 (shotId 125, bottom wide panel)]: Medium shot, tilted angle. 江迟 slams both hands forcefully onto the tabletop, leaning his body far forward, his face almost pressing in front of 陆承衍's face. Tears glisten at the corners of his eyes. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '你要他不要你老婆我？我可是你老婆！'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P51.png", "reference_ids": ["c0ae88b2-98fc-4aa1-9f69-83f80400a692", "5f77de60-9cfb-4c53-9ad4-da83d3420e05", "bcfc6577-fe4d-41a8-815d-32f303139801"], "shots": [{"shotId": "123", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "「这就是你外面偷偷养的男朋友？", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：江迟一只手依然死死抓着陆承衍的手臂，另一只手伸出食指，直直地指向对面的傅时深。他扬起下巴，眉头挑高，满脸都是理直气壮的质问与挑衅。"}, {"shotId": "124", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "你太过分了，他不就比我高那半个头吗？他不就比我长的好点吗？", "storyboardDetails": "中近景+固定镜头：江迟瞪大漂亮的桃花眼，嘴唇快速地开合。他的手指在自己和傅时深之间来回比划，眼眶因为激动而微微泛红，表情充满委屈和强烈的控诉感。"}, {"shotId": "125", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "你要他不要你老婆我？我可是你老婆！」", "storyboardDetails": "中景+倾斜构图：江迟双手用力拍在桌面上，身体大幅度前倾，整个人几乎凑到了陆承衍的面前。他大声宣告着，眼角带着屈辱的泪光，两人的脸距离极近，气氛紧张且戏剧化。"}], "sort_order": 20}, {"id": "cb535d80-215c-432a-9418-2ca24fd167c2", "page_id": "P52", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "展示江迟利用外貌优势装出惹人怜爱的虚伪泪水", "visual_focus": "极度精致漂亮的面容和恰到好处滑落的唯美泪滴", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L17 vertical single column with three panels of large, medium, and small sizes from top to bottom. [Panel 1 (shotId 126, top large panel)]: Extreme close-up. 江迟's fair, delicate face. A crystal-clear teardrop perfectly slides down from his reddened eye corner, catching the sunlight, and splashing tiny water droplets as it hits the dark table. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '喊完，还很是应景的掉出来几滴眼泪。' [Panel 2 (shotId 127, center medium panel)]: Medium close-up. 江迟 tilts his head up slightly, looking at 陆承衍. His eyes are watery and shimmering, the tip of his nose slightly red, lips gently pursed. Tears slowly flow down his cheeks. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我长的白，五官精致，桃花眼掉眼泪的时候，' [Panel 3 (shotId 128, bottom small panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟's eyelashes are dotted with tiny teardrops, his shoulders trembling slightly. Both hands clutch 陆承衍's sleeve, his knuckles slightly white. He shrinks himself into a ball, floating broken heart effects surrounding him. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '很有一种小可怜的模样。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P52.png", "reference_ids": ["c0ae88b2-98fc-4aa1-9f69-83f80400a692", "5f77de60-9cfb-4c53-9ad4-da83d3420e05"], "shots": [{"shotId": "126", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "喊完，还很是应景的掉出来几滴眼泪。", "storyboardDetails": "大特写+固定镜头：江迟白皙精致的面庞。一滴晶莹剔透的泪珠恰到好处地从他泛红的眼角滑落，折射着窗外的阳光，最终滴落在深色的桌面上，溅起细小的水花。"}, {"shotId": "127", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我长的白，五官精致，桃花眼掉眼泪的时候，", "storyboardDetails": "中近景+固定镜头：江迟微微仰起头，看着陆承衍。他的桃花眼水光潋滟，鼻尖微红，嘴唇轻轻抿着，五官在柔和的光线下显得异常精致漂亮，眼泪顺着脸颊缓缓流下。"}, {"shotId": "128", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "很有一种小可怜的模样。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：江迟眼睫毛上沾着细碎的泪珠，肩膀微微抽动。他双手揪着陆承衍的衣袖，手指骨节微微泛白，整个人缩成一团，展现出一种极其惹人怜爱的小可怜姿态，周围漂浮着心碎的特效。"}], "sort_order": 21}, {"id": "7fe951a1-52bb-4e86-9fbd-7fbc1b99d209", "page_id": "P53", "layout_type": "L07 上下双分·均等 (50%+50%)", "page_purpose": "画风突变，揭开装可怜面具后的心机，增加喜剧感", "visual_focus": "练功房视角的搞笑反差与转瞬即逝的狡黠笑容", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L07 top and bottom split evenly (50%+50%). [Panel 1 (shotId 129, top panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 stands in front of a bathroom mirror. He uses two fingers to pull down his lower eyelids, forcing his eyes wide open to squeeze out tears. Eye drops sit next to the mirror. Humorous comedy filter over the image. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '当然了，这个怎么掉眼泪，我也是对着镜子练过的。' [Panel 2 (shotId 130, bottom panel)]: Close-up. On 江迟's tear-stained face, the corners of his mouth turn up extremely slightly into a fleeting, cunning, and triumphant smile. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '没办法，自己的老公太难勾了，总得下点功夫的。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P53.png", "reference_ids": ["c0ae88b2-98fc-4aa1-9f69-83f80400a692"], "shots": [{"shotId": "129", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "当然了，这个怎么掉眼泪，我也是对着镜子练过的。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头（脑补画面）：江迟站在洗手间的镜子前。他用两根手指扒拉着自己的下眼睑，眼睛努力瞪大，试图挤出眼泪。镜子旁放着眼药水，画面带有幽默的喜剧滤镜。"}, {"shotId": "130", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "没办法，自己的老公太难勾了，总得下点功夫的。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：江迟挂着泪珠的脸上，嘴角极小幅度地向上扬了一下，露出了一个转瞬即逝、充满狡黠和得意的笑容，眼中闪过一丝精明，随即迅速恢复楚楚可怜的表情。"}], "sort_order": 22}, {"id": "e297eb78-ae00-4c67-931e-76604458fa25", "page_id": "P54", "layout_type": "L20 垂直通栏·大-窄-大夹层", "page_purpose": "陆承衍对于江迟突如其来大闹的反应，化解冰冷距离", "visual_focus": "陆承衍神情变化的连环分镜，以及最终破冰的宠溺笑容", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L20 vertical single column with large-narrow-large sandwich structure. [Panel 1 (shotId 131, top large panel)]: Medium shot. 陆承衍 slowly turns his head while being pulled. His gaze lands steadily on 江迟's tear-stained face, sunlight illuminating his profile. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '陆承衍转头看我。' [Panel 2 (shotId 132, center narrow panel)]: A sequence of three close-ups in one panel. First, 陆承衍's pupils slightly dilate and eyebrows furrow. Second, he sighs gently, his knitted brows relaxing. Third, the corners of his mouth lift uncontrollably into a smile. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '表情从错愕，到无奈，最后却笑了。' [Panel 3 (shotId 133, bottom large panel)]: Close-up. 陆承衍 lowers his head and laughs softly, his broad shoulders trembling slightly. His eyes are full of deep doting fondness, the lighting creating a warm and affectionate atmosphere. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '笑的很是有些莫名其妙的那种。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P54.png", "reference_ids": ["5f77de60-9cfb-4c53-9ad4-da83d3420e05", "c0ae88b2-98fc-4aa1-9f69-83f80400a692"], "shots": [{"shotId": "131", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "陆承衍转头看我。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：陆承衍被拽着，慢慢侧过头。他的目光平稳地落在江迟满是泪痕的脸上，眼神专注，阳光从侧面打亮他的轮廓。"}, {"shotId": "132", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "表情从错愕，到无奈，最后却笑了。", "storyboardDetails": "连环分镜（三个特写格）：第一格，陆承衍瞳孔微扩，眉头微皱，显得错愕；第二格，他轻轻叹了口气，紧锁的眉头缓缓舒展，透出无奈；第三格，他的嘴角不受控制地上扬，眼中浮现出笑意。"}, {"shotId": "133", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "笑的很是有些莫名其妙的那种。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+推镜头：陆承衍低下头低低地笑出声，宽阔的肩膀微微颤抖。他的眼神中带着浓浓的宠溺与一丝无奈，目光柔和得仿佛能滴出水来，光线渲染出温馨暧昧的氛围。"}], "sort_order": 23}, {"id": "f7ba6bfa-5780-43f8-ab92-cbe5f6f09ea7", "page_id": "P55", "layout_type": "L07 上下双分·均等 (50%+50%)", "page_purpose": "展现出乎意料的温柔肢体接触，将气氛推向暧昧高潮", "visual_focus": "有力揽腰的手臂与轻揉发丝的温柔动作", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L07 top and bottom split evenly (50%+50%). [Panel 1 (shotId 134, top panel)]: Medium shot. 陆承衍 wraps his long, strong arm around 江迟's slender waist, pulling 江迟 close to his own body. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '还伸手揽住了我的腰。' [Panel 2 (shotId 135, bottom panel)]: Close-up. 陆承衍's large hand gently covers the top of 江迟's head. His long fingers intertwine in 江迟's soft hair, gently ruffling it. Tiny light spots sprinkle over their hands and hair. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '另外一只手还放我脑袋上，摸了摸我的头发。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P55.png", "reference_ids": ["5f77de60-9cfb-4c53-9ad4-da83d3420e05", "c0ae88b2-98fc-4aa1-9f69-83f80400a692"], "shots": [{"shotId": "134", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "还伸手揽住了我的腰。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：陆承衍伸出修长有力的手臂，一把揽住江迟纤细的腰身。他稍一用力，将江迟拉近自己的身体，两人的距离瞬间拉近，衣料互相摩擦。"}, {"shotId": "135", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "另外一只手还放我脑袋上，摸了摸我的头发。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：陆承衍宽大的手掌轻轻覆盖在江迟的头顶。他修长的手指穿插在江迟柔软的发丝中，温柔地揉弄着。细碎的光斑洒在两人的手上和头发上，充满安抚的意味。"}], "sort_order": 24}, {"id": "64f47f3d-21d6-438c-8df7-cbaeae13bbde", "page_id": "P56", "layout_type": "L06 上下双分·上小下大 (30%+70%)", "page_purpose": "顺杆爬的江迟彻底放飞自我，以强吻和撒娇宣誓主权", "visual_focus": "夸张吧唧一口的动感与粉色泡泡背景下的矫揉造作", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L06 top and bottom split, top takes 30%, bottom takes 70%. [Panel 1 (shotId 136, top small panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟's eyes widen suddenly. He holds 陆承衍's cheeks with both hands, standing high on his tiptoes, pouting his lips to kiss 陆承衍 heavily on the cheek. A giant 'mwah' sound effect text and pink hearts appear next to them. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '给我激动的，直接就对着他的脸吧唧一口。' [Panel 2 (shotId 137, bottom large panel)]: Medium close-up. 江迟 tightly wraps his arms around 陆承衍's neck, tilting his head with blinking eyes and pouting lips. His cheeks have a faint blush, background filled with pink flowers. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '老公，人家也想喝咖啡的拉，你怎么不带我来喝咖啡？'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P56.png", "reference_ids": ["c0ae88b2-98fc-4aa1-9f69-83f80400a692", "5f77de60-9cfb-4c53-9ad4-da83d3420e05"], "shots": [{"shotId": "136", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "给我激动的，直接就对着他的脸吧唧一口。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：江迟先是眼睛猛地瞪大，随后满脸惊喜。他双手捧住陆承衍的脸颊，高高踮起脚尖，嘟起嘴唇，重重地在陆承衍的侧脸上亲了一口，旁边配上一个巨大的“吧唧”音效字和粉色爱心。"}, {"shotId": "137", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "「老公，人家也想喝咖啡的拉，你怎么不带我来喝咖啡？」", "storyboardDetails": "中近景+固定镜头：江迟双手紧紧搂住陆承衍的脖子，歪着脑袋，眼睛扑闪扑闪地眨着。他微微嘟起嘴，脸颊泛着淡淡的红晕，完全是一副娇纵撒娇的模样，背景全是粉红色的花朵。"}], "sort_order": 25}, {"id": "5f2bd3ac-c930-464b-90a5-21c4f714321c", "page_id": "P57", "layout_type": "L06 上下双分·上小下大 (30%+70%)", "page_purpose": "章节惊天反转，‘情敌’揭露认识江迟的事实，造成悬念与喜剧结尾", "visual_focus": "暴怒的傅时深充满压迫感的气场对比江迟探出头的巨大问号", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere. Page layout is L06 top and bottom split, top takes 30%, bottom takes 70%. [Panel 1 (shotId 138, top small panel)]: Medium shot, tilted angle. 傅时深 suddenly stands up, pressing his hands hard onto the tabletop with knuckles turning white. His eyebrows are locked into a tight knot, his gaze icy as a knife aiming at 江迟. Black fiery anger lines border the frame. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 傅时深's mouth, contains the Chinese text '江迟，你在干什么？' [Panel 2 (shotId 139, bottom large panel)]: Medium shot. 江迟 turns his head upon hearing the voice, poking half of his head out from 陆承衍's embrace. He blinks his tear-stained eyes, eyebrows slightly knit, looking at the furious 傅时深 across the table with a blank face. A giant question mark pops up above 江迟's head. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我莫名其妙的看了我老公对面坐着的那男人一眼。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P57.png", "reference_ids": ["bcfc6577-fe4d-41a8-815d-32f303139801", "c0ae88b2-98fc-4aa1-9f69-83f80400a692", "5f77de60-9cfb-4c53-9ad4-da83d3420e05"], "shots": [{"shotId": "138", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "「江迟，你在干什么？」", "storyboardDetails": "中景+倾斜构图：对面的傅时深猛地站起身，双手用力撑在桌面上，骨节泛白。他眉头紧锁成一个死结，眼神冰冷如刀，直刺向江迟的方向。画面边缘布满黑色的怒火线条，压迫感极强。"}, {"shotId": "139", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我莫名其妙的看了我老公对面坐着的那男人一眼。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：江迟听到声音转过头，从陆承衍的怀里探出半个脑袋。他眨了眨挂着泪珠的眼睛，眉头微蹙，一脸茫然且无辜地看着对面满脸怒容的傅时深，头顶冒出一个巨大的问号。"}], "sort_order": 26}]}, {"id": "18158f31-51ac-46c9-a79a-111b48486392", "title": "恢复记忆后的社死现场", "sort_order": 2, "pages": [{"id": "b5aea238-8a95-43f5-b788-32be018c0eb2", "page_id": "P58", "layout_type": "L18 垂直通栏·顶窄底宽递增", "page_purpose": "展示江迟不知死活的挑衅，情绪不断放大", "visual_focus": "江迟从嫌弃到挑衅再到假装委屈的表情变化递进", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere, bright warm tones, soft natural lighting, fresh and airy feel, gentle color transitions, hints of peach pink and warm beige, clean white highlights, light and cheerful mood. Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes, natural emotional expressions, graceful hand gestures, fashionable modern clothing, well-groomed hairstyles. The page layout is a vertical column layout, narrow at the top and gradually widening at the bottom. [Panel 1 (Top narrow panel)]: Medium close-up, fixed camera. Inside a modern coffee shop with cozy atmosphere. 江迟 turns 江迟's head to look at 傅时深 opposite 江迟, 江迟's brows slightly furrowed, corners of 江迟's mouth turned down, conveying confusion. 傅时深 stands opposite, expressionless. Side backlighting hits 江迟 and 傅时深's side profiles. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing to 江迟's mouth, contains the Chinese text '这人有病吧。' [Panel 2 (Middle panel)]: 