么回事的时候，", "storyboardDetails": "中景+推镜头：咖啡店内。傅时深突然从座位上站起来，高大的身躯遮住了一部分窗外的光线，在江迟脸上投下阴影。江迟瞳孔微缩，嘴唇微张。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：傅时深起身的压迫感与身形阴影。"}, {"shotId": "144", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "那男人起身，直接过来，把我拽了过去。", "storyboardDetails": "全景+跟镜头：咖啡店内。傅时深大步迈到江迟面前，单手抓住江迟的手腕，用力往自己方向拉扯。江迟身体失去平衡前倾。陆承衍坐在原位，手停在半空。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：傅时深强有力的抓腕动作与江迟倾倒的身躯。"}, {"shotId": "145", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "拽进了他的怀里。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：咖啡店内。江迟重重撞进傅时深的胸膛，傅时深双臂环住江迟的肩膀。江迟双手下意识抵在傅时深胸前，眼睛睁大。暖黄光线洒在两人身上。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：两人身体紧贴的冲击感与江迟抵住胸口的双手。"}], "sort_order": 1}, {"id": "4bc33d94-48f1-4292-824f-37712fe23940", "page_id": "P60", "layout_type": "L13 上2下1·上均分 (上45%平分, 下55%)", "page_purpose": "突发变故导致江迟处于极度受惊状态", "visual_focus": "江迟夸张放大的震动反应细节", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere, bright warm tones, soft natural lighting, fresh and airy feel, gentle color transitions, hints of peach pink and warm beige, clean white highlights, light and cheerful mood. Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes, natural emotional expressions, graceful hand gestures, fashionable modern clothing, well-groomed hairstyles. The page layout features two equally split panels on the top (45% height) and one large panel on the bottom (55% height). [Panel 1 (Top left panel)]: Close-up, fixed camera. Inside a coffee shop. Extreme close-up of 江迟's eyes, pupils rapidly expanding, eyelashes slightly trembling, stray hair on 江迟's forehead lifting. Background completely blurred out, a giant question mark visual symbol appears. A white speech bubble with soft shadow, pointing towards the center, contains the Chinese text '？' [Panel 2 (Top right panel)]: Extreme close-