ransitions, hints of peach pink and warm beige, clean white highlights, light and cheerful mood. Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes, natural emotional expressions, graceful hand gestures, fashionable modern clothing, well-groomed hairstyles. The page layout consists of three equally divided vertical panels. [Panel 1 (Top panel)]: Medium shot, fixed camera. Inside a coffee shop. 江迟 struggles in 傅时深's arms, 江迟's eyes subconsciously darting towards 陆承衍's direction, corners of 江迟's eyes drooping, lips tightly pursed. 傅时深's arms lock 江迟 securely like iron pincers. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我刚刚可没勾他啊，我勾的是我自己的老公啊。' [Panel 2 (Middle panel)]: Close-up, push-in camera. Inside a coffee shop. Two pink blushes appear on 江迟's cheeks, 江迟's eyes blink rapidly, gaze wandering unstably, avoiding direct eye contact, teeth gently biting lower lip. Soft light from the coffee shop hits 江迟's hair. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我的魅力那么大的？' [Panel 3 (Bottom panel)]: Medium shot, fixed camera. Inside a coffee shop. 江迟 opens mouth preparing to speak, 傅时深 lowers head, 傅时深's side profile getting extremely close to 江迟's ear, a shadow covering a small half of 江迟's face. 江迟's body freezes instantly. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我想说点什么，他就在我耳边'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P61.png", "reference_ids": ["c0ae88b2-98fc-4aa1-9f69-83f80400a692", "bcfc6577-fe4d-41a8-815d-32f303139801", "5f77de60-9cfb-4c53-9ad4-da83d3420e05", "4053d16d-2f7d-4de7-ba8b-63f142321ee4"], "shots": [{"shotId": "149", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我刚刚可没勾他啊，我勾的是我自己的老公啊。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：咖啡店内。江迟在傅时深怀里挣扎，眼神下意识往陆承衍的方向瞟去，眼角下垂，嘴角紧抿。傅时深的手臂如同铁钳般牢固地锁着江迟。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：江迟试图向陆承衍求救的视线与挣扎的肢体。"}, {"shotId": "150", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我的魅力那么大的？", "storyboardDetails": "特写+推镜头：咖啡店内。江迟脸颊泛起两抹红晕，眼睛快速眨动，视线游移不定不敢直视，牙齿轻轻咬住下唇。咖啡店的柔光打在发丝上。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：江迟面部泛红咬唇的微小生理反应。"}, {"shotId": "151", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "我想说点什么，他就在我耳边", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：咖啡店内。江迟张开嘴准备说话，傅时深低下头，侧脸贴近江迟的耳廓，阴影覆盖了江迟的小半张脸。江迟身体瞬间僵住。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：傅时深极具侵略性的贴近动作与江迟僵硬的背脊。"}], "sort_order": 3}, {"id": "82c3c9cb-5e84-4835-882f-8918e0a8b357", "page_id": "P62", "layout_type": "L18 垂直通栏·顶窄底宽递增", "page_purpose": "致命称呼引发激烈对视，情绪张力蓄满", "visual_focus": "从暧昧耳语到深邃沉重眼神的压迫力升级", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere, bright warm tones, soft natural lighting, fresh and airy feel, gentle color transitions, hints of peach pink and warm beige, clean white highlights, light and cheerful mood. Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes, natural emotional expressions, graceful hand gestures, fashionable modern clothing, well-groomed hairstyles. The page layout is a vertical column layout, narrow at the top and gradually widening at the bottom. [Panel 1 (Top narrow panel)]: Close-up, fixed camera. Inside a coffee shop. 傅时深's thin lips are extremely close to 江迟's earlobe, 傅时深's lips slightly parted. The tips of 江迟's ears rapidly flush bright red, 江迟's eyes wide open. A white speech bubble with soft shadow contains the Chinese text '「老婆。玩够了吗？玩够了，我们回家了！」' [Panel 2 (Middle panel)]: Medium close-up, fixed camera. Inside a coffee shop. 江迟 quickly raises head, looking directly at 傅时深. 江迟's brows unfold, 傅时深's face reflecting in 江迟's pupils. Sunlight illuminates the side profile contours of both 江迟 and 傅时深. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我猛的抬起头，对上了他的眼睛。' [Panel 3 (Bottom wide panel)]: Extreme close-up, push-in camera. Inside a coffee shop. Close-up of 傅时深's eyes, deep irises with zero highlights, long eyelashes casting heavy shadows underneath, staring directly into the camera from 江迟's point of view. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他眼睛很黑，很沉，像一潭深水。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P62.png", "reference_ids": ["bcfc6577-fe4d-41a8-815d-32f303139801", "c0ae88b2-98fc-4aa1-9f69-83f80400a692", "4053d16d-2f7d-4de7-ba8b-63f142321ee4"], "shots": [{"shotId": "152", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "「老婆。玩够了吗？玩够了，我们回家了！」", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：咖啡店内。傅时深的薄唇贴近江迟的耳垂，清晰可见傅时深嘴唇的开合。江迟耳尖迅速充血变红，眼睛圆睁。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：唇部与耳朵的极近距离以及江迟通红的耳尖。"}, {"shotId": "153", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我猛的抬起头，对上了他的眼睛。", "storyboardDetails": "中近景+固定镜头：咖啡店内。江迟迅速仰起脸，目光直视傅时深。江迟眉头展开，瞳孔中倒映着傅时深的脸。阳光从侧面照亮两人的侧脸轮廓。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：两人视线的激烈交汇与拉近的面部。"}, {"shotId": "154", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "他眼睛很黑，很沉，像一潭深水。", "storyboardDetails": "大特写+推镜头：咖啡店内。傅时深的双眼特写，眼眸深邃，没有一丝高光，长睫毛在眼下投出浓重的阴影，直直盯着镜头（江迟的视角）。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：傅时深压抑深沉且极具侵略性的眼神。"}], "sort_order": 4}, {"id": "d712e703-6f39-4e8b-99b6-86d24a0ef95d", "page_id": "P63", "layout_type": "L05 上下双分·上大下小 (70%+30%)", "page_purpose": "强吻降临，江迟大脑瞬间宕机", "visual_focus": "突如其来的强烈吻戏与江迟石化的反应对比", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere, bright warm tones, soft natural lighting, fresh and airy feel, gentle color transitions, hints of peach pink and warm beige, clean white highlights, light and cheerful mood. Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes, natural emotional expressions, graceful hand gestures, fashionable modern clothing, well-groomed hairstyles. The page layout consists of a large top panel (70%) and a smaller bottom panel (30%). [Panel 1 (Top panel)]: Medium shot, fixed camera. Inside a coffee shop. 傅时深 grabs the back of 江迟's head with one hand, violently tilting head down to kiss 江迟's lips. 江迟's hands hang weakly in mid-air, 江迟's eyes bulging round with shock. Backlight silhouette effect from the window. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '他直接一个低头就堵住了我的嘴。' [Panel 2 (Bottom panel)]: Close-up, fixed camera. Inside a coffee shop. Side view of 江迟 being kissed, 江迟's eyes unblinking, pupils losing focus, body stiff like a wooden board. Background features speed lines showing frozen time. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我愣住了。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P63.png", "reference_ids": ["bcfc6577-fe4d-41a8-815d-32f303139801", "c0ae88b2-98fc-4aa1-9f69-83f80400a692", "4053d16d-2f7d-4de7-ba8b-63f142321ee4"], "shots": [{"shotId": "155", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "他直接一个低头就堵住了我的嘴。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：咖啡店内。傅时深一手扣住江迟的后脑勺，猛地低头吻住江迟的双唇。江迟双手无力地悬在半空，眼睛因为震惊瞪得滚圆。窗边逆光剪影效果。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：充满张力的强吻动作与江迟悬空的手。"}, {"shotId": "156", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "我愣住了。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：咖啡店内。江迟被吻住的侧脸，眼睛一眨不眨，瞳孔失去焦点，身体僵硬得像块木头。背景拉出速度线，表现瞬间的静止。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：江迟如遭雷击的呆滞反应与无焦距的瞳孔。"}], "sort_order": 5}, {"id": "2b9886c6-d79f-4220-8191-f51ba5d28789", "page_id": "P64", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "展示强吻的霸道细节与江迟被强迫的挣扎", "visual_focus": "极具力道感的唇部交叠与手部动作", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cine