g to 江迟's arms hanging down weakly, chest heaving heavily, corners of 江迟's eyes blushing pink. Warm yellow light from the coffee shop spills over 江迟 and 傅时深. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '这混蛋亲了很久。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P65.png", "reference_ids": ["5f77de60-9cfb-4c53-9ad4-da83d3420e05", "bcfc6577-fe4d-41a8-815d-32f303139801", "c0ae88b2-98fc-4aa1-9f69-83f80400a692", "4053d16d-2f7d-4de7-ba8b-63f142321ee4"], "shots": [{"shotId": "160", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "我老公看着啊……", "storyboardDetails": "中远景+固定镜头：咖啡店内。从江迟余光的视角看去，陆承衍坐在不远处的咖啡桌旁，身体前倾，双手交叉握在桌面上，面色阴沉地盯着这边。画面虚实结合。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：背景中陆承衍冷峻的注视与交叉的双手。"}, {"shotId": "160_INSERT", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "", "storyboardDetails": ""}, {"shotId": "161", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "这混蛋亲了很久。", "storyboardDetails": "中景+固定镜头：咖啡店内。傅时深紧紧搂着江迟，江迟从最初的抗拒变得双手无力地垂下，胸口剧烈起伏，眼角泛起红晕。咖啡店暖黄光线洒在两人身上。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：亲吻造成的体力流失与江迟垂下的双臂。"}], "sort_order": 7}, {"id": "ae43d770-20cb-45bd-ae3f-3a57581556cc", "page_id": "P66", "layout_type": "L17 垂直通栏·大中小错落", "page_purpose": "被强吻刺激导致记忆彻底回归", "visual_focus": "犹如大梦初醒的眼神聚焦与确认真老公的特写", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere, bright warm tones, soft natural lighting, fresh and airy feel, gentle color transitions, hints of peach pink and warm beige, clean white highlights, light and cheerful mood. Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes, natural emotional expressions, graceful hand gestures, fashionable modern clothing, well-groomed hairstyles. The page layout features vertically staggered panels. [Panel 1 (Top panel)]: Close-up, push-in camera. Inside a coffee shop. 江迟 violently opens eyes, pupils instantly contracting and focusing, previously furrowed brows completely smoothing out. A visual effect of shattering glass fragments explodes in the background. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '亲到我忽然就记起来了。' [Panel 2 (Middle panel)]: Extreme close-up, fixed camera. Inside a coffee shop. Side profile of 傅时深, prominent high nose bridge, deep-set eyes, sharp jawline, cool white skin beautifully textured under natural light. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '傅时深。' [Panel 3 (Bottom panel)]: Close-up, fixed camera. Inside a coffee shop. From 江迟's perspective, looking at 傅时深 slightly panting after releasing the kiss, 傅时深's lips glistening with moisture. 江迟's pupils enlarge, 江迟's lips trembling slightly. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我亲老公。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P66.png", "reference_ids": ["c0ae88b2-98fc-4aa1-9f69-83f80400a692", "bcfc6577-fe4d-41a8-815d-32f303139801", "4053d16d-2f7d-4de7-ba8b-63f142321ee4"], "shots": [{"shotId": "162", "sortOrder": 0, "content": "亲到我忽然就记起来了。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+推镜头：咖啡店内。江迟猛地睁开双眼，瞳孔瞬间收缩聚焦，原本紧皱的眉头一下子舒展开，大量碎裂的画面特效在背景炸开。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：江迟犹如大梦初醒的瞬间神态与聚焦的瞳孔。"}, {"shotId": "163", "sortOrder": 1, "content": "傅时深。", "storyboardDetails": "大特写+固定镜头：咖啡店内。傅时深的侧脸特写，高挺的鼻梁，深邃的眉眼，清晰的下颌线，冷白皮在自然光下质感分明。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：傅时深极具辨识度的完美侧脸轮廓。"}, {"shotId": "164", "sortOrder": 2, "content": "我亲老公。", "storyboardDetails": "特写+固定镜头：咖啡店内。江迟的视角，看着傅时深松开自己后微微喘息的模样，傅时深嘴唇沾着水光。江迟瞳孔放大，嘴唇微颤。中国现代商业条漫质感。漫画视觉重点：江迟视线中的傅时深与微颤的嘴唇。"}], "sort_order": 8}, {"id": "b5aeaed8-c740-4102-a93a-bf2ddfd3be12", "page_id": "P67", "layout_type": "L15 垂直通栏·三等三连", "page_purpose": "现实与记忆对撞，江迟察觉到毁天灭地的社死真相", "visual_focus": "从慌乱张望到彻底崩溃抱头的夸张颜艺", "image_prompt": "3:4 aspect ratio, vertical comic page, designed for mobile phone scrolling. Chinese modern commercial vertical scroll comic style, clean and smooth line art, bright and warm color palette, soft pastel tones, fresh and elegant visual feel, cinematic storyboard composition, optimized for mobile reading, romantic and youthful atmosphere, bright warm tones, soft natural lighting, fresh and airy feel, gentle color transitions, hints of peach pink and warm beige, clean white highlights, light and cheerful mood. Normal realistic human proportions, delicate Eastern facial features, expressive sparkling eyes, natural emotional expressions, graceful hand gestures, fashionable modern clothing, well-groomed hairstyles. The page layout consists of three equal vertical panels. [Panel 1 (Top panel)]: Medium shot, fixed camera. Inside a coffee shop. The panel is split in half. Left side: a memory of 傅时深 wearing casual loungewear holding a glass of water. Right side: present reality of 傅时深 standing in a formal suit. 江迟 covers 江迟's own mouth with both hands. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '真老公。' [Panel 2 (Middle panel)]: Wide shot, fixed camera. Inside a coffee shop. 江迟 stands in the middle, head turning rapidly like a rattle, looking left at 傅时深, then quickly snapping right to look at 陆承衍 sitting at the table, 江迟's shoulders stiff and tense. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我看看傅时深，再看看陆承衍。' [Panel 3 (Bottom panel)]: Close-up, slanted composition. Inside a coffee shop. 江迟 holds 江迟's own head with both hands, eyes wide as saucers, mouth forming a giant 'O' shape, a drop of cold sweat sliding down from 江迟's temple. Exclamation marks fill the background. A soft white rounded rectangular text box contains the Chinese narrative text '我好像在过去失忆的一个月里，做了什么不得了的事情。'", "image_url": "/storage/0c989dfb-deaa-40a0-9b98-c5ce99c78cea/generation/fb9596c3-b6ad-4b31-a918-70cc6dce4b30/P67.png", "reference_ids": ["bcfc6577-fe4d-41